    { "Actualizar", "Update" },
    { "Actualizar miniaturas de poses", "Update pose thumbnails" },
    { "Actualizar precálculo", "Update prebuild" },
    { "Actueel", "Up to date" },
    { "Actívalo si los bloqueos de seguimiento no funcionan correctamente junto con otras herramientas.", "Enable this if tracking locks do not work correctly alongside other tools." },
    { "Acuan panjang posisi", "Position length reference" },
    { "Acuan panjang tidak didukung: {0}", "Unsupported length reference: {0}" },
    { "Acuan posisi tangan atau kaki, seperti Head, Hips, lutut, atau ViewPosition (posisi mata). ViewPosition mengikuti gerakan kepala.", "The reference used to measure hand or foot placement, such as Head, Hips, a knee, or ViewPosition (eye position). ViewPosition follows head movement." },
    { "Acuan tujuan", "Target reference" },
    { "Ad", "Name" },
    { "Ada göre ara", "Search by name" },
    { "Ada kesalahan konfigurasi. Buka pemeriksaan pengaturan di Inspector.", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Ada perubahan yang belum disimpan. Simpan?", "You have unsaved changes. Save them?" },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour a échoué. Un autre outil a peut-être signalé une erreur auparavant. Corrigez la première erreur pertinente de la Console avant de recompiler ou téléverser l'avatar.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour başarısız oldu. Başka bir araç daha önce hata vermiş olabilir. Avatarı yeniden derlemeden veya yüklemeden önce Console'daki ilgili ilk hatayı çözün.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour epäonnistui. Toinen työkalu on voinut aiheuttaa aiemman virheen. Korjaa Consolen ensimmäinen asiaan liittyvä virhe ennen avatarin uutta koontia tai latausta.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour falhou. Outra ferramenta pode ter gerado um erro anterior. Resolva o primeiro erro relevante da Console antes de compilar ou enviar o avatar novamente.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour falló. Otra herramienta puede haber generado un error anterior. Resuelve el primer error relevante de la Console antes de volver a compilar o subir el avatar.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour gagal. Alat lain mungkin mengalami kesalahan sebelumnya. Atasi kesalahan terkait pertama di Console sebelum melakukan build atau mengunggah avatar lagi.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour is mislukt. Een ander gereedschap heeft mogelijk eerder een fout veroorzaakt. Los de eerste relevante Console-fout op voordat je de avatar opnieuw bouwt of uploadt.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour ist fehlgeschlagen. Ein anderes Werkzeug hat möglicherweise zuvor einen Fehler ausgelöst. Behebe den ersten relevanten Console-Fehler, bevor du den Avatar erneut baust oder hochlädst.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour mislykkedes. Et andet værktøj kan have udløst en tidligere fejl. Ret den første relevante Console-fejl, før du bygger eller uploader avataren igen.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour mislyktes. Et annet verktøy kan ha gitt en tidligere feil. Rett den første relevante feilen i Console før avataren bygges eller lastes opp igjen.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour misslyckades. Ett annat verktyg kan ha orsakat ett tidigare fel. Lös det första relevanta felet i Console innan du bygger eller laddar upp avataren igen.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour non riuscito. Un altro strumento potrebbe aver segnalato un errore precedente. Risolvi il primo errore pertinente nella Console prima di compilare o caricare di nuovo l'avatar.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour thất bại. Công cụ khác có thể đã gây lỗi trước đó. Sửa lỗi liên quan đầu tiên trong Console trước khi dựng hoặc tải avatar lên lần nữa.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour विफल हुआ। किसी दूसरे टूल ने पहले त्रुटि दी हो सकती है। अवतार दोबारा बिल्ड या अपलोड करने से पहले Console की पहली संबंधित त्रुटि ठीक करें।", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour ব্যর্থ হয়েছে। অন্য টুলে আগে কোনো ত্রুটি হয়ে থাকতে পারে। অ্যাভাটার আবার বিল্ড বা আপলোডের আগে Console-এর প্রথম সংশ্লিষ্ট ত্রুটি ঠিক করুন।", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour தோல்வியுற்றது. வேறு கருவியில் முன்னரே பிழை ஏற்பட்டிருக்கலாம். அவதாரை மீண்டும் கட்டமைக்க அல்லது பதிவேற்றுமுன் Console-இன் முதல் தொடர்புடைய பிழையைச் சரிசெய்யவும்.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour విఫలమైంది. మరొక సాధనంలో ముందే లోపం జరిగి ఉండవచ్చు. అవతార్‌ను మళ్లీ నిర్మించే లేదా అప్‌లోడ్ చేసే ముందు Consoleలో మొదటి సంబంధిత లోపాన్ని సరిచేయండి.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour ล้มเหลว เครื่องมืออื่นอาจเกิดข้อผิดพลาดก่อนหน้านี้ แก้ข้อผิดพลาดที่เกี่ยวข้องรายการแรกใน Console ก่อนบิลด์หรืออัปโหลดอวาตาร์อีกครั้ง", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviourに失敗しました。多くの場合原因は別のツールなどにエラーが発生していることです。アバタービルド・アップロード前にConsoleウィンドウを確認してエラーを解消してから再度お試しください", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour失敗。其他工具可能已先產生錯誤。請先解決Console中最早的相關錯誤，再重新建置或上傳虛擬化身。", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour失败。其他工具可能已先产生错误。请先解决Console中最早的相关错误，再重新构建或上传头像。", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour에 실패했습니다. 다른 도구가 앞서 오류를 발생시켰을 수 있습니다. 아바타를 다시 빌드하거나 업로드하기 전에 Console의 관련 첫 오류를 해결해 주세요.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again." },
