    { "Animator का Avatar फ़ील्ड None या Missing है।", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator का Avatar फ़ील्ड खाली है। Inspector में “सेटिंग जाँचें” देखें।", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator के Avatar फ़ील्ड में इसी अवतार के मूल मॉडल का Humanoid Avatar वापस लगाएँ। इसी मॉडल की Avatar एसेट इस्तेमाल करें।", "Restore the Humanoid Avatar for this avatar’s original model in the Animator Avatar field. Use the Avatar asset for this model." },
    { "Animator में वैध Humanoid Avatar नहीं है।", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator वाला अवतार नहीं मिला।", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator शर्त में अघोषित पैरामीटर है। फ़ाइल {0} की लेयर {1} में {2} पैरामीटर शर्त में है, लेकिन Animator Controller की Parameters सूची में नहीं है। अनुकूलता के लिए इस पैरामीटर वाले टूल के निर्माता से संपर्क करें।", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator शर्त में असंगत पैरामीटर प्रकार है। फ़ाइल {0} की लेयर {1} में पैरामीटर {2} का प्रकार {3} है, पर शर्त {4} लगाई गई है। इससे सुविधाएँ गलत चल सकती हैं। अनुकूलता के लिए यह पैरामीटर उपयोग करने वाले टूल के निर्माता से संपर्क करें।", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator உள்ள அவதார் கிடைக்கவில்லை.", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator செல்லுபடியான Humanoid Avatar-ஐக் குறிப்பிடவில்லை.", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator நிபந்தனையில் அறிவிக்கப்படாத அளபுரு உள்ளது. {0} கோப்பின் {1} அடுக்கில் {2} அளபுரு நிபந்தனையில் உள்ளது; ஆனால் Animator Controller-இன் Parameters பட்டியலில் இல்லை. பொருந்துதன்மைக்கு இந்த அளபுருவைப் பயன்படுத்தும் கருவியின் உருவாக்குநரைத் தொடர்புகொள்ளவும்.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator நிபந்தனையில் பொருந்தாத அளபுரு வகை உள்ளது. {0} கோப்பின் {1} அடுக்கில் {2} அளபுருவின் வகை {3}; ஆனால் {4} நிபந்தனை பயன்படுத்தப்படுகிறது. இதனால் வசதிகள் தவறாக இயங்கலாம். பொருந்துதன்மைக்கு இந்த அளபுருவைப் பயன்படுத்தும் கருவியின் உருவாக்குநரைத் தொடர்புகொள்ளவும்.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator ఉన్న అవతార్ కనబడలేదు.", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే Humanoid Avatarను సూచించడం లేదు.", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator షరతులో అనుకూలం కాని పరామితి రకం ఉంది. {0} ఫైల్‌లో {1} లేయర్‌లో {2} పరామితి రకం {3}, కానీ షరతు {4} వాడబడింది. దీని వల్ల ఫీచర్లు సరిగా పనిచేయకపోవచ్చు. అనుకూలత కోసం ఈ పరామితిని వాడే సాధనం అభివృద్ధిదారుని సంప్రదించండి.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator షరతులో ప్రకటించని పరామితి ఉంది. {0} ఫైల్‌లో {1} లేయర్ షరతులో {2} వాడబడింది, కానీ Animator Controllerలో Parameters జాబితాలో లేదు. అనుకూలత కోసం ఈ పరామితిని వాడే సాధనం అభివృద్ధిదారుని సంప్రదించండి.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator ท่าที่ใช้ร่วมกันต้องใช้ Animator Controller แบบปกติ", "The shared posing Animator requires a regular Animator Controller." },
    { "Animator ท่าที่ใช้ร่วมกันไม่มี MA Merge Animator", "The shared posing Animator has no MA Merge Animator." },
    { "Animator ไม่ได้อ้างอิง Humanoid Avatar ที่ใช้ได้", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator を持つアバターが見つかりません。", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator 조건에 호환되지 않는 파라미터 타입이 사용되었습니다. 파일 {0}의 레이어 {1}에서 파라미터 {2}는 {3} 타입으로 선언되어 있지만 조건 {4}가 사용되었습니다. 이로 인해 기능이 제대로 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다. 이 파라미터를 사용하는 도구 개발자에게 호환성을 문의해 주세요.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator 조건이 선언되지 않은 파라미터를 참조합니다. 파일 {0}의 레이어 {1}에서 파라미터 {2}가 조건에 사용되지만 Animator Controller의 Parameters 목록에는 없습니다. 이 파라미터를 사용하는 도구 개발자에게 호환성을 문의해 주세요.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator'ın Avatar alanı None veya Missing.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator'ın Avatar alanı boş. Inspector'daki ayar kontrolüne bakın.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator-ehto käyttää yhteensopimatonta parametrityyppiä. Tiedoston {0} tasolla {1} parametri {2} on määritetty tyypiksi {3}, mutta käytössä on ehto {4}. Tämä voi estää toimintoja toimimasta oikein. Kysy yhteensopivuudesta parametria käyttävän työkalun kehittäjältä.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator-ehto viittaa määrittämättömään parametriin. Tiedoston {0} tasolla {1} parametria {2} käytetään ehdossa, mutta se puuttuu Animator Controllerin Parameters-luettelosta. Kysy yhteensopivuudesta parametria käyttävän työkalun kehittäjältä.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator-feltet Avatar er None eller Missing.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator-feltet Avatar er tomt. Se Kontrollér indstillinger i Inspector.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator-fältet Avatar är None eller Missing.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator-fältet Avatar är tomt. Se Kontrollera inställningar i Inspector.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator-komponenten for positurer for pust ble ikke funnet.", "The breathing posing Animator was not found." },
    { "Animator-এ বৈধ Humanoid Avatar নেই।", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator-এর Avatar ঘর খালি। Inspector-এ “সেটিংস পরীক্ষা” দেখুন।", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator-এর Avatar ঘরটি None বা Missing।", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator-এর Avatar ঘরে এই অ্যাভাটারের মূল মডেলের Humanoid Avatar ফিরিয়ে দিন। এই মডেলের Avatar অ্যাসেটই ব্যবহার করুন।", "Restore the Humanoid Avatar for this avatar’s original model in the Animator Avatar field. Use the Avatar asset for this model." },
    { "Animator-এর শর্তে অঘোষিত প্যারামিটার আছে। {0} ফাইলের {1} লেয়ারের শর্তে {2} ব্যবহৃত হলেও Animator Controller-এর Parameters তালিকায় সেটি নেই। সামঞ্জস্যের জন্য এই প্যারামিটার ব্যবহারকারী টুলের নির্মাতাকে জানান।", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator-এর শর্তে অসামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ প্যারামিটার টাইপ আছে। {0} ফাইলের {1} লেয়ারে {2} প্যারামিটারের টাইপ {3}, কিন্তু শর্ত {4} ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে। এতে বৈশিষ্ট্য ঠিকমতো কাজ নাও করতে পারে। সামঞ্জস্যের জন্য এই প্যারামিটার ব্যবহারকারী টুলের নির্মাতাকে জানান।", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator-সহ অ্যাভাটার পাওয়া যায়নি।", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator-இன் Avatar புலம் None அல்லது Missing ஆக உள்ளது.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator-இன் Avatar புலம் காலியாக உள்ளது. Inspector-இன் “அமைப்புகளைச் சரிபார்” பார்க்கவும்.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "AnimatorController przypisany do wspólnego Animator poz w „{0}” jest nieprawidłowy. AnimatorOverrideController i podobne typy kontrolerów nie są obsługiwane.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController přiřazený společnému Animatoru póz na „{0}“ je neplatný. AnimatorOverrideController a podobné typy ovladačů nejsou podporovány.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController som er tilordnet den felles Animator-komponenten for positurer på «{0}», er ugyldig. AnimatorOverrideController og lignende controllertyper støttes ikke.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController yang ditetapkan pada Animator pose bersama di “{0}” tidak valid. AnimatorOverrideController dan jenis controller serupa tidak didukung.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController được gán cho Animator tạo dáng dùng chung trên “{0}” không hợp lệ. Không hỗ trợ AnimatorOverrideController và các loại controller tương tự.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController المعيّن إلى Animator المشترك للوضعيات في «{0}» غير صالح. لا يُدعم AnimatorOverrideController وأنواع وحدات التحكم المشابهة.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController ที่กำหนดให้ Animator ท่าที่ใช้ร่วมกันบน “{0}” ไม่ถูกต้อง ไม่รองรับ AnimatorOverrideController และตัวควบคุมประเภทคล้ายกัน", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController, назначенный общему Animator поз объекта «{0}», некорректен. AnimatorOverrideController и подобные типы контроллеров не поддерживаются.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "AnimatorController, призначений спільному Animator поз об’єкта «{0}», некоректний. AnimatorOverrideController та подібні типи контролерів не підтримуються.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "Animatorin Avatar-kenttä on tyhjä. Katso Inspectorin Tarkista asetukset.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animatorin Avatar-kentässä on None tai Missing.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animatorలో Avatar ఫీల్డ్ None లేదా Missingగా ఉంది.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animatorలో Avatar ఫీల్డ్ ఖాళీ. Inspectorలో “సెట్టింగ్‌లను తనిఖీ చేయి” చూడండి.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "AnimatorにParameterとして登録されていないパラメータが条件式に使われています。「{0}」ファイルの「{1}」というレイヤーで使用されている「{2}」というパラメータが条件式に使われていますが、AnimatorControllerのParametersにはパラメータがありません。使用しているツールやギミックの相性の問題だと思われるため、このパラメータを使用しているツールの開発者に連絡してください", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "AnimatorのAvatarが有効なHumanoidではありません。", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "AnimatorのAvatar欄がNoneまたはMissingです。", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "AnimatorのAvatar欄が未設定です。Inspectorの「設定の確認」の対処手順をご確認ください。", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator未參照有效的Humanoid Avatar。", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator未引用有效的Humanoid Avatar。", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator条件使用了不兼容的参数类型。文件{0}的层{1}中，参数{2}声明为{3}，却使用条件{4}，可能导致功能异常。请联系使用此参数的工具开发者确认兼容性。", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator条件引用了未声明的参数。文件{0}的层{1}中使用了参数{2}，但Animator Controller的Parameters列表中没有此参数。请联系使用此参数的工具开发者确认兼容性。", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator條件使用了不相容的參數類型。檔案{0}的層{1}中，參數{2}宣告為{3}，卻使用條件{4}，可能導致功能異常。請聯絡使用此參數的工具開發者確認相容性。", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator條件參照了未宣告的參數。檔案{0}的層{1}中使用了參數{2}，但Animator Controller的Parameters清單中沒有此參數。請聯絡使用此參數的工具開發者確認相容性。", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Animator的Avatar字段为None或Missing。", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator的Avatar字段为空。请查看Inspector中的“检查设置”。", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator的Avatar欄位為None或Missing。", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator的Avatar欄位為空。請查看Inspector中的「檢查設定」。", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Animator가 있는 아바타를 찾지 못했습니다.", "No avatar with an Animator was found." },
    { "Animator에 유효한 Humanoid Avatar가 지정되어 있지 않습니다.", "The Animator does not reference a valid Humanoid Avatar." },
    { "Animator의 Avatar 필드가 None 또는 Missing입니다.", "The Animator Avatar field is None or Missing." },
    { "Animator의 Avatar 필드가 비어 있습니다. Inspector의 설정 확인을 확인해 주세요.", "The Animator's Avatar field is empty. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
