    { "As poses central e lateral para virar requerem AnimationClips Humanoid.", "The center and side poses for roll over require Humanoid AnimationClips." },
    { "As roupas adicionadas com Modular Avatar são incluídas quando os ícones são refeitos durante a compilação do avatar.", "Outfits added with Modular Avatar are included when icons are retaken during the avatar build." },
    { "Asenna", "Install" },
    { "Asennat työkaluja, jotka vaativat Unity 2019.x:n VRCSDK:n, mutta käytät eri VRCSDK-versiota! Käytä vanhempaa VRCSDK:ta tai odota työkalujen päivityksiä!", "You're installing tools that require VRCSDK for Unity 2019.x but you're using other versions of VRCSDK! Please use older VRCSDK or wait for tool updates!" },
    { "Asennetaanko Cool Posing- ja Unisaki Posing System -lisenssit tälle tietokoneelle?", "Install licenses for Cool Posing and Unisaki Posing System on this computer?" },
    { "Asennetaanko Kawaii Posing- ja Unisaki Posing System -lisenssit tälle tietokoneelle?", "Install licenses for Kawaii Posing and Unisaki Posing System on this computer?" },
    { "Asennetaan…", "Installing..." },
