    { "Asetuksissa on virheitä. Avaa Inspectorin Tarkista asetukset.", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Asigna a Submenu Root un destino de menú dentro de este avatar.", "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root." },
    { "Asigna clips Humanoid para las poses central y lateral. No se admiten BlendTrees, clips Legacy ni clips sin curvas corporales.", "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported." },
    { "Asigna un AnimationClip lateral. Si está vacío, se usa como antes la animación completa para darse vuelta del campo normal.", "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before." },
    { "Asigna un Animator Controller normal a la capa Base del avatar. No se admiten Animator Override Controllers.", "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported." },
    { "Asigna una animación compatible con Mecanim. Si procede de un modelo, comprueba también su configuración Rig.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Asigna una animación en la lista de poses o desactiva esa entrada.", "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry." },
    { "Asigna una imagen o desactiva el icono personalizado para usar los generados.", "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons." },
    { "Asistencia", "Support" },
    { "Assegna a Submenu Root una destinazione del menu all'interno di questo avatar.", "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root." },
    { "Assegna clip Humanoid per le pose centrale e laterale. BlendTrees, clip Legacy e clip senza curve corporee non sono supportati.", "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported." },
    { "Assegna un AnimationClip laterale. Se vuoto, viene usata come prima l'animazione completa per girarsi nel campo normale.", "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before." },
    { "Assegna un Animator Controller normale al layer Base dell'avatar. Gli Animator Override Controllers non sono supportati.", "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported." },
    { "Assegna un'animazione compatibile con Mecanim. Se proviene da un modello, controlla anche le sue impostazioni Rig.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Assegna un'animazione nell'elenco delle pose o disattiva l'elemento.", "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry." },
    { "Assegna un'immagine oppure disattiva l'icona personalizzata per usare le icone generate.", "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons." },
    { "Assets içinde bir klasör ve .anim dosya adı seçin.", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "Assets के अंदर का फ़ोल्डर और .anim फ़ाइल नाम चुनें।", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "Assets 안의 폴더와 .anim 확장자의 파일 이름을 선택해 주세요.", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "Assets-এর ভেতরের ফোল্ডার ও .anim ফাইলের নাম বাছুন।", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "Assets-க்குள் ஒரு கோப்புறையையும் .anim கோப்புப் பெயரையும் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "Assetsలో ఫోల్డర్, .anim ఫైల్ పేరును ఎంచుకోండి.", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
