    { "Auriculaire gauche : écartement", "Left Little Spread" },
    { "Aus Liste entfernen", "Remove from list" },
    { "Aus Zwischenablage\nzu PrefabsHashes hinzufügen", "Add to PrefabsHashes\nfrom clipboard" },
    { "Aus Zwischenablage\nzu PrefabsNames hinzufügen", "Add to PrefabsNames\nfrom clipboard" },
    { "Aus der Avatarskalierung konnte keine gültige feste Länge gemessen werden.", "Could not measure a valid fixed length from the avatar scale." },
    { "Ausrichtung anpassen", "Adjust direction" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps aktif. Jika kaki bergerak tak terduga saat berpose, nonaktifkan di bawah lalu bandingkan. Biarkan jika tidak bermasalah.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps açık. Pozlarda ayaklar beklenmedik biçimde hareket ediyorsa aşağıdan kapatıp karşılaştırın. Sorun yoksa olduğu gibi bırakın.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps er på. Hvis føttene beveger seg uventet under positurer, slå det av nedenfor og sammenlign. La det være som det er hvis det ikke er noe problem.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps er slået til. Hvis fødderne bevæger sig uventet under positurer, slå det fra nedenfor og sammenlign. Lad det være, hvis der ikke er problemer.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps est activé. Si les pieds bougent involontairement pendant les poses, désactivez-le ci-dessous et comparez. Ne modifiez rien si aucun problème ne survient.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps está activado. Si los pies se mueven inesperadamente durante las poses, desactívalo abajo y compara. Déjalo como está si no hay problemas.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps está ativo. Se os pés se moverem inesperadamente durante poses, desative abaixo e compare. Não altere se não houver problema.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps ist aktiv. Bewegen sich deine Füße beim Posen unerwartet, deaktiviere es unten und vergleiche. Ohne Probleme ist keine Änderung nötig.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps je zapnuté. Pokud se chodidla v pózách neočekávaně pohybují, vypněte je níže a porovnejte výsledek. Pokud problém nemáte, nic neměňte.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps jest włączone. Jeśli stopy poruszają się nieoczekiwanie w pozach, wyłącz tę opcję poniżej i porównaj. Jeśli problem nie występuje, pozostaw bez zmian.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps notlarını gizle", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps on käytössä. Jos jalat liikkuvat odottamatta asentojen aikana, poista se käytöstä alla ja vertaa tulosta. Jos ongelmaa ei ole, asetusta ei tarvitse muuttaa.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps staat aan. Bewegen je voeten onverwacht tijdens poses, zet dit hieronder uit en vergelijk. Laat het ongewijzigd als er geen probleem is.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps är på. Om fötterna rör sig oväntat under poser, stäng av det nedan och jämför. Låt det vara om inga problem finns.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps è attivo. Se i piedi si muovono involontariamente durante le pose, disattivalo qui sotto e confronta. Non modificarlo se non ci sono problemi.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps đang bật. Nếu chân cử động bất ngờ khi tạo dáng, tắt bên dưới rồi so sánh. Giữ nguyên nếu không có vấn đề.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps מופעל. אם כפות הרגליים זזות באופן לא צפוי בתנוחות, כבו אותו למטה והשוו. אם אין בעיה, אין צורך לשנות.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps مفعّل. إذا تحركت قدماك على نحو غير متوقع أثناء الوضعيات، فعطّله في الأسفل للمقارنة. اتركه كما هو إذا لم توجد مشكلة.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps की सूचनाएँ छिपाएँ", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps चालू है। पोज़ में पैर अनचाहे हिलें तो नीचे बंद करके तुलना करें। समस्या न हो तो न बदलें।", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps চালু। পোজে পা অনিচ্ছায় নড়লে নিচে বন্ধ করে তুলনা করুন। সমস্যা না থাকলে বদলাবেন না।", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps বিজ্ঞপ্তি লুকান", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps இயக்கத்தில் உள்ளது. போஸின்போது பாதங்கள் எதிர்பாராமல் நகர்ந்தால் கீழே நிறுத்தி ஒப்பிடவும். சிக்கல் இல்லையெனில் மாற்ற வேண்டாம்.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps குறிப்புகளை மறை", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps ఆన్‌లో ఉంది. భంగిమల్లో పాదాలు అనుకోకుండా కదిలితే కింద ఆఫ్ చేసి పోల్చండి. సమస్య లేకపోతే మార్చవద్దు.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps సూచనలు దాచు", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps 안내 숨기기", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps-Hinweise ausblenden", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps-meldingen verbergen", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Auto-Footstepsはオンです。ポーズ中に意図せず足が動く場合は、下のボタンでオフにして比較できます。問題がなければ変更は不要です。", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps已开启。若摆姿势时双脚意外移动，可在下方关闭后比较。若没有问题，则无需更改。", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps已開啟。若擺姿勢時雙腳意外移動，可在下方關閉後比較。若沒有問題，則無需變更。", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Auto-Footsteps가 켜져 있습니다. 포즈 중 발이 예상하지 못하게 움직이면 아래에서 끄고 비교해 주세요. 문제가 없다면 그대로 두세요.", "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue." },
    { "Automaattinen säätöanimaatio luotiin {0} IK-säännöstä.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "Automaattisen säätöanimaation luonti epäonnistui: {0}", "Failed to create the automatic adjustment animation: {0}" },
    { "Automaattista tuontia käytetään luonnin aikana, eikä sitä lisätä tähän luetteloon. Käsin käytöstä poistettuja tai tyhjennettyjä tyyppejä ei täytetä automaattisesti. Palauta automaattinen tuonti Tyhjennä manuaalinen valinta -toiminnolla.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automaticky koriguje rozdíly směru a zkroucení kloubů každého avatara.", "Automatically correct differences in joint direction and twist for each avatar." },
    { "Automaticky zamknout hlavu na zádech", "Auto-Lock Head When Supine" },
    { "Automatická animace korekce vytvořena z pravidel IK: {0}.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "Automatická korekce avatara", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatická korekce končetin", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatická korekce končetin je pro tohoto avatara vypnuta.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatické importy se používají při generování a do tohoto seznamu se nepřidávají. Ručně vypnuté nebo vymazané typy se automaticky nedoplní. Pro návrat automatického importu vymažte ruční výběr.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatisch detecteren", "Auto-detect" },
    { "Automatisch erkennen", "Auto-detect" },
    { "Automatisch geselecteerd omdat Fotomodus dit vereist.", "Selected automatically because Photo Mode requires it." },
    { "Automatisch gewählt, da der Fotomodus dies benötigt.", "Selected automatically because Photo Mode requires it." },
    { "Automatisch geïmporteerde bewegingen worden bij generatie gebruikt en niet aan deze lijst toegevoegd. Handmatig uitgeschakelde of geleegde typen worden niet automatisch aangevuld. Gebruik Handmatige keuze wissen om automatisch importeren te herstellen.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatische Anpassungsanimation aus {0} IK-Regeln erstellt.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "Automatische Anpassungsanimation konnte nicht erstellt werden: {0}", "Failed to create the automatic adjustment animation: {0}" },
    { "Automatische Avatarkorrektur", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatische Gliedmaßenanpassung", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatische Gliedmaßenanpassung aktivieren", "Enable automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatische Gliedmaßenanpassung ist für diesen Avatar deaktiviert.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatische aanpassingsanimatie gemaakt met {0} IK-regels.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "Automatische aanpassingsanimatie maken is mislukt: {0}", "Failed to create the automatic adjustment animation: {0}" },
    { "Automatische avatarcorrectie", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatische ledemaataanpassing", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatische ledemaataanpassing inschakelen", "Enable automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatische ledemaataanpassing is uitgeschakeld voor deze avatar.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatische Übernahmen werden bei der Erstellung verwendet und nicht dieser Liste hinzugefügt. Manuell deaktivierte oder geleerte Typen werden nicht automatisch ergänzt. Verwende Manuelle Auswahl aufheben, um die automatische Übernahme wiederherzustellen.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatisk avatarkorrektion", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatisk avatarkorrigering", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatisk import brukes ved generering og legges ikke til i denne listen. Typer som er deaktivert eller tømt manuelt, fylles ikke automatisk. Bruk Fjern manuelt valg for å gjenopprette automatisk import.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatisk justering af lemmer", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatisk justering af lemmer er deaktiveret for avataren.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatisk justering av armer og ben", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatisk justering av armer og ben er deaktivert for denne avataren.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatisk justering av lemmar", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatisk justering av lemmar är inaktiverad för avataren.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatiska importer används vid generering och läggs inte till i listan. Typer som stängts av eller tömts manuellt fylls inte i automatiskt. Använd Rensa manuellt val för att återställa automatisk import.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatiske importer bruges under generering og tilføjes ikke til listen. Typer, der deaktiveres eller ryddes manuelt, udfyldes ikke automatisk. Brug Ryd manuelt valg for at gendanne automatisk import.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatyczna blokada głowy na plecach", "Auto-Lock Head When Supine" },
    { "Automatyczna korekcja awatara", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "Automatyczna korekcja kończyn", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Automatyczna korekcja kończyn jest wyłączona dla tego awatara.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Automatyczne importy są używane podczas generowania i nie trafiają na tę listę. Typy wyłączone lub wyczyszczone ręcznie nie są uzupełniane automatycznie. Wyczyść wybór ręczny, aby przywrócić automatyczny import.", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "Automatycznie koryguje różnice kierunku i skręcenia stawów każdego awatara.", "Automatically correct differences in joint direction and twist for each avatar." },
    { "Autorská data určující cíle rukou a chodidel pro každou zahrnutou pózu.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "Autorská data určující cíle rukou a chodidel pro každou zahrnutou pózu. Vytvořte jeden soubor na produkt; je oddělený od nastavení konkrétního avatara.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "Autre", "Other" },
    { "Avaa tuettu asento Asennot-välilehdeltä ja valitse Ota Käänny käyttöön.", "Open a supported pose in Poses and enable Enable roll over." },
