    { "Añadir {0} a {1}", "Add {0} to {1}" },
    { "Aşağıdaki paketler geçerli Unity sürümüyle uyumsuz!", "The following packages are incompatible with current unity!" },
    { "BOOTH lisans unitypackage'i aracın kendisini içermez. Ürün paketini ve Unisaki Posing System'i projeye eklemek için ALCOM / VCC kullanın.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH का लाइसेंस unitypackage टूल नहीं रखता। ALCOM / VCC से उत्पाद पैकेज और Unisaki Posing System इस प्रोजेक्ट में जोड़ें।", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH உரிம unitypackage-இல் கருவி இல்லை. ALCOM / VCC மூலம் தயாரிப்புத் தொகுப்பையும் Unisaki Posing System-ஐயும் இந்தத் திட்டத்தில் சேர்க்கவும்.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH లైసెన్స్ unitypackageలో సాధనం లేదు. ALCOM / VCCతో ఉత్పత్తి ప్యాకేజీ, Unisaki Posing Systemను ఈ ప్రాజెక్ట్‌కు జోడించండి.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH 라이선스 unitypackage에는 도구 본체가 포함되어 있지 않습니다. ALCOM / VCC로 상품 패키지와 Unisaki Posing System을 이 프로젝트에 추가해 주세요.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH-lisensens unitypackage inneholder ikke selve verktøyet. Bruk ALCOM / VCC for å legge til produktpakken og Unisaki Posing System i dette prosjektet.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH-এর লাইসেন্স unitypackage-এ টুল থাকে না। ALCOM / VCC দিয়ে পণ্যের প্যাকেজ ও Unisaki Posing System এই প্রজেক্টে যোগ করুন।", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTHin lisenssi-unitypackage ei sisällä itse työkalua. Lisää tuotepaketti ja Unisaki Posing System tähän projektiin ALCOM / VCC:llä.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH同梱のライセンス用unitypackageだけでは、ツール本体の導入は完了しません。ALCOM / VCCでこのプロジェクトに商品本体と「ゆにさきポーズシステム」が追加されているか確認してください。", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH授權unitypackage不包含工具本體。請透過ALCOM / VCC為此專案加入產品套件和Unisaki Posing System。", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "BOOTH许可证unitypackage不包含工具本体。请通过ALCOM / VCC为此项目添加产品软件包和Unisaki Posing System。", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
