    { "Console 오류", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console'da Missing Prefab gibi içe aktarma hatalarını kontrol edin. Hedef sahneyi yeniden açıp deneyin.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Console'da derleme hatası veya Missing Script bileşeni olup olmadığını kontrol edin.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Console'daki ilk derleme hatasını düzeltin, derlemenin bitmesini bekleyin ve yeniden deneyin.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Console'daki önceki hataları ve Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK ile Posing System sürümlerini kontrol edin.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Console'daki önceki hataları ve VRChat Avatars SDK sürümünü kontrol edin.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Console-Fehler", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console-fejl", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console-fel", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console-fouten", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console-এ Missing Prefab-এর মতো আমদানির ত্রুটি পরীক্ষা করুন। গন্তব্য দৃশ্য আবার খুলে চেষ্টা করুন।", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Console-এ Missing Prefab-এর মতো আমদানির ত্রুটি পরীক্ষা করুন। লক্ষ্য দৃশ্য আবার খুলে চেষ্টা করুন।", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the target scene and try again." },
    { "Console-এ কম্পাইল ত্রুটি বা Missing Script কম্পোনেন্ট আছে কি না দেখুন।", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Console-এ ঠিক আগের ত্রুটিগুলো এবং Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK ও Posing System-এর সংস্করণ দেখুন।", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Console-এ ঠিক আগের ত্রুটিগুলো এবং VRChat Avatars SDK-এর সংস্করণ দেখুন।", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Console-এর প্রথম কম্পাইল ত্রুটি ঠিক করে কম্পাইল শেষ হওয়া পর্যন্ত অপেক্ষা করুন, তারপর আবার চেষ্টা করুন।", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Console-இன் முதல் தொகுத்தல் பிழையைச் சரிசெய்து, தொகுத்தல் முடிந்தபின் மீண்டும் முயலவும்.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Console-இல் Missing Prefab போன்ற இறக்குமதிப் பிழைகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும். இலக்குக் காட்சியை மீண்டும் திறந்து முயலவும்.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Console-இல் உடனடியாக முந்தைய பிழைகளையும் Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK மற்றும் Posing System பதிப்புகளையும் பார்க்கவும்.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Console-இல் உடனடியாக முந்தைய பிழைகளையும் VRChat Avatars SDK பதிப்பையும் பார்க்கவும்.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Console-இல் தொகுப்பு பிழைகள் அல்லது Missing Script கூறுகள் உள்ளனவா எனப் பார்க்கவும்.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Console-ஐப் பார்க்கவும்", "See Console" },
    { "Consolen virheet", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Consoleలో Missing Prefab వంటి దిగుమతి లోపాలను తనిఖీ చేయండి. లక్ష్య సీన్ మళ్లీ తెరిచి ప్రయత్నించండి.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Consoleలో కంపైల్ లోపాలు లేదా Missing Script భాగాలు ఉన్నాయేమో చూడండి.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Consoleలో మొదటి కంపైల్ లోపాన్ని సరిచేసి, కంపైల్ పూర్తయ్యాక మళ్లీ ప్రయత్నించండి.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Consoleలో వెంటనే ముందు వచ్చిన లోపాలను, Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK, Posing System వెర్షన్‌లను చూడండి.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Consoleలో వెంటనే ముందు వచ్చిన లోపాలను, VRChat Avatars SDK వెర్షన్‌ను చూడండి.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Console’u kontrol edin", "See Console" },
    { "ConsoleでMissing Prefabなどのインポートエラーを確認してください。配置先のシーンを開き直して再実行してください。", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the target scene and try again." },
    { "ConsoleにコンパイルエラーやMissing Scriptがないか確認してください。", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Consoleのエラー", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Consoleのエラー\n", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Consoleのエラーについて相談する", "Ask about Console errors" },
    { "Consoleの最初のコンパイルエラーを修正し、再コンパイルが完了してから実行してください。", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Consoleの直前のエラーとVRChat Avatars SDKのバージョンを確認してください。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Consoleの直前のエラーと、Unity・VRChat Avatars SDK・ポーズシステムのバージョンを確認してください。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Consoleを確認してください", "See Console" },
    { "Console錯誤", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console错误", "Console errors\n" },
    { "Console에 컴파일 오류나 Missing Script 컴포넌트가 있는지 확인하세요.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Console에서 Missing Prefab 등의 가져오기 오류를 확인해 주세요. 대상 씬을 다시 열고 시도해 주세요.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the target scene and try again." },
    { "Console에서 Missing Prefab 등의 가져오기 오류를 확인해 주세요. 배치할 씬을 다시 연 뒤 시도해 주세요.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Console을 확인하세요", "See Console" },
    { "Console의 직전 오류와 Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK, Posing System 버전을 확인하세요.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Console의 직전 오류와 VRChat Avatars SDK 버전을 확인하세요.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Console의 첫 번째 컴파일 오류를 수정하고 컴파일이 끝난 뒤 다시 시도해 주세요.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Consulta la Console", "See Console" },
