    { "Contoh: tangan kanan di pinggul, tangan kiri di lantai", "Example: right hand on hip, left hand on floor" },
    { "Controleer Console op compilatiefouten of Missing Script-componenten.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Controleer Head in Rig > Configure van het oorspronkelijke model en of het hoofdbot nog in de scène staat.", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "Controleer Humanoid en de Configure-toewijzingen onder Inspector > Rig van het oorspronkelijke model. Volg de aanbevolen instellingen van de avatarmaker.", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "Controleer Rig > Configure op het oorspronkelijke model en het Head-bot in de scène.", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "Controleer de Animator op hetzelfde object als de VRC Avatar Descriptor en vergelijk de instellingen met de oorspronkelijke avatarprefab.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "Controleer de Animator van de oorspronkelijke avatar en de Avatar-verwijzing.", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "Controleer de Console", "See Console" },
    { "Controleer de Humanoid-instellingen en het Head-bot van de avatar. Bekijk de interne uitzondering in Console voor meer informatie.", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "Controleer de betreffende animatie en aanpassingsclip in de poselijst. Schakel die pose tijdelijk uit en probeer het opnieuw om het probleem te isoleren.", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "Controleer de instellingen of werk de voorberekening bij. Zie de Inspector.", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "Controleer de pose en avatar waarop IK moet worden toegepast.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "Controleer de voorgaande fouten in Console en de versie van VRChat Avatars SDK.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Controleer de voorgaande fouten in Console en de versies van Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK en Posing System.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Controleer de voorgestelde clips voordat je ze toevoegt.", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "Controleer die categorie in de poselijst en herstel deze vanuit een voorinstelling of reservekopie.", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "Controleer het Avatar-veld van de Animator op de avatarroot en de Rig-instellingen van het oorspronkelijke model.", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "Controleer importfouten zoals Missing Prefab in de Console. Open de doelscène opnieuw en probeer nogmaals.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Controleer of de gedeelde pose-Animator actief is, geen EditorOnly-tag heeft en de juiste MA Merge Animator-verwijzing heeft. Bewaar je aangepaste gegenereerde bestanden.", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "Controleer of een andere controller is toegewezen aan de gedeelde pose-Animator.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "Controleer of een andere controller is toegewezen aan de gedeelde pose-Animator.\nSla de scène op en maak een reservekopie. Download daarna het product en Unisaki Posing System opnieuw met ALCOM / VCC. Blijft het probleem bestaan, open dan Hulp / Wijzigingen bovenaan de Inspector voor de handleiding en ondersteuning. Bewaar je aangepaste objecten en GeneratedResources.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Controleer of het posemenu binnen het gereedschap is verwijderd of uitgeschakeld.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled." },
    { "Controleer of het posemenu binnen het gereedschap is verwijderd of uitgeschakeld.\nSla de scène op en maak een reservekopie. Download daarna het product en Unisaki Posing System opnieuw met ALCOM / VCC. Blijft het probleem bestaan, open dan Hulp / Wijzigingen bovenaan de Inspector voor de handleiding en ondersteuning. Bewaar je aangepaste objecten en GeneratedResources.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Controleer of precies één gedeelde pose-Animator actief is, geen EditorOnly-tag of Missing Script heeft en de standaardprefab is geïnstalleerd.", "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed." },
    { "Controlla Head in Rig > Configure del modello originale e verifica che il bone della testa sia ancora nella scena.", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "Controlla Humanoid e le assegnazioni Configure in Inspector > Rig del modello originale. Segui le impostazioni consigliate dall'autore dell'avatar.", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "Controlla Rig > Configure sul modello originale e l’osso Head nella scena.", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "Controlla avatar di destinazione [PS040]", "Check the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "Controlla destinazione [PS040]", "Check the destination [PS040]" },
    { "Controlla gli errori precedenti in Console e la versione di VRChat Avatars SDK.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Controlla gli errori precedenti in Console e le versioni di Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK e Posing System.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Controlla il campo Avatar dell’Animator nella radice dell’avatar e le impostazioni Rig del modello originale.", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "Controlla impostazioni", "Check settings" },
    { "Controlla l'Animator sullo stesso oggetto del VRC Avatar Descriptor e confrontalo con il prefab originale dell'avatar.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "Controlla la categoria nell'elenco delle pose e ripristinala da un preset o da un backup.", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "Controlla la posa e l'avatar a cui applicare l'IK.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "Controlla le clip proposti prima di aggiungerli.", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "Controlla le impostazioni Humanoid e l’osso Head dell’avatar. Per i dettagli, consulta l’eccezione interna in Console.", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "Controlla le impostazioni o aggiorna il precalcolo. Consulta l'Inspector.", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "Controlla l’Animator dell’avatar originale e il riferimento Avatar.", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "Controlla l’animazione e la clip di regolazione interessate nell’elenco delle pose. Per isolare il problema, disattiva temporaneamente la posa e riprova.", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "Controlla nella Console gli errori di importazione, come Missing Prefab. Riapri la scena di destinazione e riprova.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Controlla se Console contiene errori di compilazione o componenti Missing Script.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Controller bersama memiliki perubahan yang belum disimpan. Simpan sebelum mencoba lagi.", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "Controller bersama tidak cocok dengan definisi pembuatan versi ini.", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "Controller bersama tidak cocok dengan definisi pembuatan versi ini. Simpan perubahan khusus pada Controller terpisah, lalu pasang ulang Unisaki Posing System versi yang sama melalui ALCOM atau VCC.", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "Controller bersama tidak memiliki lapisan kendali pose.", "The shared controller has no pose-control layers." },
    { "Controller bersama tidak memiliki layer USSPS_Locomotion.", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
    { "Controller bersama tidak memiliki layer USSPS_LocomotionType.", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_LocomotionType layer." },
    { "Controller dùng chung có thay đổi chưa lưu. Lưu trước khi thử lại.", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "Controller dùng chung không có lớp USSPS_Locomotion.", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
    { "Controller dùng chung không có lớp USSPS_LocomotionType.", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_LocomotionType layer." },
    { "Controller dùng chung không có lớp điều khiển tư thế.", "The shared controller has no pose-control layers." },
    { "Controller dùng chung không khớp định nghĩa tạo của phiên bản này.", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "Controller dùng chung không khớp định nghĩa tạo của phiên bản này. Lưu thay đổi riêng trong Controller khác, rồi cài lại cùng phiên bản Unisaki Posing System qua ALCOM hoặc VCC.", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "Controller dýchání se nepodařilo oddělit do kopie pro generování.", "Could not isolate the breathing Controller in a copy for generation." },
    { "Controller for pust kunne ikke isoleres i en kopi for generering.", "Could not isolate the breathing Controller in a copy for generation." },
    { "Controller pernapasan tidak dapat dipisahkan ke salinan untuk pembuatan.", "Could not isolate the breathing Controller in a copy for generation." },
    { "Controller standar tidak ditemukan dalam paket.", "The standard Controller could not be found in the package." },
    { "Controller standar untuk memulihkan pose asli tidak ditemukan.", "The standard Controller needed to restore the original poses was not found." },
    { "Controller standard non trovato nel pacchetto.", "The standard Controller could not be found in the package." },
    { "Controller til vejrtrækning kunne ikke isoleres i en kopi til generering.", "Could not isolate the breathing Controller in a copy for generation." },
    { "Controller ที่ใช้ร่วมกันมีการเปลี่ยนแปลงที่ยังไม่บันทึก บันทึกก่อนลองอีกครั้ง", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "Controller ที่ใช้ร่วมกันไม่ตรงกับข้อกำหนดการสร้างของเวอร์ชันนี้", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "Controller ที่ใช้ร่วมกันไม่ตรงกับข้อกำหนดการสร้างของเวอร์ชันนี้ บันทึกการแก้ไขของคุณใน Controller แยก แล้วติดตั้ง Unisaki Posing System เวอร์ชันเดิมใหม่ผ่าน ALCOM หรือ VCC", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "Controller ที่ใช้ร่วมกันไม่มีเลเยอร์ USSPS_Locomotion", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
