    { "Denne post bruger det ældre koordinatformat. Vis referenceavataren i justeringsvinduet, og kør Registrér aktuelle lempositioner én gang. Indtil ny registrering bevares lemmets retning fra kildeanimationen.", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
