    { "Der var ingen ændringer at duplikere og gemme.", "There were no changes to duplicate and save." },
    { "Der vom gemeinsamen Posen-Animator referenzierte Animator Controller kann nicht geladen werden.", "Cannot load the Animator Controller referenced by the shared posing Animator." },
    { "Der vorherige Vorgang wurde nicht abgeschlossen.", "The previous operation did not finish." },
    { "Der zur Kniemessung benötigte Humanoid Animator fehlt.", "The Humanoid Animator needed for knee measurement is missing." },
    { "Derleme hataları (ilk 5'e kadar)", "Compilation errors (up to the first 5)" },
    { "Derleme sırasında merkezdeki normal poz, yan poz ve onun aynasıyla birleştirilir. Her klibin ilk karesi kullanılır. Merkez 0.5, uçlar 0 ve 1'dir. Zemin düzeltmesi 0'da kapalı, 0.25'te %25'tir.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Des erreurs de configuration sont présentes. Ouvrez Vérifier les réglages dans l'Inspector.", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Des modifications ne sont pas enregistrées. Les enregistrer ?", "You have unsaved changes. Save them?" },
    { "Des réglages anciens de {0} restent sur cet avatar et peuvent créer des conflits. Utilisez le nettoyage pour les retirer. Si l'avatar utilisait à l'origine un Animator Controller de locomotion personnalisé dans sa couche Base, restaurez-le manuellement ensuite.", "Legacy settings for {0} remain on this avatar and may cause conflicts. Use the cleanup command to remove them. If the avatar originally used a custom locomotion Animator Controller in its Base layer, restore that controller manually afterward." },
    { "Desactiva IK solo para esta pose si no se adapta a tu avatar. Las otras poses y avatares no se ven afectados.", "Disable IK for just this pose if it does not suit your avatar. Other poses and avatars are unaffected." },
    { "Desactiva el balanceo en reposo predeterminado de VRChat y conserva la animación de respiración de esta herramienta.", "Disable VRChat's default idle sway while keeping this tool's breathing animation." },
    { "Desactiva «Mantener la cabeza visible en Modo foto» o combina los componentes VRC Head Chop existentes para liberar un espacio.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "Desactivar Use Auto-Footsteps for 3 and 4 point tracking", "Turn off Use Auto-Footsteps for 3 and 4 point tracking" },
    { "Desactivar el balanceo en reposo de VRChat", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "Desactivar funciones opcionales para reducir el uso de ExpressionParameters", "Disable optional features to reduce ExpressionParameters usage" },
    { "Desativa o balanço padrão em repouso do VRChat, preservando a animação de respiração desta ferramenta.", "Disable VRChat's default idle sway while keeping this tool's breathing animation." },
    { "Desativar Use Auto-Footsteps for 3 and 4 point tracking", "Turn off Use Auto-Footsteps for 3 and 4 point tracking" },
