    { "Durante a compilação, combina a pose normal no centro com a pose lateral e seu espelhamento. O primeiro quadro de cada clip é usado. O centro é 0.5; as extremidades são 0 e 1. A correção do chão é desativada em 0 e vale 25% em 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Durante la compilación se combina la pose normal en el centro con la pose lateral y su reflejo. Se usa el primer fotograma de cada clip. El centro es 0.5 y los extremos 0 y 1. La corrección del suelo está desactivada en 0 y es del 25% en 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Durante la compilazione, combina al centro la posa normale con quella laterale e il suo riflesso. Usa il primo fotogramma di ogni clip. Il centro è 0.5, le estremità sono 0 e 1. La correzione a terra è disattivata a 0 e vale il 25% a 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Durdur", "Stop" },
    { "Działanie:", "Action:" },
    { "Działanie: w Window > General > Console sprawdź pierwszy czerwony błąd tej operacji. Jeśli sprawdzanie ustawień nie pomaga, podczas kontaktu z pomocą podaj kod błędu, szczegóły i wersję narzędzia.", "Action: In Window > General > Console, check the first red error from this operation. If checking settings does not resolve the issue, include the error code, details, and tool version when contacting support." },
    { "Débogage : aperçu de la correction de l'avatar", "Debug: preview avatar correction" },
    { "Définir comme pose initiale de cette catégorie", "Set as default for this category" },
