    { "Dừng đầu gối ngay trước khi duỗi thẳng hoàn toàn.", "Stop the knee just before it fully straightens." },
    { "Dữ liệu biên soạn ghi đích tay và chân của từng tư thế đi kèm.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "Dữ liệu biên soạn ghi đích tay và chân của từng tư thế đi kèm. Tạo một tệp cho mỗi sản phẩm; tách biệt với thiết lập riêng từng avatar.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "Dữ liệu lưu cũ (không so sánh được thiết lập)", "Legacy saved data (settings cannot be compared)" },
    { "Edellinen toiminto ei valmistunut.", "The previous operation did not finish." },
    { "EditorOnly etiketine sahip", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "EditorOnly ট্যাগযুক্ত", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "EditorOnly குறியைக் கொண்டுள்ளது", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "EditorOnly ట్యాగ్ ఉంది", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "Een Animator-voorwaarde gebruikt een onverenigbaar parametertype. In bestand {0}, laag {1}, is parameter {2} gedeclareerd als {3}, maar wordt voorwaarde {4} gebruikt. Hierdoor kunnen functies onjuist werken. Neem over compatibiliteit contact op met de ontwikkelaar van het gereedschap dat deze parameter gebruikt.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Een Animator-voorwaarde verwijst naar een niet-gedeclareerde parameter. In bestand {0}, laag {1}, wordt parameter {2} gebruikt in een voorwaarde, maar ontbreekt deze in de Parameters-lijst van de Animator Controller. Neem over compatibiliteit contact op met de ontwikkelaar van het gereedschap dat deze parameter gebruikt.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Een Humanoid Animator is vereist.", "A Humanoid Animator is required." },
    { "Een Humanoid Animator of IK-regel ontbreekt.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
    { "Een Prefab in Project kan niet rechtstreeks worden gewijzigd. Voer de voorberekening uit voor een avatar in de scène of in Prefab-modus.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Een eigen pictogram is ingeschakeld voor item {1} ({2}) in {0}, maar er is geen afbeelding toegewezen.", "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned." },
    { "Eenmalig per computer", "Once per computer" },
    { "Efface les réglages manuels et les ajustements de ce type de mouvement. Si l'importation automatique est activée, la prochaine compilation le détectera à nouveau. Cette action peut être annulée.", "Clears manual settings and adjustments for this motion type. If automatic import is enabled, the next build detects it again. This can be undone." },
