    { "El preajuste se eliminó o es incompatible con la herramienta. Selecciona Recargar en el Inspector.", "The preset was removed or is incompatible with this tool. Select Reload in the Inspector." },
    { "El precálculo intentará restaurar el Controller estándar. Si falla, vuelve a obtener el paquete Unisaki Posing System.", "Prebuild will try to restore the standard controller. If recovery fails, reacquire the Unisaki Posing System package." },
    { "El prefab está dañado o no tiene componente Posing System. Comprueba scripts ausentes y errores de compilación en la Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "El prefab está dañado o no tiene un componente Posing System. Comprueba Missing Script y los errores de compilación en la Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "El producto que usa estos ajustes IK.", "The product that uses these IK settings." },
    { "El unitypackage de licencia de BOOTH no incluye la herramienta. Usa ALCOM / VCC para añadir el paquete del producto y Unisaki Posing System a este proyecto.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "El veya ayak yerleşimi için Head, Hips, diz ya da ViewPosition (göz konumu) gibi referans. ViewPosition baş hareketini izler.", "The reference used to measure hand or foot placement, such as Head, Hips, a knee, or ViewPosition (eye position). ViewPosition follows head movement." },
    { "Eldre innstillinger for {0} finnes fortsatt på avataren og kan skape konflikter. Bruk oppryddingskommandoen for å fjerne dem. Hvis avataren opprinnelig brukte en egen Animator Controller for bevegelse i Base-laget, gjenopprett den manuelt etterpå.", "Legacy settings for {0} remain on this avatar and may cause conflicts. Use the cleanup command to remove them. If the avatar originally used a custom locomotion Animator Controller in its Base layer, restore that controller manually afterward." },
    { "Eldre lagrede data (innstillingene kan ikke sammenlignes)", "Legacy saved data (settings cannot be compared)" },
    { "Ele será recriado a partir do prefab padrão durante o pré-cálculo ou a compilação do avatar.", "The standard prefab will be used to recreate it during prebuild or avatar build." },
    { "Ele será recriado com as configurações padrão durante o pré-cálculo ou a compilação do avatar.", "It will be recreated from the standard settings during prebuild or avatar build." },
