    { "Elle düzeltmeleri kaydeder, ardından mevcut IK sonucunu ayrı bir düzeltme animasyonuna kaydeder. Mevcut dosyalar korunur.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Elle seçimi temizle", "Clear manual selection" },
    { "Elleboog-/kniebuiging", "Elbow / knee bending" },
    { "Ellenbogen-/Kniebeugung", "Elbow / knee bending" },
    { "Em desenvolvimento. As antigas animações de ajuste continuam em uso, mesmo se um prefab do produto referenciar este catálogo.", "Work in progress. Legacy adjustment animations remain in use even when a product prefab references this catalog." },
    { "Em pé", "Standing" },
    { "Em pé / andar", "Standing / Walking" },
    { "Em pé / andar / correr", "Standing / walking / running" },
    { "Empêche l'IK des jambes de plier les genoux vers l'arrière.", "Prevents leg IK from bending the knees backward." },
    { "Empêche les genoux de se plier vers l'arrière lorsque les jambes se tendent.", "Prevent the knees from bending backward when the legs straighten." },
    { "Empêcher les genoux de se plier à l'envers", "Prevent reverse knee bending" },
    { "En Animator-betingelse bruger en inkompatibel parametertype. I fil {0}, lag {1}, er parameter {2} erklæret som {3}, men betingelse {4} bruges. Det kan forhindre funktioner i at virke korrekt. Kontakt udvikleren af værktøjet, der bruger parameteren, om kompatibilitet.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "En Animator-betingelse bruker en inkompatibel parametertype. I fil {0}, lag {1}, er parameter {2} definert som {3}, men betingelse {4} brukes. Dette kan hindre funksjoner i å virke riktig. Kontakt utvikleren av verktøyet som bruker parameteren om kompatibilitet.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "En Animator-betingelse henviser til en ikke-erklæret parameter. I fil {0}, lag {1}, bruges parameter {2} i en betingelse, men mangler i Animator Controllers Parameters-liste. Kontakt udvikleren af værktøjet, der bruger parameteren, om kompatibilitet.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "En Animator-betingelse viser til en udefinert parameter. I fil {0}, lag {1}, brukes parameter {2} i en betingelse, men den mangler i Parameters-listen i Animator Controller. Kontakt utvikleren av verktøyet som bruker parameteren om kompatibilitet.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "En Humanoid Animator eller IK-regel mangler.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
    { "En Humanoid Animator eller IK-regel saknas.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
    { "En Humanoid Animator er påkrævet.", "A Humanoid Animator is required." },
    { "En Humanoid Animator kreves.", "A Humanoid Animator is required." },
    { "En Humanoid Animator krävs.", "A Humanoid Animator is required." },
    { "En Prefab i Project kan ikke endres direkte. Kjør forhåndsbyggingen for en avatar i scenen eller i Prefab-modus.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "En Prefab i Project kan ikke ændres direkte. Kør forberegningen for en avatar i scenen eller i Prefab-tilstand.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "En automatisk justeringsanimation blev oprettet fra {0} IK-regler.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "En automatisk justeringsanimation skapades från {0} IK-regler.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "En cours de création. Les anciennes animations d'ajustement restent utilisées même si un prefab de produit référence ce catalogue.", "Work in progress. Legacy adjustment animations remain in use even when a product prefab references this catalog." },
    { "En cuclillas", "Crouching" },
    { "En desarrollo. Las antiguas animaciones de ajuste se siguen usando aunque un prefab del producto haga referencia a este catálogo.", "Work in progress. Legacy adjustment animations remain in use even when a product prefab references this catalog." },
    { "En egen ikon är aktiverad för post {1} ({2}) i {0}, men ingen bild har tilldelats.", "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned." },
    { "En forhåndsinnstilling for {0} ble funnet. Bruke den for å tilpasse positurene til denne avataren?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "En forudindstilling til {0} blev fundet. Anvend den for at tilpasse positurerne til avataren?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "En förinställning för {0} hittades. Tillämpa den för att anpassa poserna till avataren?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "En giltig Humanoid-avatar krävs för att justera importerade rörelser.", "Adjusting imported motions requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En giltig Humanoid-avatar krävs för att skapa vändrörelsen.", "Generating roll over requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En gyldig Humanoid-avatar er nødvendig for at generere vendingen.", "Generating roll over requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En gyldig Humanoid-avatar er nødvendig for at justere importerede bevægelser.", "Adjusting imported motions requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En gyldig Humanoid-avatar kreves for å generere snuing.", "Generating roll over requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En gyldig Humanoid-avatar kreves for å justere importerte bevegelser.", "Adjusting imported motions requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "En küçük diz bükülmesi (derece)", "Minimum knee bend (degrees)" },
    { "Encerrar pré-visualização (restaurar pose original)", "End preview (restore original pose)" },
    { "Encerrar prévia (restaurar pose original)", "End preview (restore original pose)" },
    { "Endast stående", "Standing only" },
    { "Endring i minnebruk når dette valget aktiveres eller deaktiveres.\nHodelås: 1 bit, delt med Snu deg.\nBruker 0 ekstra bit hvis Snu deg allerede bruker denne parameteren.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Endring i minnebruk når dette valget aktiveres eller deaktiveres.\nSnu deg-bryter: 1 bit; hodetilt: 8 bit; hodelås: 1 bit.\nParametere som allerede brukes av andre valg, telles bare én gang.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Endringsloggen kunne ikke lastes inn.", "The changelog could not be loaded." },
    { "Enregistre le résultat IK dans une nouvelle animation d'ajustement et désactive l'IK pour cette pose. Vous pouvez ensuite l'ajuster manuellement ci-dessous.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "Enregistre les ajustements des animations modifiées.", "Saves adjustments for animations that have changes." },
    { "Enregistre les ajustements manuels, puis le résultat IK actuel dans une animation d’ajustement distincte. Les fichiers existants sont conservés.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Enregistre les valeurs d'ajustement dans le fichier.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Enregistrement…", "Saving..." },
    { "Enregistrer", "Save" },
    { "Enregistrer / gérer les préréglages", "Save / manage presets" },
    { "Enregistrer et continuer", "Save and continue" },
    { "Enregistrer les modifications", "Save changed" },
    { "Enregistrez et sauvegardez la scène, puis téléchargez à nouveau le produit et Unisaki Posing System avec ALCOM / VCC. Si le problème persiste, ouvrez Aide / Historique en haut de l'Inspector pour consulter le manuel et l'assistance. Conservez vos objets ajustés et GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Enregistré pour chaque outil de pose. Les erreurs et les régénérations nécessaires à la compilation restent actives.", "Saved per pose tool. Errors and required build-time regeneration remain enabled." },
    { "Entferne den fehlenden Eintrag aus der Posenliste und füge die benötigte Animation erneut hinzu.", "Remove the missing entry from the pose list and add the required animation again." },
    { "Entfernen", "Remove" },
    { "Entfernt alte Einstellungen von {0} vom Avatar. Sichere das Projekt zuerst, um Anpassungen wiederherstellen und vergleichen zu können.", "Remove legacy settings for {0}. This cleanup is for old avatar settings. Back up the project first so you can recover and compare your adjustments." },
    { "Entri ini menggunakan format koordinat lama. Tampilkan avatar acuan di jendela penyesuaian lalu", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and " },
    { "Entri ini menggunakan format koordinat lama. Tampilkan avatar acuan di jendela penyesuaian lalu tangkap posisi anggota tubuh saat ini sekali. Sampai ditangkap ulang, orientasi anggota tubuh animasi sumber dipertahankan.", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
    { "Epäonnistui", "Failed" },
    { "Epäonnistui\nTarkista Console", "Error installing packages" },
    { "Er is een fout opgetreden bij het maken van de voorinstelling.", "An error occurred while creating the preset." },
    { "Er is een voorinstelling voor {0} gevonden. Toepassen om de poses aan deze avatar aan te passen?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "Er is geen VRC Avatar Descriptor boven het gereedschap gevonden.", "No VRC Avatar Descriptor was found above the tool." },
    { "Er is geen aanpassingsanimatie om samen te voegen.", "There is no adjustment animation to merge." },
    { "Er is geen aanpassingsanimatie om te dupliceren.", "There is no adjustment animation to duplicate." },
    { "Er is geen actieve gedeelde pose-Animator gevonden.", "No active shared posing Animator was found." },
    { "Er is geen referentieavatarpose voor dit product geregistreerd.", "No reference avatar pose is registered for this product." },
    { "Er kon geen geldige lengte worden gemeten tussen {0} en {1}.", "Could not measure a valid length between {0} and {1}." },
    { "Er kon geen geldige vaste lengte worden gemeten uit de avatarschaal.", "Could not measure a valid fixed length from the avatar scale." },
    { "Er waren geen wijzigingen om te dupliceren en op te slaan.", "There were no changes to duplicate and save." },
    { "Er wird bei der Vorberechnung oder beim Avatar-Build aus dem Standard-Prefab neu erstellt.", "The standard prefab will be used to recreate it during prebuild or avatar build." },
    { "Er wird bei der Vorberechnung oder beim Avatar-Build mit den Standardeinstellungen neu erstellt.", "It will be recreated from the standard settings during prebuild or avatar build." },
    { "Er zijn configuratiefouten. Open Instellingen controleren in de Inspector.", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "Er zijn geen nieuwe animatieclips om toe te voegen.", "No new animation clips can be added." },
    { "Er zijn geen posecategorieën ingesteld.", "No pose categories are configured." },
    { "Er zijn geen poses ingeschakeld in {0}. Het bijbehorende posekeuzemenu wordt niet gegenereerd.", "No poses are enabled in {0}. Its pose-selection menu will not be generated." },
    { "Erkennt Bewegungen aus der Base-Ebene des Avatars bei der Generierung, ohne sie zur Importliste hinzuzufügen. Manuelle Zuweisungen haben Vorrang.", "Detect motions from the avatar's Base layer during generation. They are not added to the import list. Manual selections take priority." },
    { "Ermöglicht das Umdrehen durch Neigen des Kopfes. Wird von bestimmten Liegeposen unterstützt.", "Roll over by tilting your head. Supported by certain lying poses." },
