    { "Flytt av skapade tillgångar sköts upp: {0}", "Moving generated assets was deferred: {0}" },
    { "Flyttar hela kroppen inklusive huvudet högst 3 m upp eller ned. Golvhöjd är neutral vid 50 %.", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "Flyttar längs referensriktningen. Inaktiverade axlar behåller ursprungsposens position.", "Moves along the reference orientation. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Flyttar längs världsaxlarna. Inaktiverade axlar behåller ursprungsposens position.", "Moves along world axes. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Flytter hele kroppen inklusive hovedet op til 3 m op eller ned. Gulvhøjde er neutral ved 50 %.", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "Flytter hele kroppen, inkludert hodet, opptil 3 m opp eller ned. Gulvhøyde er nøytral ved 50 %.", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "Flytter langs referenceretningen. Deaktiverede akser bevarer den oprindelige positurs position.", "Moves along the reference orientation. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Flytter langs verdensakserne. Deaktiverede akser bevarer den oprindelige positurs position.", "Moves along world axes. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Flytting av genererte ressurser ble utsatt: {0}", "Moving generated assets was deferred: {0}" },
    { "Fodhøjde", "Foot Height" },
    { "Folder do usunięcia: {0}\nZostaną usunięte także znajdujące się w nim prefaby i animacje. Jeśli zawiera własne lub dostosowane dane, anuluj i zastosuj instrukcję migracji. Do przywrócenia usuniętych plików potrzebna jest kopia zapasowa.", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "Folder tujuan tidak dapat ditentukan. Pastikan Unity mengenali folder proyek ini: {0}", "Could not determine the destination folder. Make sure Unity recognizes this project folder: {0}" },
    { "Folder unitypackage lama “{0}” masih ada dalam proyek dan dapat berkonflik dengan versi saat ini. Periksa petunjuk migrasi dan cadangan sebelum menghapusnya.", "The legacy unitypackage folder “{0}” is still in this project and may conflict with the current version. Check the migration instructions and your backup before removing it." },
    { "Folder yang dihapus: {0}\nPrefab dan animasi di dalamnya juga dihapus. Jika berisi data khusus atau hasil penyesuaian, batalkan lalu ikuti petunjuk migrasi. Cadangan diperlukan untuk memulihkan berkas yang dihapus.", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
