    { "Gester av", "Disable Gestures" },
    { "Gestur mati", "Disable Gestures" },
    { "Gestus fra", "Disable Gestures" },
    { "Gesuchtes Prefab:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Gesuchtes Prefab: {0}\nDas gekaufte Lizenz-Installationspaket allein installiert das Produkt nicht vollständig. Prüfe in ALCOM / VCC, ob das Produkt und Unisaki Posing System diesem Projekt hinzugefügt sind.\nFalls bereits installiert: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Gewijzigde instellingen sinds voorberekening tonen", "Show settings changed since prebuild" },
    { "Gewählte Typen verwenden diese Bewegungen. Andere Typen behalten ihre ursprünglichen Einstellungen.", "Selected types use these motions. Other types keep their original settings." },
    { "Geçerli Humanoid Animator bulunamadı.", "No valid Humanoid Animator was found." },
    { "Geçerli avatardan içe aktar", "Import from current avatar" },
    { "Geçerli ayarlardan ön ayar oluştur", "Create preset from current settings" },
    { "Geçerli hareket bir AnimationClip değil. Düzeltme farkları yalnızca AnimationClip destekler.", "The current motion is not an AnimationClip. Adjustment deltas support AnimationClips only." },
    { "Geçerli kullanıcı", "Current user" },
    { "Geçerli metin kaydı bulunamadı.", "No valid text entries were found." },
    { "Geçerli uzuv konumu, görünen yönelim ve bükülme yönü IK kuralına kaydedildi.", "Recorded the current limb position, visible orientation, and bend direction in the IK rule." },
    { "Geïmporteerde resultaten kunnen niet naar de meegeleverde bron-Controller worden geschreven.", "Cannot write imported results to the distributed source Controller." },
    { "Ghi IK vào hiệu chỉnh", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "Gib den Avatarnamen ein.", "Enter the avatar name." },
    { "Girarsi", "Roll Over" },
    { "Girarsi per l'elemento {1} ({2}) in {0} richiede un AnimationClip Humanoid.", "Roll over for item {1} ({2}) in {0} requires a Humanoid AnimationClip." },
    { "Già installato", "Already installed" },
    { "Giảm dung lượng avatar với việc giảm một ít chi tiết biểu tượng.", "Reduce avatar size at the cost of some icon detail." },
    { "Giảm kích thước biểu tượng", "Reduce icon size" },
    { "Giảm méo khi đầu quay hướng khác tư thế gốc trong lúc tắt khóa đầu.", "Reduce distortion when your head faces a different direction from the original pose with head lock off." },
    { "Giảm méo tư thế do xoay đầu", "Reduce pose distortion from head rotation" },
    { "Giấy phép Cool Posing", "Cool Posing licenses" },
    { "Giấy phép Kawaii Posing", "Kawaii Posing licenses" },
    { "Giới hạn duỗi đầu gối trước khi góc gập nhỏ hơn giá trị này.", "Limits knee extension before the bend becomes smaller than this angle." },
    { "Giữ đầu hiển thị khi chụp ảnh cần bản sao FX Controller dành cho bản dựng.", "Keeping the head visible during photography requires a build copy of the FX Controller." },
    { "Giữ đầu hiển thị trong chế độ chụp", "Keep your head visible in Photo Mode" },
    { "Giữ đầu hiển thị trên màn hình bạn để chụp gần. Hiển thị bình thường trở lại sau chế độ chụp.", "Keep your head visible locally for close-up photos. Normal visibility returns after Photo Mode." },
    { "Giữ độ gập tư thế nguồn", "Keep source-pose bend" },
    { "Gjenopprett verktøyets standardkontroller. Animator Override Controller støttes ikke her.", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here." },
    { "Gjenopprett verktøyets standardkontroller. Animator Override Controller støttes ikke her.\nLagre scenen og ta en sikkerhetskopi. Last deretter ned produktet og Unisaki Posing System på nytt med ALCOM / VCC. Hvis problemet vedvarer, åpne Hjelp / Endringslogg øverst i Inspector for brukerveiledning og støtte. Behold justerte objekter og GeneratedResources.", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Gjenoppretter verdiene som er lagret i filen.", "Restores the values saved in the file." },
    { "Gli abiti aggiunti con Modular Avatar sono inclusi quando le icone vengono ricreate durante la compilazione dell'avatar.", "Outfits added with Modular Avatar are included when icons are retaken during the avatar build." },
    { "Gli angoli sono in gradi. Seleziona una posa sdraiata e sblocca la testa nel menu VRChat.", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
    { "Gli appunti sono vuoti.", "The clipboard is empty." },
    { "Glidebryterområde: -1 til 1. Du kan skrive inn verdier utenfor dette området.", "Slider range: -1 to 1. You can type values outside this range." },
    { "Gliedmaßen-IK-Regel hinzufügen", "Add limb IK rule" },
    { "Gliedmaßen-IK-Regeln ({0})", "Limb IK rules ({0})" },
    { "Gliedmaßenanpassung (IK) für diese Pose", "Limb adjustment (IK) for this pose" },
    { "Gliedmaßendrehung angleichen", "Match limb rotation" },
    { "Globalnie (osie sceny)", "World (scene axes)" },
    { "Globálně (osy scény)", "World (scene axes)" },
    { "Golv", "Floor" },
    { "Golvhöjd", "Floor Height" },
    { "Gotowe", "Done" },
    { "Gotowe\nPozostałe licencje zostaną zachowane.", "Licenses removed. Other product licenses and their folder are kept." },
    { "Granska inställningarna eller uppdatera förberäkningen. Se Inspector.", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "Guarda el resultado IK en una nueva animación de ajuste y desactiva IK para esta pose. Después puedes ajustarla manualmente abajo.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "Guarda la escena y una copia de seguridad. Después vuelve a descargar el producto y Unisaki Posing System con ALCOM / VCC. Si el problema continúa, abre Ayuda / Historial en la parte superior del Inspector para consultar el manual y el soporte. Conserva tus objetos ajustados y GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Guarda los ajustes de las animaciones modificadas.", "Saves adjustments for animations that have changes." },
    { "Guarda los ajustes manuales y después el resultado IK actual en una animación de ajuste independiente. Se conservan los archivos existentes.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Guarda los valores de ajuste en el archivo.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Guarda o resultado IK em uma nova animação de ajuste e desativa IK nesta pose. Depois, você pode ajustá-la manualmente abaixo.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "Guarda os ajustes das animações alteradas.", "Saves adjustments for animations that have changes." },
    { "Guarda os ajustes manuais e depois o resultado IK atual em uma animação de ajuste separada. Os arquivos existentes são preservados.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Guarda os ajustes manuais e depois o resultado IK atual numa animação de ajuste separada. Os ficheiros existentes são preservados.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Guarda os valores de ajuste no arquivo.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Guarda os valores de ajuste no ficheiro.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Guardado por ferramenta de poses. Erros e a regeneração necessária durante a compilação continuam ativos.", "Saved per pose tool. Errors and required build-time regeneration remain enabled." },
    { "Guardado por herramienta de poses. Los errores y la regeneración necesaria durante la compilación siguen activos.", "Saved per pose tool. Errors and required build-time regeneration remain enabled." },
    { "Guardando…", "Saving..." },
    { "Guardar", "Save" },
    { "Guardar / gerenciar predefinições", "Save / manage presets" },
    { "Guardar / gestionar preajustes", "Save / manage presets" },
    { "Guardar alterações", "Save changed" },
    { "Guardar cambios", "Save changed" },
    { "Guardar e continuar", "Save and continue" },
    { "Guardar y continuar", "Save and continue" },
    { "Guarde a cena e uma cópia de segurança. Depois, baixe novamente o produto e Unisaki Posing System com ALCOM / VCC. Se o problema continuar, abra Ajuda / Histórico no topo do Inspector para consultar o manual e o suporte. Preserve os objetos ajustados e GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Guarde a cena e uma cópia de segurança. Depois, descarregue novamente o produto e Unisaki Posing System com ALCOM / VCC. Se o problema continuar, abra Ajuda / Histórico no topo do Inspector para consultar o manual e o suporte. Preserve os objetos ajustados e GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
