    { "Hazır ön ayarları gizle", "Hide bundled presets" },
    { "Head kemiği bulunamadığından poz yüksekliği hesaplanamıyor.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head ve Viewpoint arasındaki derinlik farkı ölçülemedi. View Position ve avatar ölçeğini kontrol edin.", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head ve Viewpoint arasındaki yükseklik farkı ölçülemedi. View Position ve avatar ölçeğini kontrol edin.", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head और Viewpoint की ऊँचाई का अंतर नहीं मापा जा सका। View Position और अवतार स्केल जाँचें।", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head और Viewpoint की गहराई का अंतर नहीं मापा जा सका। View Position और अवतार स्केल जाँचें।", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head बोन नहीं मिली, इसलिए पोज़ की ऊँचाई नहीं निकाली जा सकती।", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head ও Viewpoint-এর উচ্চতার পার্থক্য মাপা যায়নি। View Position ও অ্যাভাটারের স্কেল পরীক্ষা করুন।", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head ও Viewpoint-এর গভীরতার পার্থক্য মাপা যায়নি। View Position ও অ্যাভাটারের স্কেল পরীক্ষা করুন।", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head হাড় পাওয়া যায়নি, তাই পোজের উচ্চতা হিসাব করা যাচ্ছে না।", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head எலும்பு கிடைக்கவில்லை; போஸ் உயரத்தைக் கணக்கிட முடியாது.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head மற்றும் Viewpoint ஆழ வேறுபாட்டை அளக்க முடியவில்லை. View Position மற்றும் அவதார் அளவைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head மற்றும் Viewpoint உயர வேறுபாட்டை அளக்க முடியவில்லை. View Position மற்றும் அவதார் அளவைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head ఎముక కనబడలేదు; భంగిమ ఎత్తును లెక్కించలేరు.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head 본을 찾을 수 없어 포즈 높이를 계산할 수 없습니다.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head, Hips, முழங்கால் அல்லது ViewPosition (கண் இடம்) போன்ற கை-கால் இடத்தை அளக்கும் சான்று. ViewPosition தலை நகர்வைப் பின்பற்றும்.", "The reference used to measure hand or foot placement, such as Head, Hips, a knee, or ViewPosition (eye position). ViewPosition follows head movement." },
    { "Head, Hips, మోకాలు లేదా ViewPosition (కంటి స్థానం) వంటి చేతికాళ్ల స్థానం కొలిచే ఆధారం. ViewPosition తల కదలికను అనుసరిస్తుంది.", "The reference used to measure hand or foot placement, such as Head, Hips, a knee, or ViewPosition (eye position). ViewPosition follows head movement." },
    { "Head, Viewpoint ఎత్తు తేడా కొలవలేకపోయాం. View Position, అవతార్ స్కేల్ తనిఖీ చేయండి.", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head, Viewpoint లోతు తేడా కొలవలేకపోయాం. View Position, అవతార్ స్కేల్ తనిఖీ చేయండి.", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head-beinet ble ikke funnet, så høyden på posituren kan ikke beregnes.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head-beinet som trengs for å holde hodet synlig under fotografering, kan ikke hentes.", "Cannot get the Head bone needed to keep the head visible during photography." },
    { "Head-benet hittades inte, så posens höjd kan inte beräknas.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head-knoglen blev ikke fundet, så positurens højde kan ikke beregnes.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Head-knoglen, der skal holde hovedet synligt under fotografering, kan ikke hentes.", "Cannot get the Head bone needed to keep the head visible during photography." },
    { "Head-luuta ei löytynyt, joten asennon korkeutta ei voi laskea.", "The Head bone could not be found, so posture height cannot be calculated." },
    { "Headin ja Viewpointin korkeuseroa ei voitu mitata. Tarkista View Position ja avatarin mittakaava.", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Headin ja Viewpointin syvyyseroa ei voitu mitata. Tarkista View Position ja avatarin mittakaava.", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "HeadとViewpointの前後差を測定できません。View Positionとアバターのスケールを確認してください。", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "HeadとViewpointの高低差を測定できません。View Positionとアバターのスケールを確認してください。", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head와 Viewpoint의 깊이 차이를 측정할 수 없습니다. View Position과 아바타 스케일을 확인해 주세요.", "Could not measure the depth difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
    { "Head와 Viewpoint의 높이 차이를 측정할 수 없습니다. View Position과 아바타 스케일을 확인해 주세요.", "Could not measure the height difference between Head and Viewpoint. Check View Position and the avatar scale." },
