    { "Hướng chi nhìn thấy", "Visible limb orientation" },
    { "Hướng cổ tay hoặc cổ chân so với tham chiếu, không tính khác biệt trục xương Humanoid.", "The wrist or ankle orientation relative to the reference, excluding differences in Humanoid bone axes." },
    { "Hướng dẫn", "Manual" },
    { "Hướng dẫn:\n1. Sao chép mỗi mục một dòng vào bảng nhớ tạm.\n2. Nhấn nút tương ứng.\n3. Bỏ qua mục trùng.", "Instructions:\n1. Copy one item per line to the clipboard.\n2. Click the matching button.\n3. Duplicates are skipped." },
    { "Hướng gập khuỷu tay / đầu gối", "Elbow / knee bend direction" },
    { "Hỏi về cảnh báo này", "Ask about this warning" },
    { "Hỏi về lỗi này", "Ask about this error" },
    { "Hỗ trợ", "Support" },
    { "Hủy", "Cancel" },
    { "I bit di Girarsi e della riduzione delle deformazioni indicano la variazione rispetto alle impostazioni attuali. Condividono il blocco testa da 1 bit.", "Roll Over and distortion-reduction bit counts show the change from the current settings. They share the 1-bit head lock." },
    { "I clip già presenti nella destinazione non vengono aggiunti di nuovo.", "Clips already in the target will not be added again." },
    { "I dati dell'elenco delle pose sono mancanti.", "The pose list data is missing." },
    { "I seguenti pacchetti sono incompatibili con la versione attuale di Unity!", "The following packages are incompatible with current unity!" },
    { "I tipi selezionati usano questi movimenti. Gli altri mantengono le impostazioni originali.", "Selected types use these motions. Other types keep their original settings." },
    { "ID Paket", "Package ID" },
    { "ID balíčku", "Package ID" },
    { "ID del paquete", "Package ID" },
    { "ID do pacote", "Package ID" },
    { "ID du package", "Package ID" },
    { "ID gói", "Package ID" },
    { "ID pacchetto", "Package ID" },
    { "ID pakietu", "Package ID" },
    { "ID пакета", "Package ID" },
    { "ID แพ็กเกจ", "Package ID" },
    { "IK dostosowuje kończyny. Aby edytować ręcznie, wybierz poniżej „Wypal IK do korekcji”.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK düzeltmesi kaydedilemedi.", "Could not save the IK adjustment." },
    { "IK düzeltmesinden önceki referans poz.", "The reference pose before IK correction." },
    { "IK está ajustando las extremidades. Para editar manualmente, selecciona Integrar IK en los ajustes abajo.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK está ajustando os membros. Para editar manualmente, selecione Incorporar IK aos ajustes abaixo.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK für diese Pose aktivieren", "Enable IK for this pose" },
    { "IK in Anpassungen übernehmen", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK in aanpassingen vastleggen", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK işlenemedi", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK justerar armar och ben. Välj Baka in IK i justeringar nedan för att redigera manuellt.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK justerer arme og ben. Vælg Indarbejd IK i justeringer nedenfor for at redigere manuelt.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK justerer armer og ben. Velg Lagre IK i justeringer nedenfor for å redigere manuelt.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK kon niet worden vastgelegd", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK konnte nicht übernommen werden", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK kuralları uygulanamadı.", "The IK rules could not be applied." },
    { "IK kuralı {0}", "IK rule {0}" },
    { "IK passt die Gliedmaßen an. Wähle unten IK in Anpassungen übernehmen, um manuell zu bearbeiten.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK past de ledematen aan. Kies hieronder IK in aanpassingen vastleggen om handmatig te bewerken.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK sedang menyesuaikan anggota tubuh. Untuk mengedit manual, pilih Rekam hasil IK ke penyesuaian di bawah.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK sonucunu yeni bir düzeltme animasyonuna kaydedip bu pozun IK'sini kapatır. Sonra aşağıdan elle düzeltebilirsiniz.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "IK sta regolando gli arti. Per modificare manualmente, seleziona Integra IK nelle regolazioni qui sotto.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK säätää raajoja. Voit säätää käsin valitsemalla alla Tallenna IK säätöihin.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK upravuje končetiny. Pro ruční úpravu zvolte níže „Zapéct IK do korekcí“.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK uygulanacak pozu ve avatarı kontrol edin.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "IK uzuvları düzeltiyor. Elle düzenlemek için aşağıda IK'yi düzeltmeye işle'yi seçin.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK voor deze pose inschakelen", "Enable IK for this pose" },
    { "IK çözümünden önce özgün poz animasyonundan dirsek ve diz bükülme yönlerini okur.", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "IK đang chỉnh các chi. Để sửa thủ công, chọn Ghi IK vào hiệu chỉnh bên dưới.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK коригує кінцівки. Для ручного налаштування виберіть нижче «Запекти IK у корекцію».", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK корректирует конечности. Для ручной настройки выберите ниже «Запечь IK в коррекцию».", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK מתאים את הגפיים. כדי לערוך ידנית, בחרו בהטמעת IK בהתאמות למטה.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK अंगों को समायोजित कर रहा है। हाथ से संपादन के लिए नीचे “IK को समायोजन में बेक करें” चुनें।", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK को समायोजन में बेक करें", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK नियम {0}", "IK rule {0}" },
    { "IK नियम में वर्तमान अंग स्थिति, दिखने वाली दिशा और मोड़ की दिशा दर्ज की।", "Recorded the current limb position, visible orientation, and bend direction in the IK rule." },
    { "IK नियम लागू नहीं हो सके।", "The IK rules could not be applied." },
    { "IK परिणाम को नए समायोजन ऐनिमेशन में सहेजकर इस पोज़ का IK बंद करें। फिर नीचे हाथ से समायोजन कर सकते हैं।", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "IK बेक नहीं हो सका", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK लगाने वाला पोज़ और अवतार जाँचें।", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "IK समाधान से पहले मूल पोज़ ऐनिमेशन से कोहनी और घुटने के मोड़ की दिशा पढ़ें।", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "IK समायोजन सहेजा नहीं जा सका।", "Could not save the IK adjustment." },
    { "IK सुधार से पहले का संदर्भ पोज़।", "The reference pose before IK correction." },
    { "IK অঙ্গ সমন্বয় করছে। নিজে সম্পাদনার জন্য নিচে “IK সমন্বয়ে বেক করুন” বাছুন।", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK নিয়ম {0}", "IK rule {0}" },
    { "IK নিয়ম প্রয়োগ করা যায়নি।", "The IK rules could not be applied." },
    { "IK নিয়মে বর্তমান অঙ্গের অবস্থান, দৃশ্যমান দিক এবং বাঁকের দিক নথিভুক্ত হয়েছে।", "Recorded the current limb position, visible orientation, and bend direction in the IK rule." },
    { "IK প্রয়োগের পোজ ও অ্যাভাটার পরীক্ষা করুন।", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "IK ফলাফল নতুন সমন্বয় অ্যানিমেশনে সংরক্ষণ করে এই পোজের IK বন্ধ করুন। পরে নিচে নিজে সমন্বয় করতে পারবেন।", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "IK বেক করা যায়নি", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK সংশোধনের আগের রেফারেন্স পোজ।", "The reference pose before IK correction." },
    { "IK সমন্বয় সংরক্ষণ করা যায়নি।", "Could not save the IK adjustment." },
    { "IK সমন্বয়ে বেক করুন", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK সমাধানের আগে মূল পোজের অ্যানিমেশন থেকে কনুই ও হাঁটুর বাঁকের দিক পড়ুন।", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "IK கை-கால்களைத் திருத்துகிறது. கைமுறையாக மாற்ற கீழே “IK முடிவைத் திருத்தத்தில் பதியவும்” தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK திருத்தத்துக்கு முந்தைய சான்று போஸ்.", "The reference pose before IK correction." },
    { "IK திருத்தத்தைச் சேமிக்க முடியவில்லை.", "Could not save the IK adjustment." },
    { "IK தீர்ப்பதற்கு முன் அசல் போஸ் அசைவூட்டத்திலிருந்து முழங்கை மற்றும் முழங்கால் மடக்கத் திசைகளைப் படிக்கவும்.", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "IK பயன்படுத்த வேண்டிய போஸையும் அவதாரையும் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "IK முடிவைத் திருத்தத்தில் பதியவும்", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK முடிவைப் பதிய முடியவில்லை", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK முடிவைப் புதிய திருத்த அசைவூட்டத்தில் சேமித்து இந்த போஸின் IK-ஐ முடக்கவும். பின்னர் கீழே கைமுறையாகத் திருத்தலாம்.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "IK விதி {0}", "IK rule {0}" },
    { "IK விதிகளைப் பயன்படுத்த முடியவில்லை.", "The IK rules could not be applied." },
    { "IK చేతికాళ్లను సర్దుతోంది. చేతితో మార్చేందుకు కింద “IK ఫలితాన్ని సర్దుబాటులో స్థిరపరచు” ఎంచుకోండి.", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK నియమం {0}", "IK rule {0}" },
    { "IK నియమాలను వర్తింపజేయలేకపోయాం.", "The IK rules could not be applied." },
    { "IK పరిష్కారానికి ముందు అసలు భంగిమ యానిమేషన్ నుంచి మోచేయి, మోకాలి వంపు దిశలను చదవండి.", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "IK ఫలితాన్ని కొత్త సర్దుబాటు యానిమేషన్‌లో సేవ్ చేసి ఈ భంగిమ IKను నిలిపివేయండి. తర్వాత కింద చేతితో సర్దవచ్చు.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "IK ఫలితాన్ని సర్దుబాటులో స్థిరపరచు", "Bake IK into adjustments" },
    { "IK ఫలితాన్ని స్థిరపరచలేకపోయాం", "Could not bake IK" },
    { "IK వర్తింపజేసే భంగిమ, అవతార్‌ను తనిఖీ చేయండి.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "IK సర్దుబాటును సేవ్ చేయలేకపోయాం.", "Could not save the IK adjustment." },
    { "IK సవరణకు ముందున్న ఆధార భంగిమ.", "The reference pose before IK correction." },
    { "IK กำลังปรับแขนขา หากต้องการแก้เอง ให้เลือกบันทึกผล IK ลงการปรับแต่งด้านล่าง", "IK is adjusting the limbs. To edit manually, select Bake IK into adjustments below." },
    { "IK 결과를 새 조정 애니메이션에 저장하고 이 포즈의 IK를 끕니다. 이후 아래에서 수동으로 조정할 수 있습니다.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
