    { "Inserisci questo oggetto in un avatar dotato di componente VRCAvatarDescriptor.", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "Inspector ve oyun içi menü dili. Varsayılan olarak işletim sistemi dili kullanılır.", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector और गेम मेनू की भाषा। डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से OS की भाषा इस्तेमाल होती है।", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector के “सेटिंग जाँचें” में प्रभावित ऑब्जेक्ट चुनें, बताई समस्याएँ ठीक करके फिर प्रयास करें।", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspector में “प्रीबिल्ड अपडेट करें” से संदर्भ बहाल करने का प्रयास करें।", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspector ও গেমের মেনুর ভাষা। ডিফল্টে OS-এর ভাষা ব্যবহৃত হয়।", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector மற்றும் விளையாட்டுப் பட்டியின் மொழி. இயல்பாக இயக்க முறைமையின் மொழி பயன்படுத்தப்படும்.", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector'daki ayar kontrolünden ilgili nesneyi seçin, listelenen sorunları düzeltin ve yeniden deneyin.", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspector'daki “Ön oluşturmayı güncelle” ile başvuruyu geri yüklemeyi deneyin.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspector, గేమ్ మెనూ భాష. డిఫాల్ట్‌గా ఆపరేటింగ్ సిస్టమ్ భాష వాడబడుతుంది.", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector-এর “প্রিবিল্ড হালনাগাদ করুন” দিয়ে রেফারেন্স পুনরুদ্ধারের চেষ্টা করুন।", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspector-এর “সেটিংস পরীক্ষা”-য় সংশ্লিষ্ট অবজেক্ট নির্বাচন করে দেখানো সমস্যা ঠিক করুন, তারপর আবার চেষ্টা করুন।", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspector-இன் “அமைப்புகளைச் சரிபார்” பகுதியில் பாதிக்கப்பட்ட பொருளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து, காட்டப்பட்ட சிக்கல்களைச் சரிசெய்து மீண்டும் முயலவும்.", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspector-இல் “முன்கட்டமைப்பைப் புதுப்பி” மூலம் குறிப்பை மீட்டமைக்க முயலவும்.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspectorin ja pelivalikon kieli. Oletuksena käytetään käyttöjärjestelmän kieltä.", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspectorలో “ప్రీబిల్డ్ నవీకరించు” ద్వారా రిఫరెన్స్‌ను పునరుద్ధరించడానికి ప్రయత్నించండి.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspectorలో “సెట్టింగ్‌లను తనిఖీ చేయి” కింద సంబంధిత ఆబ్జెక్టును ఎంచుకుని, చూపిన సమస్యలను సరిచేసి మళ్లీ ప్రయత్నించండి.", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspectorの「プレビルドを更新」で復元を試してください。", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspectorの「設定の確認」で対象を選択し、表示された項目を直して再実行してください。", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "Inspector和游戏内菜单的语言。默认使用操作系统语言。", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector和遊戲內選單的語言。預設使用作業系統語言。", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector와 게임 내 메뉴의 언어입니다. 기본값은 운영체제 언어를 사용합니다.", "Language for the Inspector and in-game menu. Defaults to the operating system language." },
    { "Inspector의 ‘프리빌드 업데이트’로 참조 복원을 시도하세요.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Inspector의 설정 확인에서 해당 오브젝트를 선택하고 표시된 문제를 수정한 뒤 다시 시도해 주세요.", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
