    { "Jendela penyesuaian animasi terbuka. Tutup setelah selesai menyesuaikan.", "The animation adjustment window is open. Close it when you finish adjusting." },
    { "Jenis terpilih menggunakan gerakan ini. Jenis lain mempertahankan pengaturan asli.", "Selected types use these motions. Other types keep their original settings." },
    { "Jestleri kapat", "Disable Gestures" },
    { "Jetzt vorab erstellen?", "Prebuild now?" },
    { "Jeśli już zainstalowano:", "If already installed:" },
    { "Jeśli klatka piersiowa jest ustawiona nieprawidłowo, sprawdź Chest w Rig > Configure > Body oryginalnego modelu. Chest i Upper Chest przypisuje się osobno. Jeśli model nie ma odpowiedniej kości, zastosuj konfigurację twórcy.", "If the chest pose is incorrect, check Chest under Rig > Configure > Body on the original model. Chest and Upper Chest are separate assignments. If the model has no matching bone, follow the creator’s setup." },
    { "Jika aktif, animasi penyesuaian otomatis dibuat dari pengaturan IK ini, bukan animasi penyesuaian lama.", "When enabled, automatic adjustment animations are generated from these IK settings instead of the legacy adjustment animations." },
    { "Jika pose dada salah, periksa Chest di Rig > Configure > Body pada model asli. Chest dan Upper Chest ditetapkan terpisah. Jika model tidak memiliki tulang yang sesuai, ikuti pengaturan pembuatnya.", "If the chest pose is incorrect, check Chest under Rig > Configure > Body on the original model. Chest and Upper Chest are separate assignments. If the model has no matching bone, follow the creator’s setup." },
    { "Jika pose telentang dan tengkurap dipilih, lompat di tempat untuk beralih.", "When both supine and prone poses are selected, jump in place to switch between them." },
    { "Jika sudah terpasang:", "If already installed:" },
    { "Již nainstalováno", "Already installed" },
    { "Jo asennettu", "Already installed" },
    { "Jongkok", "Crouching" },
    { "Jos haluat käyttää asentoja tällä avatarilla, valitse Valitse objekti ja tarkista sen tunniste ja aktiivisuus.", "To use poses on this avatar, choose Select object and check its tag and active state." },
    { "Jos jo asennettu:", "If already installed:" },
    { "Jos rinnan asento on väärä, tarkista alkuperäisen mallin Chest kohdasta Rig > Configure > Body. Chest ja Upper Chest ovat eri määrityksiä. Noudata tekijän asetuksia, jos mallissa ei ole vastaavaa luuta.", "If the chest pose is incorrect, check Chest under Rig > Configure > Body on the original model. Chest and Upper Chest are separate assignments. If the model has no matching bone, follow the creator’s setup." },
