    { "Kích thước đầu (chênh sâu Head/Viewpoint)", "Head size (Head/Viewpoint depth difference)" },
    { "Körper-Bone", "Body bone" },
    { "Körperkorrektur", "Body correction" },
    { "Küçük resimler pozları ayırt etmeyi kolaylaştırır. Avatar derlemesi biraz uzar.", "Use thumbnails to identify poses. Avatar builds take a little longer." },
    { "Kąt obrotu", "Rotation angle" },
    { "Kąty podano w stopniach. Wybierz pozę leżącą i odblokuj głowę w menu VRChat.", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
