    { "Lors de la compilation, combine la pose normale au centre avec la pose latérale et son miroir. La première image de chaque clip est utilisée. Le centre vaut 0.5 ; les extrémités 0 et 1. La correction du sol est désactivée à 0 et vaut 25 % à 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Lorsque cette option est activée, les animations d'ajustement automatique sont générées à partir de ces réglages IK plutôt que des anciennes animations d'ajustement.", "When enabled, automatic adjustment animations are generated from these IK settings instead of the legacy adjustment animations." },
    { "Los ajustes han cambiado desde el último precálculo. Selecciona Actualizar precálculo para aplicar los actuales.", "Settings have changed since the last prebuild. Select Update prebuild to apply the current settings." },
    { "Los atuendos añadidos con Modular Avatar aparecen cuando se vuelven a capturar los iconos durante la compilación del avatar.", "Outfits added with Modular Avatar are included when icons are retaken during the avatar build." },
    { "Los bits de Darse vuelta y la reducción de deformaciones muestran el cambio respecto a los ajustes actuales. Comparten el bloqueo de cabeza de 1 bit.", "Roll Over and distortion-reduction bit counts show the change from the current settings. They share the 1-bit head lock." },
    { "Los clips ya presentes en el destino no se añadirán de nuevo.", "Clips already in the target will not be added again." },
    { "Los de eerste compilatiefout in de Console op, wacht tot het compileren klaar is en probeer opnieuw.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Los tipos seleccionados usan estos movimientos. Los demás mantienen sus ajustes originales.", "Selected types use these motions. Other types keep their original settings." },
    { "Los ángulos están en grados. Selecciona una pose tumbada y desbloquea la cabeza en el menú VRChat.", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
    { "Loại đã chọn dùng các chuyển động này. Các loại khác giữ thiết lập gốc.", "Selected types use these motions. Other types keep their original settings." },
    { "Lue kyynärpäiden ja polvien taivutussuunnat alkuperäisestä asentoanimaatiosta ennen IK-ratkaisua.", "Read elbow and knee bend directions from the original pose animation before solving IK." },
    { "Luettelo päivittyy, kun kohteita lisätään tai muutetaan. Valitse Lataa uudelleen, jos näkymä on vanhentunut.", "The list updates when items are added or changed. Select Reload if the display is stale." },
    { "Luk", "Close" },
    { "Luk Prefab-tilstand, og placer værktøjet i en avatar i scenen med en VRC Avatar Descriptor. Et prefab-aktiv i Project-vinduet kan ikke forberegnes alene.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Luk administration af forudindstillinger", "Close preset management" },
    { "Luk andre animationsforhåndsvisninger, herunder Animationsjustering, og prøv igen.", "Close other animation previews, including Animation Adjustment, and try again." },
