    { "Mecanim tarafından desteklenen bir animasyon atayın. Bir modelden geliyorsa modelin Rig ayarlarını kontrol edin.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanim में समर्थित ऐनिमेशन चुनें। मॉडल से आए ऐनिमेशन के लिए उस मॉडल की Rig सेटिंग भी जाँचें।", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanim ஆதரிக்கும் அசைவூட்டத்தை ஒதுக்கவும். மாதிரியிலிருந்து வந்திருந்தால் அதன் Rig அமைப்புகளையும் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanim మద్దతిచ్చే యానిమేషన్‌ను కేటాయించండి. అది మోడల్ నుంచి వస్తే ఆ మోడల్ Rig సెట్టింగ్‌లను కూడా తనిఖీ చేయండి.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanim-সমর্থিত অ্যানিমেশন নির্বাচন করুন। মডেল থেকে এলে তার Rig সেটিংসও পরীক্ষা করুন।", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanimで使用できるアニメーションを指定してください。元モデル由来ならRigの設定も確認してください。", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Mecanim에서 지원하는 애니메이션을 지정해 주세요. 모델에서 가져온 경우 해당 모델의 Rig 설정도 확인해 주세요.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
