    { "Motion Time 파라미터 이름을 설정하거나 Motion Time을 비활성화해 주세요.", "Set the Motion Time parameter name or disable Motion Time." },
    { "Motion Time-ஐப் பயன்படுத்து", "Use Motion Time" },
    { "Motion Timeのパラメータ名を設定するか、Motion Timeを無効にしてください。", "Set the Motion Time parameter name or disable Motion Time." },
    { "MotionTimeを使う", "Use Motion Time" },
    { "Move ao longo da orientação de referência. Os eixos desativados mantêm a posição da pose original.", "Moves along the reference orientation. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Move ao longo dos eixos do mundo. Os eixos desativados mantêm a posição da pose original.", "Moves along world axes. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Move o corpo inteiro, incluindo a cabeça, até 3 m para cima ou para baixo. Em Altura chão, 50% é a altura original.", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "Moyenne", "Medium" },
    { "Mrtvá zóna náklonu hlavy", "Head tilt dead zone" },
    { "Muat ulang", "Reload" },
    { "Muat ulang nilai penyesuaian semua pose? Perubahan yang belum disimpan akan hilang.", "Reload adjustment values for every pose? Unsaved changes will be lost." },
    { "Muat ulang semua", "Reload all" },
    { "Muestra el primer fotograma en la vista Scene. Al detener la vista previa, se restaura la pose original.", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Mueve según la orientación de referencia. Los ejes desactivados conservan la posición de la pose original.", "Moves along the reference orientation. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Mueve según los ejes del mundo. Los ejes desactivados conservan la posición de la pose original.", "Moves along world axes. Disabled axes keep their original pose position." },
    { "Mueve todo el cuerpo, incluida la cabeza, hasta 3 m hacia arriba o abajo. En Altura suelo, el 50% es la altura original.", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "Muistinkäytön muutos otettaessa tämä valinta käyttöön tai pois käytöstä.\nKäänny-kytkin: 1 bitti; pään kallistus: 8 bittiä; pään lukitus: 1 bitti.\nMuiden valintojen jo käyttämät parametrit lasketaan vain kerran.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Muistinkäytön muutos otettaessa tämä valinta käyttöön tai pois käytöstä.\nPään lukitus: 1 bitti, yhteinen Käänny-toiminnon kanssa.\nKäyttää 0 lisäbittiä, jos Käänny käyttää jo tätä parametria.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
