    { "Partage avec les autres la position et l'orientation du Mode photo. Une utilisation locale consomme 0 bit.", "Share Photo Mode position and rotation with others. Local-only photography uses 0 bits." },
    { "Parámetro de control", "Control parameter" },
    { "Parámetro de posición de reproducción", "Playback position parameter" },
    { "Parâmetro da posição de reprodução", "Playback position parameter" },
    { "Parâmetro de controle", "Control parameter" },
    { "Parâmetro de controlo", "Control parameter" },
    { "Pas een voorinstelling opnieuw toe of vergelijk de poselijst met een nieuw toegevoegde kopie van het gereedschap.", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool." },
    { "Pas een voorinstelling opnieuw toe of vergelijk de poselijst met een nieuw toegevoegde kopie van het gereedschap.\nSla de scène op en maak een reservekopie. Download daarna het product en Unisaki Posing System opnieuw met ALCOM / VCC. Blijft het probleem bestaan, open dan Hulp / Wijzigingen bovenaan de Inspector voor de handleiding en ondersteuning. Bewaar je aangepaste objecten en GeneratedResources.", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Pasang lisensi Cool Posing dan Unisaki Posing System pada komputer ini?", "Install licenses for Cool Posing and Unisaki Posing System on this computer?" },
    { "Pasang lisensi Kawaii Posing dan Unisaki Posing System pada komputer ini?", "Install licenses for Kawaii Posing and Unisaki Posing System on this computer?" },
    { "Passar avataren", "Compatible with avatar" },
    { "Passer til avataren", "Compatible with avatar" },
    { "Passt die Fußhöhe an, ohne den Kopf zu bewegen, um schwebende oder im Boden versunkene Füße zu korrigieren.", "Adjust foot height while keeping your head in place to correct floating or sunken feet." },
    { "Passt die Gliedmaßen an natürliche Positionen für die Proportionen dieses Avatars an.", "Adjust limbs to reach natural positions for this avatar's proportions." },
    { "Past de aanpassingswaarden van de andere kant toe op dit lichaamsdeel.", "Applies the opposite side's adjustment values to this body part." },
    { "Past de voethoogte aan zonder het hoofd te verplaatsen, om zwevende of in de vloer zakkende voeten te corrigeren.", "Adjust foot height while keeping your head in place to correct floating or sunken feet." },
    { "Past ledematen aan op natuurlijke posities voor de verhoudingen van deze avatar.", "Adjust limbs to reach natural positions for this avatar's proportions." },
    { "Pasta a eliminar: {0}\nOs prefabs e as animações dentro dela também serão eliminados. Se contiver dados personalizados ou ajustados, cancele e siga as instruções de migração. É necessária uma cópia de segurança para restaurar ficheiros eliminados.", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "Pasta a excluir: {0}\nOs prefabs e as animações dentro dela também serão excluídos. Se contiver dados personalizados ou ajustados, cancele e siga as instruções de migração. É necessária uma cópia de segurança para restaurar arquivos excluídos.", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "Pastikan Animator pose bersama aktif, tidak memiliki tag EditorOnly, dan memiliki referensi MA Merge Animator yang benar. Pertahankan berkas hasil pembuatan yang telah Anda sesuaikan.", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "Pastikan hanya satu Animator pose bersama yang aktif, tidak memiliki tag EditorOnly atau Missing Script, dan prefab standar sudah terpasang.", "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed." },
