    { "Penyesuaian Animasi", "Animation Adjustment" },
    { "Penyesuaian IK per pose aktif. Koreksi avatar dan animasi penyesuaian lama dilewati.", "Per-pose IK adjustment is enabled. Legacy avatar corrections and adjustment animations are bypassed." },
    { "Penyesuaian IK per pose aktif. Koreksi tubuh lama tidak digunakan.", "Per-pose IK adjustment is active. Legacy body correction is not used." },
    { "Penyesuaian anggota tubuh (IK) pose ini", "Limb adjustment (IK) for this pose" },
    { "Penyesuaian anggota tubuh otomatis", "Automatic limb adjustment" },
    { "Penyesuaian anggota tubuh otomatis dinonaktifkan untuk avatar ini.", "Automatic limb adjustment is disabled for this avatar." },
    { "Penyesuaian animasi dihentikan.", "Animation adjustment is stopped." },
    { "Penyesuaian manual belum disimpan", "Unsaved manual adjustments" },
    { "Per disattivare l’oscillazione da fermo predefinita serve una copia del Controller di compilazione: {0}", "Disabling default idle sway requires a copy of the build Controller: {0}" },
    { "Per evitare conflitti con le impostazioni Head Chop esistenti, disattiva «Tenere visibile la testa in Modalità foto» o controlla la destinazione Head nelle impostazioni esistenti. Le impostazioni per altre ossa, come le orecchie, possono restare attive insieme.", "To avoid overlapping Head Chop settings, turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or review the Head target in the existing settings. Settings for other bones, such as ears, can still be used together." },
    { "Per regolare i movimenti importati serve un avatar Humanoid valido.", "Adjusting imported motions requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "Per riattivare la licenza, reimporta l'installer della licenza.", "To activate the license again, reimport the license installer." },
    { "Per usare le pose su questo avatar, scegli Seleziona oggetto e controllane il tag e lo stato attivo.", "To use poses on this avatar, choose Select object and check its tag and active state." },
    { "Perbaiki kesalahan kompilasi pertama di Console, tunggu kompilasi selesai, lalu coba lagi.", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "Perbarui", "Update" },
    { "Perbarui gambar mini pose", "Update pose thumbnails" },
    { "Perbarui prabuild", "Update prebuild" },
    { "Perbedaan:", "Difference:" },
    { "Pergelangan kanan", "Right wrist" },
    { "Pergelangan kiri", "Left wrist" },
    { "Periksa Animator avatar asli dan referensi Avatar.", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "Periksa Animator pada objek yang sama dengan VRC Avatar Descriptor dan bandingkan pengaturannya dengan prefab avatar asli.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "Periksa Console", "See Console" },
    { "Periksa Console untuk menemukan kesalahan kompilasi atau komponen Missing Script.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Periksa Head di Rig > Configure model asli dan pastikan tulang kepala masih ada dalam adegan.", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "Periksa Humanoid dan penetapan Configure di pengaturan Inspector > Rig model asli. Ikuti pengaturan yang disarankan pembuat avatar.", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "Periksa Rig > Configure pada model asli dan tulang Head di scene.", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "Periksa animasi dan klip penyesuaian terkait dalam daftar pose. Untuk mengisolasi masalah, nonaktifkan sementara pose tersebut lalu coba lagi.", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "Periksa apakah Controller lain telah ditetapkan ke Animator pose bersama.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "Periksa apakah Controller lain telah ditetapkan ke Animator pose bersama.\nSimpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Periksa apakah menu pose di dalam alat telah dihapus atau dinonaktifkan.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled." },
    { "Periksa apakah menu pose di dalam alat telah dihapus atau dinonaktifkan.\nSimpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Periksa avatar tujuan [PS040]", "Check the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "Periksa kategori itu pada daftar pose dan pulihkan dari prasetel atau cadangan.", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "Periksa kesalahan impor seperti Missing Prefab di Console. Buka kembali adegan tujuan lalu coba lagi.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Periksa kesalahan sebelumnya di Console dan versi VRChat Avatars SDK.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Periksa kesalahan sebelumnya di Console serta versi Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK, dan Posing System.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Periksa klip yang diusulkan sebelum menambahkannya.", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "Periksa kolom Avatar pada Animator di akar avatar dan pengaturan Rig model asli.", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "Periksa pengaturan", "Check settings" },
    { "Periksa pengaturan Humanoid dan tulang Head avatar. Lihat pengecualian internal di Console untuk detail.", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "Periksa pengaturan lagi", "Check settings again" },
