    { "Periksa tujuan [PS040]", "Check the destination [PS040]" },
    { "Permet de se retourner en inclinant la tête. Compatible avec certaines poses allongées.", "Roll over by tilting your head. Supported by certain lying poses." },
    { "Permette di girarsi inclinando la testa. Disponibile per alcune pose sdraiate.", "Roll over by tilting your head. Supported by certain lying poses." },
