    { "Prefab / FBX avatar tujuan", "Target avatar prefabs / FBX" },
    { "Prefab / FBX avatar đích", "Target avatar prefabs / FBX" },
    { "Prefab / FBX degli avatar di destinazione", "Target avatar prefabs / FBX" },
    { "Prefab Mode बंद करके टूल को VRC Avatar Descriptor वाले दृश्य के अवतार में रखें। Project की Prefab एसेट का अकेले प्रीबिल्ड नहीं किया जा सकता।", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab Mode বন্ধ করে টুলটি দৃশ্যের VRC Avatar Descriptor-সহ অ্যাভাটারের মধ্যে রাখুন। Project-এর Prefab অ্যাসেট একা প্রিবিল্ড করা যায় না।", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab Mode-ஐ மூடி, காட்சியில் VRC Avatar Descriptor உள்ள அவதாருக்குள் கருவியை வைக்கவும். Project-இல் உள்ள Prefab வளத்தைத் தனியாக முன்கட்டமைக்க முடியாது.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab Modeను మూసి, సీన్‌లో VRC Avatar Descriptor ఉన్న అవతార్‌లో సాధనాన్ని ఉంచండి. Projectలోని Prefab అసెట్‌ను ఒంటరిగా ప్రీబిల్డ్ చేయలేరు.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab Mode를 닫고 씬의 VRC Avatar Descriptor가 있는 아바타 안에 도구를 배치해 주세요. Project 창의 Prefab 에셋만으로는 프리빌드할 수 없습니다.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab Modu'nu kapatıp aracı, sahnede VRC Avatar Descriptor içeren bir avatarın içine yerleştirin. Project penceresindeki bir prefab varlığı tek başına önceden oluşturulamaz.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab PosingSystem da applicare", "PosingSystem prefabs to apply" },
    { "Prefab PosingSystem untuk diterapkan", "PosingSystem prefabs to apply" },
