    { "Prefab a procurar:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab a procurar: {0}\nO instalador de licença comprado não conclui sozinho a instalação do produto. Em ALCOM / VCC, confirme que o produto e Unisaki Posing System foram adicionados ao projeto.\nSe já estiver instalado: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab alat tidak ditemukan [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab att hitta:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab att hitta: {0}\nDen köpta licensinstallationen ensam slutför inte produktinstallationen. Kontrollera i ALCOM / VCC att produkten och Unisaki Posing System har lagts till i projektet.\nOm redan installerat: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab bozuk veya Posing System bileşeni yok. Console'da Missing Script ve derleme hatalarını kontrol edin.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab bozuk veya Posing System bileşeni yok. Console'da eksik betikleri ve derleme hatalarını kontrol edin.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab buscado:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab buscado: {0}\nEl instalador de licencia comprado no completa por sí solo la instalación del producto. En ALCOM / VCC, comprueba que el producto y Unisaki Posing System están añadidos al proyecto.\nSi ya está instalado: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab cần tìm:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab cần tìm: {0}\nChỉ trình cài giấy phép đã mua chưa hoàn tất việc cài sản phẩm. Trong ALCOM / VCC, bảo đảm sản phẩm và Unisaki Posing System đã được thêm vào dự án.\nNếu đã cài: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab da cercare:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab da cercare: {0}\nL'installer della licenza acquistata non completa da solo l'installazione del prodotto. In ALCOM / VCC verifica che il prodotto e Unisaki Posing System siano aggiunti al progetto.\nSe già installato: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab da ferramenta não encontrado [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab de l'outil introuvable [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab de la herramienta no encontrado [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab dello strumento non trovato [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab di Project tidak dapat diubah langsung. Jalankan prabuild pada avatar di scene atau dalam mode Prefab.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Prefab eklenemedi [PS043]", "Cannot add prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab hỏng hoặc không có thành phần Posing System. Kiểm tra Missing Script và lỗi biên dịch trong Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab hỏng hoặc không có thành phần Posing System. Kiểm tra tập lệnh bị thiếu và lỗi biên dịch trong Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab je poškozený nebo nemá komponentu Posing System. Zkontrolujte Missing Script a chyby kompilace v Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab je poškozený nebo nemá komponentu Posing System. Zkontrolujte chybějící skripty a chyby kompilace v Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab jest uszkodzony lub nie ma komponentu Posing System. Sprawdź Missing Script i błędy kompilacji w Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab jest uszkodzony lub nie ma komponentu Posing System. Sprawdź brakujące skrypty i błędy kompilacji w Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
