    { "Prefab nástroje nenalezen [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab on vioittunut tai siitä puuttuu Posing System -komponentti. Tarkista Consolen Missing Script -ilmoitukset ja käännösvirheet.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab on vioittunut tai siitä puuttuu Posing System -komponentti. Tarkista Consolen puuttuvia skriptejä koskevat ilmoitukset ja käännösvirheet.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab recherché :", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab recherché : {0}\nL'installateur de licence acheté ne suffit pas à installer le produit. Dans ALCOM / VCC, vérifiez que le produit et Unisaki Posing System sont ajoutés à ce projet.\nSi déjà installé : {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab rusak atau tidak memiliki komponen Posing System. Periksa Missing Script dan kesalahan kompilasi di Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab rusak atau tidak memiliki komponen Posing System. Periksa skrip yang hilang dan kesalahan kompilasi di Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab som skal finnes:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab som skal finnes: {0}\nDen kjøpte lisensinstallasjonsfilen alene fullfører ikke produktinstallasjonen. Kontroller i ALCOM / VCC at produktet og Unisaki Posing System er lagt til dette prosjektet.\nHvis allerede installert: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab v Project nelze měnit přímo. Proveďte předgenerování avatara ve scéně nebo v režimu Prefab.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Prefab yang dicari:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab yang dicari: {0}\nPenginstal lisensi yang dibeli saja belum menyelesaikan pemasangan produk. Di ALCOM / VCC, pastikan produk dan Unisaki Posing System ditambahkan ke proyek.\nJika sudah terpasang: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab yerleştirilemedi [PS043]", "Could not place prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab yüklenemedi [PS042]", "Could not load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab инструмента не найден [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab повреждён или не содержит компонента Posing System. Проверьте Missing Script и ошибки компиляции в Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab повреждён или не содержит компонента Posing System. Проверьте отсутствующие скрипты и ошибки компиляции в Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab пошкоджено або він не містить компонента Posing System. Перевірте Missing Script та помилки компіляції в Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab пошкоджено або він не містить компонента Posing System. Перевірте відсутні скрипти та помилки компіляції в Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab інструмента не знайдено [PS041]", "Tool prefab not found [PS041]" },
    { "Prefab לחיפוש:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab לחיפוש: {0}\nמתקין הרישיון שנרכש אינו משלים לבדו את התקנת המוצר. ב-ALCOM / VCC ודאו שהמוצר ו-Unisaki Posing System נוספו לפרויקט.\nאם כבר מותקן: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab المطلوب:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Prefab المطلوب: {0}\nمثبّت الترخيص المشترى وحده لا يكمل تثبيت المنتج. تأكد في ALCOM / VCC من إضافة المنتج وUnisaki Posing System إلى هذا المشروع.\nإذا كان مثبتًا بالفعل: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Prefab تالف أو لا يحتوي على مكوّن Posing System. افحص Missing Script وأخطاء التجميع في Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab تالف أو لا يحتوي على مكوّن Posing System. افحص النصوص المفقودة وأخطاء التجميع في Console.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab खराब है या उसमें Posing System घटक नहीं है। Console में Missing Script और संकलन त्रुटियाँ जाँचें।", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab खराब है या उसमें Posing System घटक नहीं है। Console में गायब स्क्रिप्ट और संकलन त्रुटियाँ जाँचें।", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab जोड़ नहीं सकते [PS043]", "Cannot add prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab रखा नहीं जा सका [PS043]", "Could not place prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab लोड नहीं कर सकते [PS042]", "Cannot load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab लोड नहीं हो सका [PS042]", "Could not load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত অথবা Posing System কম্পোনেন্ট নেই। Console-এ Missing Script ও কম্পাইল ত্রুটি পরীক্ষা করুন।", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত অথবা Posing System কম্পোনেন্ট নেই। Console-এ অনুপস্থিত স্ক্রিপ্ট ও কম্পাইল ত্রুটি পরীক্ষা করুন।", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab বসানো যায়নি [PS043]", "Could not place prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab যোগ করা যাচ্ছে না [PS043]", "Cannot add prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab লোড করা যাচ্ছে না [PS042]", "Cannot load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab লোড করা যায়নি [PS042]", "Could not load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab ஏற்ற முடியாது [PS042]", "Cannot load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab சேதமடைந்துள்ளது அல்லது Posing System கூறு இல்லை. Console-இல் Missing Script மற்றும் தொகுத்தல் பிழைகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab சேதமடைந்துள்ளது அல்லது Posing System கூறு இல்லை. Console-இல் காணாத நிரல்களையும் தொகுத்தல் பிழைகளையும் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
