    { "Prefabが破損しているか、Posing Systemコンポーネントがありません。ConsoleのMissing Script・コンパイルエラーを確認してください。", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefabを読み込めません [PS042]", "Cannot load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefabを配置できません [PS043]", "Cannot add prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab已损坏或没有Posing System组件。请检查Console中的Missing Script和编译错误。", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab已损坏或没有Posing System组件。请检查Console中的脚本缺失和编译错误。", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab已損壞或沒有Posing System元件。請檢查Console中的Missing Script和編譯錯誤。", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab已損壞或沒有Posing System元件。請檢查Console中的指令碼遺失和編譯錯誤。", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab編集画面を閉じ、HierarchyでVRC Avatar Descriptorが付いたアバターの子にツールを配置してください。Project内のPrefab単体ではプレビルドできません。", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Prefab을 배치하지 못했습니다 [PS043]", "Could not place prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab을 불러오지 못했습니다 [PS042]", "Could not load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab을 불러올 수 없습니다 [PS042]", "Cannot load prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Prefab을 추가할 수 없습니다 [PS043]", "Cannot add prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Prefab이 손상되었거나 Posing System 컴포넌트가 없습니다. Console에서 누락된 스크립트와 컴파일 오류를 확인해 주세요.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for missing scripts and compilation errors." },
    { "Prefab이 손상되었거나 Posing System 컴포넌트가 없습니다. Console의 Missing Script 및 컴파일 오류를 확인해 주세요.", "The prefab is damaged or has no Posing System component. Check the Console for Missing Script and compilation errors." },
    { "Preset", "Presets" },
    { "Preset creato. Usa Ricarica nella selezione dei preset per aggiornare l'elenco.", "Preset created. Use Reload in the preset picker to refresh the list." },
    { "Preset ufficiali Unisaki Studio", "Official Unisaki Studio presets" },
    { "Preset utente", "User presets" },
    { "Preset został usunięty lub jest niezgodny z tym narzędziem. Wybierz „Odśwież” w Inspector.", "The preset was removed or is incompatible with this tool. Select Reload in the Inspector." },
    { "Preset został usunięty lub nie pasuje do tego narzędzia. Wybierz „Odśwież”, aby odświeżyć listę.", "This preset was deleted or cannot be applied to this tool. Choose Reload to refresh the list." },
    { "Preset został utworzony. Wybierz „Odśwież” w oknie presetów, aby odświeżyć listę.", "Preset created. Use Reload in the preset picker to refresh the list." },
    { "Presety", "Presets" },
    { "Presety użytkownika", "User presets" },
    { "Previsualiza y perfecciona tus poses.", "Preview and fine-tune your poses." },
    { "Prima di aggiungere lo strumento, seleziona nella Hierarchy un avatar con VRC Avatar Descriptor o uno dei suoi figli.", "Select an avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor, or one of its children, in the Hierarchy before adding the tool." },
    { "Pro kost hlavy je již nastaven VRC Head Chop.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "Pro opětovnou aktivaci licence znovu importujte instalátor licence.", "To activate the license again, reimport the license installer." },
    { "Pro položku {1} ({2}) v {0} je zapnuta vlastní ikona, ale není přiřazen obrázek.", "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned." },
    { "Pro použití ve VRChat také zapněte přetočení na kartě funkcí.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "Pro produkt není zaregistrována póza referenčního avatara.", "No reference avatar pose is registered for this product." },
    { "Pro stání / chůzi / běh, přikrčení a polohu na břiše použijte BlendTree s pohybem. Pro jednu stojící pózu použijte „Jen stání“.", "Use a BlendTree with locomotion for Standing / walking / running, Crouching, and Prone. Use Standing only for a single standing pose." },
    { "Pro tohoto uživatele OS nebyla nalezena licence Unisaki Posing System. Importujte do projektu Unity instalátor z oficiálního nákupu. Licenci instalujte jednou pro každého uživatele OS na každém počítači.", "No Unisaki Posing System license was found for this OS user. Import the installer from your official purchase download into this Unity project. Install the license once for each OS user on each computer." },
    { "Pro tuto funkci zapněte animaci dýchání v usnadnění.", "Enable Animate breathing under Convenience to use this feature." },
    { "Pro tuto funkci zapněte režim focení ve funkcích nabídky.", "Enable Photo Mode under Menu features to use this feature." },
    { "Pro tuto pózu nejsou data automatické korekce.", "No automatic adjustment data exists for this pose." },
    { "Probeer de verwijzing te herstellen met ‘Voorberekening bijwerken’ in de Inspector.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
