    { "Progi wysokości", "Height Thresholds" },
    { "Project içindeki bir Prefab doğrudan değiştirilemez. Sahnedeki bir avatar için veya Prefab modunda ön oluşturma yapın.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project में Prefab को सीधे नहीं बदल सकते। सीन के अवतार पर या Prefab मोड में प्रीबिल्ड करें।", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project में क्लिप चुनने से पहले ऊपर दाएँ ताले से Inspector लॉक करें।", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project में चुनी क्लिप आयात करें", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Project में चुने Prefab जोड़ें", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Project में चुने फ़ाइल नाम जोड़ें", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Project'te klip seçmeden önce sağ üstteki asma kilitle Inspector'ı kilitleyin.", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project'te seçili dosya adlarını ekle", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Project'te seçili klipleri içe aktar", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Project'te seçili prefabları ekle", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Project-näkymän Prefabia ei voi muokata suoraan. Tee esikoonti scenessä olevalle avatarille tai käytä Prefab-tilaa.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project-এ ক্লিপ বাছার আগে ওপরের ডান তালা দিয়ে Inspector লক করুন।", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project-এ বাছা Prefab যোগ করুন", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Project-এ বাছা ক্লিপ আমদানি করুন", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Project-এ বাছা ফাইলনাম যোগ করুন", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Project-এর Prefab সরাসরি বদলানো যায় না। সিনের অ্যাভাটারে বা Prefab মোডে প্রিবিল্ড চালান।", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project-இல் உள்ள Prefab-ஐ நேரடியாக மாற்ற முடியாது. scene-இல் உள்ள அவதாரில் அல்லது Prefab பயன்முறையில் முன்கட்டமைப்பை இயக்கவும்.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project-இல் கிளிப்புகளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்குமுன் மேல் வலது பூட்டால் Inspector-ஐப் பூட்டவும்.", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project-இல் தேர்ந்த Prefab-களைச் சேர்", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Project-இல் தேர்ந்த கிளிப்புகளை இறக்குமதி செய்", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Project-இல் தேர்ந்த கோப்புப் பெயர்களைச் சேர்", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Projectలో ఎంచుకున్న Prefabలు జోడించు", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Projectలో ఎంచుకున్న క్లిప్‌లు దిగుమతి చేయి", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Projectలో ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్ పేర్లు జోడించు", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Projectలో క్లిప్‌లు ఎంచుకునే ముందు కుడి పై తాళంతో Inspectorను లాక్ చేయండి.", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project‌లోని Prefab‌ను నేరుగా మార్చలేరు. సీన్‌లోని అవతార్‌పై లేదా Prefab మోడ్‌లో ప్రీబిల్డ్ చేయండి.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Projectで選ぶときは、Inspector右上の鍵を閉じてから選択してください。", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Projectで選択中のPrefabを追加", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Projectで選択中のクリップを読み込む", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Projectで選択中のファイル名を追加", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Project内のPrefabを直接変更できません。シーン内のアバター、またはPrefab編集モードでプレビルドしてください。", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
    { "Project에서 선택한 Prefab 추가", "Add prefabs selected in Project" },
    { "Project에서 선택한 클립 가져오기", "Import clips selected in Project" },
    { "Project에서 선택한 파일 이름 추가", "Add filenames selected in Project" },
    { "Project에서 클립을 선택하기 전에 오른쪽 위 자물쇠로 Inspector를 잠가 주세요.", "Lock the Inspector using the top-right padlock before selecting clips in Project." },
    { "Project의 Prefab은 직접 변경할 수 없습니다. 씬의 아바타 또는 Prefab 모드에서 프리빌드를 실행하세요.", "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode." },
