    { "Régler l'orientation", "Adjust direction" },
    { "Réinitialiser", "Reset" },
    { "Réinitialiser les valeurs d'ajustement de toutes les poses ?", "Reset the adjustment values for every pose?" },
    { "Rétablir la T-pose de l'avatar", "Reset avatar to T-pose" },
    { "Rétablissez le Controller standard de l'outil. Les Animator Override Controllers ne sont pas pris en charge ici.", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here." },
    { "Rétablissez le Controller standard de l'outil. Les Animator Override Controllers ne sont pas pris en charge ici.\nEnregistrez et sauvegardez la scène, puis téléchargez à nouveau le produit et Unisaki Posing System avec ALCOM / VCC. Si le problème persiste, ouvrez Aide / Historique en haut de l'Inspector pour consulter le manuel et l'assistance. Conservez vos objets ajustés et GeneratedResources.", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Rétablissez le Humanoid Avatar du modèle d'origine dans le champ Avatar de l'Animator. Utilisez l'asset Avatar de ce modèle.", "Restore the Humanoid Avatar for this avatar’s original model in the Animator Avatar field. Use the Avatar asset for this model." },
    { "Różnica:", "Difference:" },
    { "Rückenlage", "Supine" },
    { "Rückwärtsknicken der Knie verhindern", "Prevent reverse knee bending" },
    { "Rơi dài", "Long fall" },
    { "Rơi ngắn", "Short fall" },
    { "SDK'ets {1} kunne ikke føjes til posituren »{0}«.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "SDK-{1} kon niet worden toegevoegd aan pose ‘{0}’.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "SDK-{1} konnte nicht zur Pose „{0}“ hinzugefügt werden.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "SDK:n kohdetta {1} ei voitu lisätä asentoon ”{0}”.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "Saat build, gabungkan pose biasa di tengah dengan pose samping dan cerminannya. Bingkai pertama setiap klip digunakan. Tengah adalah 0.5; ujungnya 0 dan 1. Koreksi lantai nonaktif pada 0 dan 25% pada 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Saat dipilih", "On selection" },
    { "Sabit uzunluk (yalnızca avatar ölçeği)", "Fixed length (avatar scale only)" },
    { "Sahip sahne belirlenemedi.", "Could not identify the owning scene." },
    { "Sahne Hierarchy'sinde VRC Avatar Descriptor içeren avatar örneğini seçin. Prefab varlığına veya Prefab Modu'nda ekleme desteklenmez.", "Select an avatar instance with a VRC Avatar Descriptor in the scene Hierarchy. Adding to a prefab asset or Prefab Mode is not supported." },
    { "Sahneyi kaydedip yedekleyin, ardından ürünü ve Unisaki Posing System'i ALCOM / VCC ile yeniden indirin. Sorun sürerse kılavuz ve destek için Inspector'ın üstündeki yardım ve değişiklikleri açın. Düzenlediğiniz nesneleri ve GeneratedResources'u koruyun.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Sair da foto", "Exit Photo Mode" },
    { "Saisissez le nom de l'avatar.", "Enter the avatar name." },
    { "Sakelar ini hanya memengaruhi pratinjau penyesuaian, bukan data tersimpan, gambar mini, atau hasil akhir. Pembatas lutut tetap aktif.", "This toggle affects only the adjustment preview, not saved data, thumbnails or final output. The knee clamp remains enabled." },
    { "Salin", "Copy" },
    { "Salin dari {0}", "Copy from {0}" },
    { "Salin rincian kegagalan sebelumnya", "Copy previous failure details" },
    { "Salin/simpan", "Copy/save" },
    { "Salinan pengukuran tidak memiliki Humanoid Animator yang valid.", "The measurement clone has no valid Humanoid Animator." },
    { "Salir de foto", "Exit Photo Mode" },
    { "Salta", "Skip" },
    { "Salto", "Jump" },
    { "Salva", "Save" },
    { "Salva / gestisci preset", "Save / manage presets" },
    { "Salva e continua", "Save and continue" },
    { "Salva e crea un backup della scena, poi scarica di nuovo il prodotto e Unisaki Posing System con ALCOM / VCC. Se il problema persiste, apri Aiuto / Cronologia in cima all'Inspector per il manuale e l'assistenza. Conserva gli oggetti modificati e GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Salva i valori di regolazione nel file.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Salva il risultato IK in una nuova animazione di regolazione e disattiva IK per questa posa. Poi puoi regolarla manualmente qui sotto.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "Salva le regolazioni delle animazioni modificate.", "Saves adjustments for animations that have changes." },
