    { "Scene atau Prefab tujuan tidak dapat diidentifikasi.", "Cannot identify the destination scene or Prefab." },
    { "Scene görünümünde ilk kareyi önizler. Önizleme durdurulunca özgün poz geri yüklenir.", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Scene pemilik tidak dapat diidentifikasi.", "Could not identify the owning scene." },
    { "Scene दृश्य में पहला फ़्रेम देखें। पूर्वावलोकन रोकने पर मूल पोज़ लौटता है।", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Scene ভিউতে প্রথম ফ্রেমের পূর্বরূপ দেখুন। পূর্বরূপ থামালে মূল পোজ ফিরে আসে।", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Scene காட்சியில் முதல் படச்சட்டத்தை முன்னோட்டமிடவும். முன்னோட்டத்தை நிறுத்தினால் அசல் போஸ் மீளும்.", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Scene వీక్షణలో మొదటి ఫ్రేమ్ ముందుచూపు చూడండి. ముందుచూపును ఆపితే అసలు భంగిమ తిరిగి వస్తుంది.", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Scene 뷰에서 첫 프레임을 미리 봅니다. 미리보기를 중지하면 원래 포즈로 돌아갑니다.", "Preview the first frame in the Scene view. Stopping the preview restores the original pose." },
    { "Schakel Ademhaling animeren onder Gemaksfuncties in om dit te gebruiken.", "Enable Animate breathing under Convenience to use this feature." },
    { "Schakel Fotomodus onder Menufuncties in om dit te gebruiken.", "Enable Photo Mode under Menu features to use this feature." },
    { "Schakel IK alleen voor deze pose uit als die niet bij je avatar past. Andere poses en avatars blijven ongewijzigd.", "Disable IK for just this pose if it does not suit your avatar. Other poses and avatars are unaffected." },
    { "Schakel de gewenste poses in de lijst in. Er is geen wijziging nodig als de categorie bewust leeg is.", "Enable the desired poses in the pose list. No change is needed if this category is intentionally empty." },
    { "Schakel dit in als trackingvergrendelingen niet goed werken samen met andere gereedschappen.", "Enable this if tracking locks do not work correctly alongside other tools." },
    { "Schakel ook Omdraaien in op het tabblad Functies om dit in VRChat te gebruiken.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "Schakel “Hoofd zichtbaar houden in Fotomodus” uit of controleer het Head-doel in de bestaande instellingen om overlappende Head Chop-instellingen te voorkomen. Instellingen voor andere botten, zoals oren, kunnen samen worden gebruikt.", "To avoid overlapping Head Chop settings, turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or review the Head target in the existing settings. Settings for other bones, such as ears, can still be used together." },
    { "Schakel “Hoofd zichtbaar houden in Fotomodus” uit of voeg bestaande VRC Head Chop-componenten samen om één componentplaats vrij te maken.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "Schakelt ademhaling in of uit in VRChat. Andere gebruikers zien de verandering ook.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "Schakelt een parameterbereik in dat vijfmaal zo groot is als normaal.", "Enables a parameter range five times wider than normal." },
    { "Schakelt het standaard stilstaande wiegen van VRChat uit en behoudt de ademhalingsanimatie van dit gereedschap.", "Disable VRChat's default idle sway while keeping this tool's breathing animation." },
    { "Schaltet die Atmung im VRChat-Menü ein oder aus. Andere sehen die Änderung ebenfalls.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "Schließe andere Animationsvorschauen einschließlich Animationsanpassung und versuche es erneut.", "Close other animation previews, including Animation Adjustment, and try again." },
    { "Schließe den Prefab-Modus und platziere das Werkzeug in einem Szenenavatar mit VRC Avatar Descriptor. Ein Prefab-Asset im Project-Fenster kann nicht allein vorberechnet werden.", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "Schließen", "Close" },
    { "Schnell", "Fast" },
    { "Schowek jest pusty.", "The clipboard is empty." },
    { "Schránka je prázdná.", "The clipboard is empty." },
    { "Schuifbereik: -1 tot 1. Je kunt waarden buiten dit bereik typen.", "Slider range: -1 to 1. You can type values outside this range." },
    { "Schwach", "Weak" },
    { "Schwach, Mittel und Stark verwenden langsame Atmung, Schnell verwendet schnelle Atmung. Pro Pose wählbar.", "Low, Medium and High use slow breathing; Rapid uses fast breathing. Choose per pose." },
    { "Sconosciuta", "Unknown" },
