    { "Tanyakan tentang kesalahan ini", "Ask about this error" },
    { "Tanyakan tentang peringatan ini", "Ask about this warning" },
    { "Tanılama", "Diagnostics " },
    { "Tar bort den genererade bildfilen. Du kan sedan återskapa den med ”Ta om ikoner”.", "Delete the generated image file. You can recreate it afterward with “Retake icons”." },
    { "Tar bort äldre inställningar för {0} från avataren. Säkerhetskopiera projektet först så att du kan återställa och jämföra dina justeringar.", "Remove legacy settings for {0}. This cleanup is for old avatar settings. Back up the project first so you can recover and compare your adjustments." },
    { "Tarkista Console", "See Console" },
    { "Tarkista Console-ikkunan edeltävät virheet ja VRChat Avatars SDK:n versio.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "Tarkista Console-ikkunan edeltävät virheet sekä Unityn, VRChat Avatars SDK:n ja Posing Systemin versiot.", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "Tarkista Console-ikkunasta käännösvirheet ja Missing Script -komponentit.", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "Tarkista Consolen tuontivirheet, kuten Missing Prefab. Avaa kohdescene uudelleen ja yritä uudelleen.", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "Tarkista Head alkuperäisen mallin Rig > Configure -asetuksista ja varmista, että pääluu on yhä scenessä.", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "Tarkista alkuperäisen avatarin Animator ja Avatar-viite.", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "Tarkista alkuperäisen mallin Inspector > Rig -asetusten Humanoid ja Configure-määritykset. Noudata avatarin tekijän suosituksia.", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "Tarkista alkuperäisen mallin Rig > Configure ja näkymän Head-luu.", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "Tarkista asento ja avatar, johon IK:ta käytetään.", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "Tarkista asetukset", "Check settings" },
    { "Tarkista asetukset tai päivitä esikoonti. Katso Inspectoria.", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "Tarkista asetukset uudelleen", "Check settings again" },
    { "Tarkista avatarin Humanoid-asetukset ja Head-luu. Lisätietoja on Console-ikkunan sisemmässä poikkeuksessa.", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "Tarkista avatarin juuressa olevan Animator-komponentin Avatar-kenttä ja alkuperäisen mallin Rig-asetukset.", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "Tarkista ehdotetut leikkeet ennen niiden lisäämistä.", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "Tarkista kohde [PS040]", "Check the destination [PS040]" },
    { "Tarkista kohdeavatar [PS040]", "Check the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "Tarkista kyseinen animaatio ja säätöleike asentoluettelosta. Rajaa ongelma poistamalla asento väliaikaisesti käytöstä ja yrittämällä uudelleen.", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "Tarkista luokka asentoluettelosta ja palauta se esiasetuksesta tai varmuuskopiosta.", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "Tarkista samalla objektilla kuin VRC Avatar Descriptor oleva Animator ja vertaa sen asetuksia avatarin alkuperäiseen prefabiin.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "Tarkista, että yhteinen asento-Animator on aktiivinen, sillä ei ole EditorOnly-tunnistetta ja MA Merge Animator -viittaus on oikea. Säilytä muokkaamasi luodut tiedostot.", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "Tarkista, onko työkalun sisällä oleva asentovalikko poistettu tai poistettu käytöstä.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled." },
    { "Tarkista, onko työkalun sisällä oleva asentovalikko poistettu tai poistettu käytöstä.\nTallenna scene ja ota siitä varmuuskopio. Lataa tuote ja Unisaki Posing System sitten uudelleen ALCOM / VCC:llä. Jos ongelma jatkuu, avaa Inspectorin yläreunan Ohje / Muutokset, josta löydät käyttöohjeen ja tuen. Säilytä muokatut objektit ja GeneratedResources.", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Tarkista, onko yhteiselle asento-Animatorille määritetty toinen ohjain.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "Tarkista, onko yhteiselle asento-Animatorille määritetty toinen ohjain.\nTallenna scene ja ota siitä varmuuskopio. Lataa tuote ja Unisaki Posing System sitten uudelleen ALCOM / VCC:llä. Jos ongelma jatkuu, avaa Inspectorin yläreunan Ohje / Muutokset, josta löydät käyttöohjeen ja tuen. Säilytä muokatut objektit ja GeneratedResources.", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Tarkistetaan riippuvuuksia…", "Checking dependencies..." },
    { "Tarvitsen apua esikoonnin päivittämiseen.", "I need help updating the prebuild." },
    { "Tato póza nemá automatickou korekci IK. Používá původní pózu a ruční korekce.", "This pose has no automatic IK adjustment. It uses the original pose and manual adjustments." },
    { "Tavallisesti 1. Pienemmät arvot säilyttävät enemmän lähdeasentoa.", "Usually 1. Lower values retain more of the source pose." },
    { "Tavallisesti menuName_poseName. Arvo täytetään automaattisesti lisättäessä kohta säätöikkunasta.", "Normally menuName_poseName. Adding an entry from the adjustment window fills it automatically." },
    { "Tay phải", "Right arm" },
    { "Tay trái", "Left arm" },
    { "Te bewegen ledemaat", "Limb to move" },
    { "Te installeren pakketten", "Packages to install" },
    { "Te verwijderen bestanden/mappen", "Files/folders to remove" },
    { "Te verwijderen map: {0}\nDe prefabs en animaties erin worden ook verwijderd. Bevat deze eigen of aangepaste gegevens, annuleer dan en volg de migratie-instructies. Een reservekopie is nodig om verwijderde bestanden te herstellen.", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "Te verwijderen oude pakketten", "Legacy packages to remove" },
    { "Te zoeken prefab:", "Prefab to find:" },
    { "Te zoeken prefab: {0}\nHet gekochte licentie-installatiepakket alleen voltooit de productinstallatie niet. Controleer in ALCOM / VCC of het product en Unisaki Posing System aan dit project zijn toegevoegd.\nIndien al geïnstalleerd: {1}", "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}" },
    { "Tehdäänkö esikoonti nyt?", "Prebuild now?" },
    { "Tekijätiedot tallentavat käsien ja jalkojen kohteet kullekin mukana olevalle asennolle.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "Tekijätiedot tallentavat käsien ja jalkojen kohteet kullekin mukana olevalle asennolle. Luo yksi tiedosto tuotetta kohti; nämä ovat erillään avatarikohtaisista asetuksista.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "Tekukan lutut minimum (derajat)", "Minimum knee bend (degrees)" },
    { "Tekukan siku / lutut", "Elbow / knee bending" },
    { "Telentang", "Supine" },
    { "Telunjuk (kanan) — Merenggangkan", "Right Index Spread" },
    { "Telunjuk (kiri) — Merenggangkan", "Left Index Spread" },
    { "Telunjuk 1 (kanan) — Meluruskan", "Right Index 1 Stretched" },
    { "Telunjuk 1 (kiri) — Meluruskan", "Left Index 1 Stretched" },
    { "Telunjuk 2 (kanan) — Meluruskan", "Right Index 2 Stretched" },
    { "Telunjuk 2 (kiri) — Meluruskan", "Left Index 2 Stretched" },
    { "Telunjuk 3 (kanan) — Meluruskan", "Right Index 3 Stretched" },
    { "Telunjuk 3 (kiri) — Meluruskan", "Left Index 3 Stretched" },
    { "Tempatkan objek ini di dalam objek avatar yang memiliki komponen VRCAvatarDescriptor.", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "Ten awatar nie jest Humanoid. Narzędzie wymaga Humanoid Avatar przypisanego do Animator.", "This avatar is not Humanoid. This tool requires a Humanoid Avatar assigned to its Animator." },
    { "Ten komputer nie ma licencji Unisaki Posing System. Kup Kawaii Posing na BOOTH i zainstaluj licencję na tym komputerze.", "This computer is not licensed to use Unisaki Posing System. Purchase Kawaii Posing from BOOTH and install the license on this computer." },
    { "Ten produkt nie ma danych odniesienia.", "This product has no reference data." },
    { "Ten wpis używa starego formatu współrzędnych. Pokaż awatar odniesienia w oknie dostosowywania i", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and " },
    { "Ten wpis używa starego formatu współrzędnych. Pokaż awatar odniesienia w oknie dostosowywania i raz przechwyć bieżące pozycje kończyn. Do ponownego przechwycenia zachowywana jest orientacja kończyn animacji źródłowej.", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
    { "Ten wygenerowany zasób jest poza zarządzanym zakresem.", "This generated asset is outside the managed scope." },
    { "Tenere visibile la testa in Modalità foto", "Keep your head visible in Photo Mode" },
    { "Tengkurap", "Prone" },
    { "Tente restaurar a referência com «Atualizar pré-cálculo» no Inspector.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Tente restaurar a referência com “Atualizar pré-cálculo” no Inspector.", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "Tento avatar není Humanoid. Nástroj vyžaduje Humanoid Avatar přiřazený v Animator.", "This avatar is not Humanoid. This tool requires a Humanoid Avatar assigned to its Animator." },
    { "Tento počítač nemá licenci Cool Posing.", "Cool Posing is not licensed on this computer." },
    { "Tento počítač nemá licenci Kawaii Posing.", "Kawaii Posing is not licensed on this computer." },
    { "Tento počítač nemá licenci Unisaki Posing System.", "Unisaki Posing System is not licensed on this computer." },
    { "Tento počítač nemá licenci Unisaki Posing System. Kupte Kawaii Posing na BOOTH a nainstalujte licenci na tento počítač.", "This computer is not licensed to use Unisaki Posing System. Purchase Kawaii Posing from BOOTH and install the license on this computer." },
    { "Tento produkt nemá referenční data.", "This product has no reference data." },
    { "Tento vygenerovaný prostředek je mimo spravovaný rozsah.", "This generated asset is outside the managed scope." },
    { "Terapkan", "Apply" },
    { "Terapkan kembali prasetel atau bandingkan daftar pose dengan salinan alat yang baru ditambahkan.", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool." },
    { "Terapkan kembali prasetel atau bandingkan daftar pose dengan salinan alat yang baru ditambahkan.\nSimpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources.", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Terapkan prasetel ini", "Apply this preset" },
    { "Terbaru", "Up to date" },
    { "Terjadi kesalahan saat membuat prasetel.", "An error occurred while creating the preset." },
    { "Termina anteprima (ripristina posa originale)", "End preview (restore original pose)" },
    { "Terminé", "Done" },
    { "Terminé\nLes autres licences sont conservées.", "Licenses removed. Other product licenses and their folder are kept." },
    { "Terug", "Back" },
    { "Testa", "Head" },
    { "Testa: flessione basso-alto", "Head Nod Down-Up" },
    { "Testa: inclinazione sinistra-destra", "Head Tilt Left-Right" },
    { "Testa: rotazione sinistra-destra", "Head Turn Left-Right" },
    { "Tetap tampilkan kepala dalam mode foto", "Keep your head visible in Photo Mode" },
    { "Tetap tampilkan kepala di layar sendiri untuk foto dekat. Visibilitas normal kembali setelah mode foto.", "Keep your head visible locally for close-up photos. Normal visibility returns after Photo Mode." },
    { "Tetapkan AnimationClip samping. Jika kosong, animasi berguling yang sudah selesai pada kolom biasa digunakan seperti sebelumnya.", "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before." },
    { "Tetapkan Animator Controller biasa ke lapisan Base avatar. Animator Override Controller tidak didukung.", "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported." },
    { "Tetapkan animasi pada daftar pose atau nonaktifkan entri itu.", "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry." },
    { "Tetapkan animasi yang didukung Mecanim. Jika berasal dari model, periksa pengaturan Rig model tersebut.", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "Tetapkan gambar ikon atau nonaktifkan ikon khusus untuk menggunakan ikon yang dibuat otomatis.", "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons." },
    { "Tetapkan klip Humanoid untuk pose tengah dan samping. BlendTree, klip Legacy, dan klip tanpa kurva tubuh tidak didukung.", "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported." },
    { "Tetapkan nama parameter Motion Time atau nonaktifkan Motion Time.", "Set the Motion Time parameter name or disable Motion Time." },
    { "Tetapkan tujuan menu di dalam avatar ini ke Submenu Root.", "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root." },
    { "Tham chiếu chiều dài không được hỗ trợ: {0}", "Unsupported length reference: {0}" },
    { "Tham chiếu chiều dài vị trí", "Position length reference" },
    { "Tham chiếu đích", "Target reference" },
    { "Tham chiếu để đo vị trí tay hoặc chân, như Head, Hips, đầu gối hoặc ViewPosition (vị trí mắt). ViewPosition đi theo chuyển động đầu.", "The reference used to measure hand or foot placement, such as Head, Hips, a knee, or ViewPosition (eye position). ViewPosition follows head movement." },
    { "Tham số vị trí phát", "Playback position parameter" },
    { "Tham số điều khiển", "Control parameter" },
    { "Thao tác hàng loạt", "Batch actions" },
    { "Thao tác trước chưa hoàn tất.", "The previous operation did not finish." },
    { "Thao tác đã làm và điều xảy ra:", "What I did and what happened:" },
    { "Thay đổi bộ nhớ khi bật/tắt tùy chọn này.\nCông tắc lật người: 1 bit; nghiêng đầu: 8 bit; khóa đầu: 1 bit.\nTham số đã dùng bởi tùy chọn khác chỉ được tính một lần.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Thay đổi bộ nhớ khi bật/tắt tùy chọn này.\nKhóa đầu: 1 bit, dùng chung với lật người.\nKhông dùng thêm bit nếu lật người đã dùng tham số này.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Thiết lập IK từng tư thế ({0})", "Per-pose IK settings ({0})" },
    { "Thiết lập Unisaki Posing System", "Unisaki Posing System Settings" },
    { "Thiết lập avatar", "Avatar Setup" },
    { "Thiết lập của đối tượng {0} đã thay đổi. Cập nhật dữ liệu tạo trước.", "The settings on object {0} have changed. Update the prebuild." },
    { "Thiết lập hiển thị cảnh báo", "Warning display settings" },
    { "Thiết lập lật người", "Roll-over settings" },
    { "Thiết lập sẵn", "Presets" },
    { "Thiết lập sẵn chính thức Unisaki Studio", "Official Unisaki Studio presets" },
    { "Thiết lập sẵn của người dùng", "User presets" },
    { "Thiết lập sẵn đã bị xóa hoặc không tương thích với công cụ. Chọn Tải lại trong Inspector.", "The preset was removed or is incompatible with this tool. Select Reload in the Inspector." },
    { "Thiết lập sẵn đã bị xóa hoặc không áp dụng được cho công cụ này. Chọn Tải lại để cập nhật danh sách.", "This preset was deleted or cannot be applied to this tool. Choose Reload to refresh the list." },
    { "Thiết lập thay đổi từ lúc lưu (tối đa 12)", "Settings changed since saving (up to 12)" },
    { "Thiết lập thay đổi từ lần tạo trước. Chọn Cập nhật dữ liệu tạo trước để áp dụng thiết lập hiện tại.", "Settings have changed since the last prebuild. Select Update prebuild to apply the current settings." },
    { "Thiết lập thở", "Breathing settings" },
    { "Thiết lập tạo thiết lập sẵn", "Preset creation settings" },
    { "Thiết lập tạo trước thay đổi từ lúc lưu", "Prebuild settings changed since saving" },
    { "Thiết lập đã đổi", "Settings changed" },
    { "Thiếu AnimationClip tư thế nguồn.", "The source pose AnimationClip is missing." },
    { "Thiếu Animator tạo dáng dùng chung.", "The shared posing Animator is missing." },
    { "Thiếu Humanoid Animator hoặc quy tắc IK.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
