    { "Ukryj dołączone presety", "Hide bundled presets" },
    { "Ukryj ostrzeżenia o braku budowania wstępnego", "Hide missing prebuild warnings" },
    { "Ukryj ostrzeżenia o zmianie ustawień", "Hide changed-settings warnings" },
    { "Ukryj oznaczenia ostrzeżeń w Hierarchy", "Hide Hierarchy warning badges" },
    { "Ukryj poprzedni błąd", "Dismiss previous failure" },
    { "Ukryj uwagi Auto-Footsteps", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "Ukryj uwagi dotyczące poz i awatara", "Hide pose and avatar notices" },
    { "Ukryj wszystkie ostrzeżenia i uwagi", "Hide all warnings and notices" },
    { "Ukrywa oficjalne dołączone presety na liście i w wynikach wyszukiwania. Ustawienie jest wspólne dla awatarów w tym projekcie.", "Hide official bundled presets from the list and search results. This setting is shared by avatars in this project." },
    { "Ukuran kepala (selisih kedalaman Head/Viewpoint)", "Head size (Head/Viewpoint depth difference)" },
    { "Ukuran kepala (selisih tinggi Head/Viewpoint)", "Head size (Head/Viewpoint height difference)" },
    { "Ulagrede manuelle justeringer", "Unsaved manual adjustments" },
    { "Uložení / správa předvoleb", "Save / manage presets" },
    { "Uložit", "Save" },
    { "Uložit a pokračovat", "Save and continue" },
    { "Uložit změněné", "Save changed" },
    { "Uložte a zazálohujte scénu a poté znovu stáhněte produkt a Unisaki Posing System pomocí ALCOM / VCC. Pokud problém trvá, otevřete nápovědu a změny nahoře v Inspector pro příručku a podporu. Zachovejte upravené objekty a GeneratedResources.", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "Uloží hodnoty korekce do souboru.", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "Uloží korekce změněných animací.", "Saves adjustments for animations that have changes." },
    { "Uloží ruční korekce a poté aktuální výsledek IK do samostatné animace korekce. Existující soubory zůstanou zachovány.", "Save manual adjustments, then save the current IK result to a separate adjustment animation. Existing files are kept." },
    { "Uloží výsledek IK do nové animace korekce a vypne IK této pózy. Poté ji lze ručně upravit níže.", "Save the IK result to a new adjustment animation and disable IK for this pose. You can then adjust it manually below." },
    { "Um Humanoid Animator ou uma regra IK está ausente.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
    { "Um ícone personalizado está ativado para o item {1} ({2}) em {0}, mas nenhuma imagem foi atribuída.", "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned." },
    { "Uma condição do Animator referencia um parâmetro não declarado. No arquivo {0}, camada {1}, o parâmetro {2} é usado numa condição, mas não aparece na lista Parameters do Animator Controller. Consulte a compatibilidade com o desenvolvedor da ferramenta que usa esse parâmetro.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Uma condição do Animator referencia um parâmetro não declarado. No ficheiro {0}, camada {1}, o parâmetro {2} é usado numa condição, mas não aparece na lista Parameters do Animator Controller. Consulte a compatibilidade com o desenvolvedor da ferramenta que usa esse parâmetro.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Uma condição do Animator usa um tipo de parâmetro incompatível. No arquivo {0}, camada {1}, o parâmetro {2} está declarado como {3}, mas a condição {4} é usada. Isso pode impedir o funcionamento correto de algumas funções. Consulte a compatibilidade com o desenvolvedor da ferramenta que usa esse parâmetro.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Uma condição do Animator usa um tipo de parâmetro incompatível. No ficheiro {0}, camada {1}, o parâmetro {2} está declarado como {3}, mas a condição {4} é usada. Isso pode impedir o funcionamento correto de algumas funções. Consulte a compatibilidade com o desenvolvedor da ferramenta que usa esse parâmetro.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Uma predefinição para {0} foi encontrada. Aplicar para ajustar as poses a este avatar?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "Umbral de altura agachado", "Crouching Height Threshold" },
    { "Umbral de altura sentado", "Sitting Height Threshold" },
    { "Umbral de altura tumbado", "Lying Height Threshold" },
    { "Umbrales de altura", "Height Thresholds" },
    { "Umdrehen", "Roll Over" },
    { "Umdrehen aktivieren", "Enable roll over" },
    { "Umdrehen für Eintrag {1} ({2}) in {0} benötigt einen Humanoid AnimationClip.", "Roll over for item {1} ({2}) in {0} requires a Humanoid AnimationClip." },
    { "Umdrehen-Einstellungen", "Roll-over settings" },
    { "Umieść ten obiekt wewnątrz awatara z komponentem VRCAvatarDescriptor.", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "Umožní přetočit se náklonem hlavy. Podporují jen některé ležící pózy.", "Roll over by tilting your head. Supported by certain lying poses." },
    { "Umístění úložiště", "Storage" },
    { "Umístění úložiště\nAktuální uživatel", "License information is saved locally for your user account." },
    { "Umístěte objekt dovnitř avatara s komponentou VRCAvatarDescriptor.", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "Un Humanoid Animator est nécessaire.", "A Humanoid Animator is required." },
    { "Un Humanoid Animator ou une règle IK est manquant.", "A Humanoid Animator or IK rule is missing." },
    { "Un préréglage pour {0} a été trouvé. L'appliquer pour adapter les poses à cet avatar ?", "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?" },
    { "Una condición del Animator referencia un parámetro no declarado. En el archivo {0}, capa {1}, el parámetro {2} se usa en una condición, pero no aparece en Parameters del Animator Controller. Consulta la compatibilidad con el desarrollador de la herramienta que usa este parámetro.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Una condición del Animator usa un tipo de parámetro incompatible. En el archivo {0}, capa {1}, el parámetro {2} está declarado como {3}, pero se usa la condición {4}. Algunas funciones podrían fallar. Consulta la compatibilidad con el desarrollador de la herramienta que usa este parámetro.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Una condizione dell'Animator fa riferimento a un parametro non dichiarato. Nel file {0}, layer {1}, il parametro {2} è usato in una condizione ma manca dall'elenco Parameters dell'Animator Controller. Contatta l'autore dello strumento che usa questo parametro per verificarne la compatibilità.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Una condizione dell'Animator usa un tipo di parametro incompatibile. Nel file {0}, layer {1}, il parametro {2} è dichiarato come {3}, ma viene usata la condizione {4}. Alcune funzioni potrebbero non funzionare correttamente. Contatta l'autore dello strumento che usa questo parametro per verificarne la compatibilità.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Una sola volta per computer", "Once per computer" },
    { "Unavngivet", "Unnamed" },
    { "Unbekannt", "Unknown" },
    { "Unbekannte Version", "Unknown version" },
    { "Unbenannt", "Unnamed" },
    { "Under arbete. Äldre justeringsanimationer används fortfarande även om en produktprefab refererar till katalogen.", "Work in progress. Legacy adjustment animations remain in use even when a product prefab references this catalog." },
    { "Under bygning kombineres den normale positur i midten med sideposituren og dens spejling. Første billede i hvert klip bruges. Midten er 0.5, og endepunkterne er 0 og 1. Gulvkorrektion er slået fra ved 0 og er 25 % ved 0.25.", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "Under udvikling. Ældre justeringsanimationer bruges stadig, selv når en produktprefab henviser til kataloget.", "Work in progress. Legacy adjustment animations remain in use even when a product prefab references this catalog." },
    { "Underarmslengde", "Forearm length" },
    { "Underarmslängd", "Forearm length" },
    { "Underarmslængde", "Forearm length" },
    { "Underbenslängd", "Lower leg length" },
    { "Underbenslængde", "Lower leg length" },
    { "Une condition de l'Animator référence un paramètre non déclaré. Dans le fichier {0}, couche {1}, le paramètre {2} est utilisé dans une condition, mais absent de la liste Parameters de l'Animator Controller. Contactez le développeur de l'outil utilisant ce paramètre au sujet de sa compatibilité.", "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Une condition de l'Animator utilise un type de paramètre incompatible. Dans le fichier {0}, couche {1}, le paramètre {2} est déclaré comme {3}, mais la condition {4} est utilisée. Certaines fonctions peuvent ne pas fonctionner correctement. Contactez le développeur de l'outil utilisant ce paramètre au sujet de sa compatibilité.", "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility." },
    { "Une erreur est survenue lors de la création du préréglage.", "An error occurred while creating the preset." },
    { "Une icône personnalisée est activée pour l'élément {1} ({2}) de {0}, mais aucune image n'est attribuée.", "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned." },
