    { "Unisce l'animazione sorgente e la regolazione in un nuovo clip di animazione.", "Merges the source animation and adjustment into a new animation clip." },
    { "Unisci", "Merge" },
    { "Unity 2019.x için VRCSDK gerektiren araçlar kuruyorsunuz, ancak başka bir VRCSDK sürümü kullanıyorsunuz! Eski VRCSDK kullanın veya araç güncellemesini bekleyin!", "You're installing tools that require VRCSDK for Unity 2019.x but you're using other versions of VRCSDK! Please use older VRCSDK or wait for tool updates!" },
    { "Unity 2019.x用VRCSDKを必要とするツールと、現在のVRCSDKに互換性がありません。対応するVRCSDKを使用するか、ツールの更新を確認してください。", "You're installing tools that require VRCSDK for Unity 2019.x but you're using other versions of VRCSDK! Please use older VRCSDK or wait for tool updates!" },
    { "Unity 2019.x용 VRCSDK가 필요한 도구를 설치하고 있지만 다른 VRCSDK 버전을 사용 중입니다! 이전 VRCSDK를 사용하거나 도구 업데이트를 기다려 주세요!", "You're installing tools that require VRCSDK for Unity 2019.x but you're using other versions of VRCSDK! Please use older VRCSDK or wait for tool updates!" },
    { "Unity betik derlemesi başarısız olduğundan poz oluşturma başlatılamadı.", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity स्क्रिप्ट संकलन विफल होने के कारण पोज़ बनाना शुरू नहीं हो सका।", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity স্ক্রিপ্ট কম্পাইল ব্যর্থ হওয়ায় পোজ তৈরি শুরু করা যায়নি।", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity நிரல் தொகுத்தல் தோல்வியுற்றதால் போஸ் உருவாக்கத்தைத் தொடங்க முடியவில்லை.", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity స్క్రిప్ట్ కంపైల్ విఫలమైనందున భంగిమ సృష్టి ప్రారంభం కాలేదు.", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity 스크립트 컴파일에 실패하여 포즈 생성을 시작할 수 없습니다.", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
    { "Unity-version som krävs: {0}.{1}+", "Required Unity version: {0}.{1}+" },
    { "Unitypackage giấy phép BOOTH không có công cụ. Dùng ALCOM / VCC để thêm gói sản phẩm và Unisaki Posing System vào dự án.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "Unitypackage licencji z BOOTH nie zawiera samego narzędzia. Użyj ALCOM / VCC, aby dodać pakiet produktu i Unisaki Posing System do projektu.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "Unitypackage lisensi BOOTH tidak menyertakan alatnya. Gunakan ALCOM / VCC untuk menambahkan paket produk dan Unisaki Posing System ke proyek ini.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "Unitypackage лицензии с BOOTH не содержит сам инструмент. Добавьте пакет продукта и Unisaki Posing System в проект через ALCOM / VCC.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "Unitypackage ліцензії з BOOTH не містить сам інструмент. Додайте пакет продукту та Unisaki Posing System до проєкту через ALCOM / VCC.", "The BOOTH license unitypackage does not include the tool itself. Use ALCOM / VCC to add the product package and Unisaki Posing System to this project." },
    { "Unityでスクリプトのコンパイルに失敗したため、ポーズの生成を開始できません。", "Pose generation could not start because Unity script compilation failed." },
