    { "Utiliser vos propres mouvements", "Use your own motions" },
    { "Utilisez un BlendTree de locomotion pour Debout / marche / course, Accroupi et Sur le ventre. Utilisez Debout uniquement pour une pose debout unique.", "Use a BlendTree with locomotion for Standing / walking / running, Crouching, and Prone. Use Standing only for a single standing pose." },
    { "Utilisez une valeur entre 0 et 1.", "Use a value between 0 and 1." },
    { "Utilisé pour le suivi interne de compatibilité. Laissez généralement cette valeur inchangée.", "Used for internal compatibility tracking. Usually leave this unchanged." },
    { "Utilisé uniquement avec une direction de flexion définie manuellement, par rapport à l'avant de l'avatar.", "Used only with a manually specified bend direction, relative to the avatar’s front." },
    { "Utilizador atual", "Current user" },
    { "Utklippstavlen er tom.", "The clipboard is empty." },
    { "Utvidet", "Extended" },
    { "Utviklerdata som registrerer mål for hender og føtter for hver inkluderte positur.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "Utviklerdata som registrerer mål for hender og føtter for hver inkluderte positur. Opprett én fil per produkt; denne er atskilt fra innstillinger for hver avatar.", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "Utworzono automatyczną animację korekcji z reguł IK: {0}.", "Created an automatic adjustment animation from {0} IK rules." },
    { "Utwórz jeden plik na produkt; jest oddzielny od ustawień konkretnego awatara.", "Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "Utwórz kopię do porównania obliczeń", "Create evaluation comparison copy" },
    { "Utwórz kopię do porównania optymalizacji", "Create optimization comparison copy" },
    { "Utwórz ponownie wszystkie miniatury póz. Może to potrwać zależnie od liczby póz.\nPrzed dalszą pracą w Unity poczekaj na zakończenie aktualizacji.", "Recreate all pose thumbnails. This may take some time depending on the number of poses.\nWait until the update finishes before using Unity." },
    { "Utwórz preset", "Create preset" },
    { "Utwórz preset z bieżących ustawień", "Create preset from current settings" },
    { "Utwórz preset, aby użyć korekcji poz na innej kopii tego samego awatara. Zarejestruj prefab lub FBX, aby preset był proponowany przy dodawaniu {0} do tego awatara. Utworzone presety można publikować, rozpowszechniać i sprzedawać zgodnie z licencją produktu.", "Create a preset to reuse your pose adjustments on another copy of the same avatar. Register a prefab or FBX so the preset can be offered when {0} is added to that avatar. You may publish, distribute, or sell the presets you create under the product license." },
    { "Utökat", "Extended" },
    { "Uusi asento", "New pose" },
    { "Uusia lisättäviä animaatioleikkeitä ei ole.", "No new animation clips can be added." },
    { "Uyarı gösterim ayarları", "Warning display settings" },
    { "Uygula", "Apply" },
    { "Uygulanacak PosingSystem prefabları", "PosingSystem prefabs to apply" },
    { "Uyumlu avatar", "Compatible with avatar" },
    { "Uyumsuz VRCSDK sürümü", "Incompatible VRCSDK version" },
    { "Uzun düşüş", "Long fall" },
    { "Uzun iniş", "Long landing" },
    { "Uzunluk referansı için gereken Humanoid kemikleri eksik: {0}, {1}.", "The Humanoid bones required for the length reference are missing: {0}, {1}." },
    { "Uzuv IK kuralları ({0})", "Limb IK rules ({0})" },
    { "Uzuv IK kuralı ekle", "Add limb IK rule" },
    { "Uzuv dönüşünü eşleştir", "Match limb rotation" },
    { "Uzuvları avatarın oranlarına uygun doğal konumlara getirir.", "Adjust limbs to reach natural positions for this avatar's proportions." },
    { "Użyj", "Use" },
    { "Użyj BlendTree z ruchem dla stania / chodzenia / biegania, kucania i leżenia na brzuchu. Dla pojedynczej pozy stojącej wybierz „Tylko stanie”.", "Use a BlendTree with locomotion for Standing / walking / running, Crouching, and Prone. Use Standing only for a single standing pose." },
    { "Użyj Motion Time", "Use Motion Time" },
    { "Użyj po zmianie stroju lub wyglądu. Po zmianie ustawień zaktualizuj budowanie wstępne.", "Use this after changing the outfit or appearance. Update the prebuild after changing settings." },
    { "Użyj wartości od 0 do 1.", "Use a value between 0 and 1." },
    { "Użyj własnej ikony", "Use custom icon" },
    { "Używaj oryginalnych poz stojących, kucających i na brzuchu", "Use original standing, crouching and prone poses" },
    { "Używaj tego typu ruchu", "Use this motion type" },
    { "Używaj tej pozy", "Use this pose" },
    { "Używane tylko z ręcznie określonym kierunkiem zgięcia, względem przodu awatara.", "Used only with a manually specified bend direction, relative to the avatar’s front." },
    { "Uživatelské předvolby", "User presets" },
    { "V nastavení jsou chyby. Otevřete kontrolu nastavení v Inspector.", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "V projektu zůstává složka starého unitypackage „{0}“, která může kolidovat s aktuální verzí. Před odstraněním zkontrolujte pokyny k přechodu a zálohu.", "The legacy unitypackage folder “{0}” is still in this project and may conflict with the current version. Check the migration instructions and your backup before removing it." },
    { "V této kategorii nejsou animace.", "No animations in this category." },
    { "V {0} je vybráno více výchozích póz.", "More than one default pose is selected in {0}." },
    { "V {0} nejsou zapnuté žádné pózy. Nabídka výběru této kategorie se nevytvoří.", "No poses are enabled in {0}. Its pose-selection menu will not be generated." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor ile aynı nesnedeki Animator'ı kontrol edin ve ayarlarını avatarın özgün prefabıyla karşılaştırın.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor वाले ऑब्जेक्ट का Animator जाँचें और मूल अवतार Prefab की सेटिंग से तुलना करें।", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor உள்ள அதே பொருளின் Animator-ஐச் சரிபார்த்து, அசல் அவதார் Prefab அமைப்புகளுடன் ஒப்பிடவும்.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor ఉన్న అదే ఆబ్జెక్టులో Animatorను తనిఖీ చేసి, అసలు అవతార్ Prefab సెట్టింగ్‌లతో పోల్చండి.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor-সহ একই অবজেক্টের Animator পরীক্ষা করে মূল অ্যাভাটার Prefab-এর সেটিংসের সঙ্গে তুলনা করুন।", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptorと同じオブジェクトのAnimatorを確認し、配布元のアバターPrefabの設定と比較してください。", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Avatar Descriptor와 같은 오브젝트에 있는 Animator를 확인하고, 원래 아바타 Prefab의 설정과 비교해 주세요.", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "VRC Head Chop -komponenttien määrä on saavuttanut VRChatin rajan.", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop bileşenlerinin sayısı VRChat sınırına ulaştı.", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop er allerede indstillet for hovedknoglen.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop er allerede konfigurert for hodebeinet.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop est déjà configuré pour l’os de la tête.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop is al ingesteld voor het hoofdbeen.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop är redan inställt för huvudbenet.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop è già configurato per l’osso della testa.", "The head bone already has VRC Head Chop configured." },
    { "VRC Head Chop कंपोनेंट की संख्या VRChat की सीमा तक पहुँच गई है।", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop কম্পোনেন্টের সংখ্যা VRChat-এর সীমায় পৌঁছেছে।", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop கூறுகளின் எண்ணிக்கை VRChat வரம்பை எட்டியுள்ளது.", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop భాగాల సంఖ్య VRChat పరిమితికి చేరింది.", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop 컴포넌트 수가 VRChat 한도에 도달했습니다.", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chopの数がVRChatの上限に達しています。", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop元件數量已達VRChat上限。", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRC Head Chop组件数量已达到VRChat上限。", "The number of VRC Head Chop components has reached the VRChat limit." },
    { "VRCAvatarDescriptor 컴포넌트가 있는 아바타 오브젝트 안에 이 오브젝트를 배치해 주세요.", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "VRCSDKのバージョンに互換性がありません", "Incompatible VRCSDK version" },
    { "VRCSDK版本不兼容", "Incompatible VRCSDK version" },
    { "VRCSDK版本不相容", "Incompatible VRCSDK version" },
    { "VRChat bekleme sallanmasını kapat", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat का डिफ़ॉल्ट निष्क्रिय एनिमेशन पहचान नहीं सके। VRChat SDK जाँचें।", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat का निष्क्रिय डोलना बंद करें", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat में इस्तेमाल के लिए सुविधाएँ टैब में “करवट” भी चालू करें।", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChat मेनू में साँस चालू या बंद करें। दूसरों को भी बदलाव दिखता है।", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat মেনুতে শ্বাস চালু বা বন্ধ করুন। অন্যরাও পরিবর্তন দেখতে পান।", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat இயல்புநிலை அசைவை நிறுத்து", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat இயல்புநிலை ஓய்வு அனிமேஷனை அடையாளம் காண முடியவில்லை. VRChat SDK-ஐச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat பட்டியில் மூச்சை இயக்கவோ நிறுத்தவோ செய்யலாம். மாற்றம் மற்றவர்களுக்கும் தெரியும்.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat మెనూలో శ్వాసను ఆన్ లేదా ఆఫ్ చేయవచ్చు. మార్పు ఇతరులకూ కనిపిస్తుంది.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat సాధారణ నిరీక్షణ యానిమేషన్‌ను గుర్తించలేకపోయాం. VRChat SDKను తనిఖీ చేయండి.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat సాధారణ నిలుచున్న ఊగుడును ఆపు", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat 기본 대기 애니메이션을 확인할 수 없습니다. VRChat SDK를 확인하세요.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat 기본 대기 흔들림 끄기", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat 메뉴에서 호흡을 켜거나 끌 수 있습니다. 다른 사람에게도 변경 사항이 보입니다.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat'in varsayılan bekleme animasyonu belirlenemedi. VRChat SDK'yı kontrol edin.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat'te kullanmak için Özellikler sekmesinde dönüşü de etkinleştirin.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChat'te nefesi açıp kapatır. Diğerleri de değişikliği görür.", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChat-Schwanken im Stand deaktivieren", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat-এ ব্যবহার করতে বৈশিষ্ট্য ট্যাবে “পাশ ফেরা” চালু করুন।", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChat-এর ডিফল্ট স্থির অবস্থার অ্যানিমেশন শনাক্ত করা যায়নি। VRChat SDK পরীক্ষা করুন।", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat-এর স্থির অবস্থার দোল বন্ধ করুন", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat-இல் பயன்படுத்த வசதிகள் தாவலில் புரளலையும் இயக்கவும்.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChatin oletusarvoista joutokäyntianimaatiota ei voitu tunnistaa. Tarkista VRChat SDK.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChats standardanimation i hvile kunne ikke identificeres. Kontrollér VRChat SDK.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChats standardanimation i vila kunde inte identifieras. Kontrollera VRChat SDK.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChats standardmäßige Leerlaufanimation konnte nicht ermittelt werden. Prüfe das VRChat SDK.", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChatలో వాడేందుకు ఫీచర్లు ట్యాబ్‌లో పక్కకు తిరగడాన్ని కూడా సక్రియం చేయండి.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChatのメニューで呼吸をつけたり止めたりできます。ON/OFFは他の人にも反映されます。", "Toggle breathing in VRChat. Other users can see the change." },
    { "VRChatのメニューに切り替え項目を追加します。使いたいときに、ポーズの左右を反転できます。", "Add a menu toggle to mirror your pose." },
    { "VRChat標準の待機アニメーションを特定できません。VRChat SDKを確認してください。", "Could not identify VRChat's default idle animation. Check the VRChat SDK." },
    { "VRChat標準の揺れを止める", "Disable VRChat idle sway" },
    { "VRChat에서 사용하려면 기능 탭의 뒤척이기도 활성화해 주세요.", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "VRChat의 기본 대기 상태 흔들림을 멈춥니다. 이 도구에서 설정한 호흡 애니메이션은 유지합니다.", "Disable VRChat's default idle sway while keeping this tool's breathing animation." },
