    { "Valmis\nMuut lisenssit säilytetään.", "Licenses removed. Other product licenses and their folder are kept." },
    { "Valt automatiskt eftersom Fotoläge behöver det.", "Selected automatically because Photo Mode requires it." },
    { "Vanhan unitypackagen kansio «{0}» on yhä projektissa ja voi olla ristiriidassa nykyversion kanssa. Tarkista siirtymisohjeet ja varmuuskopio ennen sen poistamista.", "The legacy unitypackage folder “{0}” is still in this project and may conflict with the current version. Check the migration instructions and your backup before removing it." },
    { "Vanhat tallennetut tiedot (asetuksia ei voi verrata)", "Legacy saved data (settings cannot be compared)" },
    { "Vanligvis 1. Lavere verdier beholder mer av kildeposituren.", "Usually 1. Lower values retain more of the source pose." },
    { "Vanligvis menuName_poseName. Verdien fylles ut automatisk når en oppføring legges til fra justeringsvinduet.", "Normally menuName_poseName. Adding an entry from the adjustment window fills it automatically." },
    { "Variation de mémoire lorsque cette option est activée ou désactivée.\nCommande de retournement : 1 bit ; inclinaison de la tête : 8 bits ; verrouillage de la tête : 1 bit.\nLes paramètres déjà utilisés par d'autres options ne sont comptés qu'une fois.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Variation de mémoire lorsque cette option est activée ou désactivée.\nVerrouillage de la tête : 1 bit, partagé avec le retournement.\nN'utilise aucun bit supplémentaire si le retournement utilise déjà ce paramètre.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Variazione di memoria attivando o disattivando questa opzione.\nBlocco testa: 1 bit, condiviso con Girarsi.\nNon usa bit aggiuntivi se Girarsi usa già questo parametro.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Variazione di memoria attivando o disattivando questa opzione.\nInterruttore per girarsi: 1 bit; inclinazione testa: 8 bit; blocco testa: 1 bit.\nI parametri già usati da altre opzioni vengono contati una volta sola.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Variação de memória ao ativar ou desativar esta opção.\nBloqueio da cabeça: 1 bit, compartilhado com Virar.\nUsa 0 bits adicionais se Virar já utiliza esse parâmetro.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Variação de memória ao ativar ou desativar esta opção.\nBloqueio da cabeça: 1 bit, partilhado com Virar.\nUsa 0 bits adicionais se Virar já utiliza esse parâmetro.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "Variação de memória ao ativar ou desativar esta opção.\nInterruptor para virar: 1 bit; inclinação da cabeça: 8 bits; bloqueio da cabeça: 1 bit.\nOs parâmetros já usados por outras opções são contados uma única vez.", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
    { "Varmista, että vain yksi yhteinen asento-Animator on aktiivinen, ettei siinä ole EditorOnly-tunnistetta tai Missing Script -komponenttia ja että oletusprefab on asennettu.", "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed." },
