    { "ViewPosition için Head referans pozu alınamadı.", "Could not obtain the Head reference pose used for ViewPosition." },
    { "ViewPosition kon niet worden berekend. Controleer de schaal van de botten tot Head en de Humanoid-instellingen.", "Could not calculate ViewPosition. Check the scales of bones leading to Head and the Humanoid settings." },
    { "ViewPosition konnte nicht berechnet werden. Prüfe die Skalierungen der Bones bis Head sowie die Humanoid-Einstellungen.", "Could not calculate ViewPosition. Check the scales of bones leading to Head and the Humanoid settings." },
