    { "Ẩn ghi chú tư thế và avatar", "Hide pose and avatar notices" },
    { "Ẩn mọi cảnh báo và ghi chú", "Hide all warnings and notices" },
    { "Ẩn thiết lập sẵn chính thức đi kèm khỏi danh sách và kết quả tìm kiếm. Thiết lập dùng chung cho các avatar trong dự án.", "Hide official bundled presets from the list and search results. This setting is shared by avatars in this project." },
    { "Ẩn thiết lập sẵn đi kèm", "Hide bundled presets" },
    { "‘{0}’ 오브젝트에 MAParameters 컴포넌트가 없습니다.", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "‘{0}’의 공통 포징 Animator에 설정된 AnimatorController가 올바르지 않습니다. AnimatorOverrideController 등의 컨트롤러 유형은 사용할 수 없습니다.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "‘{0}’의 포즈 메뉴 오브젝트를 찾을 수 없습니다.", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“Fotoğraf modunda başı görünür tut” seçeneğini kapatın veya bir bileşenlik yer açmak için mevcut VRC Head Chop bileşenlerini birleştirin.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "“{0} / {1}” pozu dönüştürülemedi.", "Failed to convert pose “{0} / {1}”." },
    { "“{0} / {1}” পোজ রূপান্তর ব্যর্থ হয়েছে।", "Failed to convert pose “{0} / {1}”." },
    { "“{0} / {1}” போஸை மாற்ற முடியவில்லை.", "Failed to convert pose “{0} / {1}”." },
    { "“{0} / {1}” భంగిమను మార్చలేకపోయాము.", "Failed to convert pose “{0} / {1}”." },
    { "“{0}” durumu için {1} oluşturulamıyor.", "Could not create {1} for state “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” için poz menüsü nesnesi bulunamadı.", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“{0}” nesnesinde MAParameters bileşeni yok.", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "“{0}” pozuna SDK'nın {1} bileşeni eklenemiyor.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” üzerindeki ortak poz Animator'ına atanmış AnimatorController geçersiz. AnimatorOverrideController ve benzer denetleyici türleri desteklenmez.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“{0}” का पोज़ मेनू ऑब्जेक्ट नहीं मिला।", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“{0}” के साझा पोज़िंग Animator में निर्धारित AnimatorController अमान्य है। AnimatorOverrideController और इसी प्रकार के कंट्रोलर समर्थित नहीं हैं।", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“{0}” অবজেক্টে MAParameters কম্পোনেন্ট নেই।", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "“{0}” অবস্থার জন্য {1} তৈরি করা যাচ্ছে না।", "Could not create {1} for state “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” পোজে SDK-এর {1} যোগ করা যাচ্ছে না।", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” நிலைக்கு {1}-ஐ உருவாக்க முடியாது.", "Could not create {1} for state “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” பொருளில் MAParameters கூறு இல்லை.", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "“{0}” போஸில் SDK-இன் {1}-ஐச் சேர்க்க முடியாது.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” ఆబ్జెక్టులో MAParameters భాగం లేదు.", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "“{0}” భంగిమకు SDKలోని {1}ను జోడించలేము.", "Could not add SDK {1} to pose “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}” స్థితికి {1}ను సృష్టించలేము.", "Could not create {1} for state “{0}”." },
    { "“{0}”-এর পোজ মেনু অবজেক্ট পাওয়া যায়নি।", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“{0}”-এর যৌথ পোজিং Animator-এ নির্ধারিত AnimatorController অবৈধ। AnimatorOverrideController ও একই ধরনের কন্ট্রোলার সমর্থিত নয়।", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“{0}”-இன் பகிரப்பட்ட போஸ் Animator-இல் அமைக்கப்பட்ட AnimatorController செல்லுபடியாகாது. AnimatorOverrideController மற்றும் அதுபோன்ற கட்டுப்படுத்தி வகைகள் ஆதரிக்கப்படாது.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“{0}”-இன் போஸ் பட்டியல் பொருள் கிடைக்கவில்லை.", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“{0}”కు సంబంధించిన భంగిమల మెనూ ఆబ్జెక్టు కనబడలేదు.", "The pose menu object for “{0}” could not be found." },
    { "“{0}”లోని ఉమ్మడి భంగిమ Animatorకు కేటాయించిన AnimatorController చెల్లదు. AnimatorOverrideController వంటి కంట్రోలర్ రకాలకు మద్దతు లేదు.", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“{0}”对象没有MAParameters组件。", "Object “{0}” has no MAParameters component." },
    { "“{0}”的共用姿势Animator所设置的AnimatorController无效。不支持AnimatorOverrideController等控制器类型。", "The AnimatorController assigned to the shared posing Animator on “{0}” is invalid. AnimatorOverrideController and similar controller types are not supported." },
    { "“फ़ोटो मोड में सिर दिखाएँ” बंद करें या मौजूदा VRC Head Chop कंपोनेंट को मिलाकर एक कंपोनेंट के लिए जगह खाली करें।", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "“ফটো মোডে মাথা দৃশ্যমান রাখুন” বন্ধ করুন বা বিদ্যমান VRC Head Chop কম্পোনেন্ট একত্র করে একটি কম্পোনেন্টের জায়গা খালি করুন।", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "“தற்போதைய உறுப்பு இடங்களைப் பதி” என்பதை ஒருமுறை இயக்கவும். மீண்டும் பதிவுசெய்யும்வரை மூல அசைவூட்டத்தின் உறுப்புத் திசை தக்கவைக்கப்படும்.", "run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
    { "“புகைப்பட முறையில் தலையைக் காட்டு” என்பதை அணைக்கவும் அல்லது ஏற்கெனவே உள்ள VRC Head Chop கூறுகளை ஒன்றிணைத்து ஒரு கூறுக்கான இடத்தை விடுவிக்கவும்.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "“ప్రస్తుత అవయవ స్థానాలను నమోదు చేయి” ఒకసారి నడపండి. మళ్లీ నమోదు చేసే వరకు మూల యానిమేషన్ అవయవ దిశ ఉంచబడుతుంది.", "run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
    { "“ఫోటో మోడ్‌లో తలను కనిపించేలా ఉంచు”ను ఆఫ్ చేయండి లేదా ఇప్పటికే ఉన్న VRC Head Chop భాగాలను కలిపి ఒక భాగానికి చోటు ఖాళీ చేయండి.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "“촬영 모드에서 머리 표시 유지”를 끄거나 기존 VRC Head Chop 컴포넌트를 합쳐 컴포넌트 하나의 여유 공간을 확보하세요.", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "※ 寝返りと姿勢崩れ抑制のbit表示は、今の状態でチェックを変更したときの増減量です。首固定の1 bitは共用します。", "Roll Over and distortion-reduction bit counts show the change from the current settings. They share the 1-bit head lock." },
