    { "公式ヘルプを開く", "Open official support" },
    { "公開用として有効", "Enable for production" },
    { "公開用として有効です。カタログを参照する商品では、従来の姿勢別調整Animationとアバター固有補正が使用されません。設定漏れの姿勢がないことを確認してください。", "Enabled for production. Products using this catalog bypass legacy per-pose adjustment animations and avatar corrections. Check that all poses are configured." },
    { "共用Controller与此版本的生成定义不一致。", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "共用Controller与此版本的生成定义不一致。请将自定义更改保存在另一Controller中，然后通过ALCOM或VCC重新安装相同版本的Unisaki Posing System。", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "共用Controller中沒有USSPS_LocomotionType圖層。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_LocomotionType layer." },
    { "共用Controller中沒有USSPS_Locomotion圖層。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
    { "共用Controller中没有USSPS_LocomotionType层。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_LocomotionType layer." },
    { "共用Controller中没有USSPS_Locomotion层。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
    { "共用Controller有未保存的更改。请保存后重试。", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "共用Controller有未儲存的變更。請儲存後重試。", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "共用Controller缺少姿势控制层。", "The shared controller has no pose-control layers." },
    { "共用Controller缺少姿勢控制層。", "The shared controller has no pose-control layers." },
    { "共用Controller與此版本的產生定義不一致。", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "共用Controller與此版本的產生定義不一致。請將自訂變更儲存在另一Controller中，然後透過ALCOM或VCC重新安裝相同版本的Unisaki Posing System。", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "共用动画（旧版）", "Shared animation (legacy)" },
    { "共用動畫（舊版）", "Shared animation (legacy)" },
    { "共用姿势Animator上没有MA Merge Animator。", "The shared posing Animator has no MA Merge Animator." },
    { "共用姿势Animator未分配Animator Controller。", "The shared posing Animator has no assigned Animator Controller." },
    { "共用姿势Animator需要常规Animator Controller。", "The shared posing Animator requires a regular Animator Controller." },
    { "共用姿勢Animator上沒有MA Merge Animator。", "The shared posing Animator has no MA Merge Animator." },
    { "共用姿勢Animator尚未配置Animator Controller。", "The shared posing Animator has no assigned Animator Controller." },
    { "共用姿勢Animator需要一般的Animator Controller。", "The shared posing Animator requires a regular Animator Controller." },
    { "共通ControllerにUSSPS_LocomotionTypeレイヤーがありません。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_LocomotionType layer." },
    { "共通ControllerにUSSPS_Locomotionレイヤーがありません。", "The shared Controller has no USSPS_Locomotion layer." },
    { "共通Controllerに姿勢制御用のレイヤーがありません。", "The shared controller has no pose-control layers." },
    { "共通Controllerに未保存の変更があります。変更を保存してからやり直してください。", "The shared controller has unsaved changes. Save them before trying again." },
    { "共通Controllerの内容が、このバージョンの生成定義と一致しません。", "The common Controller does not match the generation definition for this version." },
    { "共通Controllerの内容が、このバージョンの生成定義と一致しません。独自の変更は別のControllerに保存し、ALCOM / VCCで同じバージョンの「ゆにさきポーズシステム」を入れ直してください。", "The shared controller does not match this version's generation definition. Save custom changes in a separate controller, then reinstall the same version of Unisaki Posing System using ALCOM or VCC." },
    { "共通アニメーション（従来設定）", "Shared animation (legacy)" },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorがありません。", "The shared posing Animator is missing." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorにMA Merge Animatorがありません。", "The shared posing Animator has no MA Merge Animator." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorに通常のAnimator Controller以外が設定されています。", "The shared posing Animator requires a regular Animator Controller." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorのAnimator参照が未設定です。", "The shared posing Animator has no assigned Animator Controller." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorの参照からAnimator Controllerを読み込めません。", "Cannot load the Animator Controller referenced by the shared posing Animator." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorの有効状態・EditorOnlyタグ・MA Merge Animatorの参照を確認してください。調整済みの生成ファイルは保持してください。", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorへ別のControllerを指定していないか確認してください。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorへ別のControllerを指定していないか確認してください。シーンを保存・バックアップしてから、ALCOM / VCCで商品本体と「ゆにさきポーズシステム」を再取得してください。入れ直しても直らない場合は、Inspector上部の「ヘルプ・変更履歴」から公式マニュアル・お問い合わせをご確認ください。調整済みのオブジェクトやGeneratedResourcesは削除しないでください。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "共通ポージングAnimatorを使用できません。「{0}」{1}。", "The common posing Animator is unavailable. \"{0}\" {1}." },
