    { "启用呼吸动画", "Animate breathing" },
    { "启用头像专属修正", "Enable avatar correction" },
    { "启用或禁用此项时内存用量的变化。\n头部锁定：1 bit，与翻身共用。\n若翻身已使用此参数，则不再增加bit。", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nNeck lock: 1 bit, shared with roll over.\nUses 0 additional bits if roll over already uses this parameter." },
    { "启用或禁用此项时内存用量的变化。\n翻身开关：1 bit；头部倾斜：8 bits；头部锁定：1 bit。\n其他选项已使用的参数只计算一次。", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
