    { "啟用或停用此項目時記憶體用量的變化。\n翻身開關：1 bit；頭部傾斜：8 bits；頭部鎖定：1 bit。\n其他選項已使用的參數只計算一次。", "The change in memory when enabling/disabling this option.\nRoll-over switch: 1 bit; head tilt: 8 bits; neck lock: 1 bit.\nParameters already used by other options are counted once." },
