    { "建立預設時發生錯誤。", "An error occurred while creating the preset." },
    { "建置時，以一般姿勢為中央，合成側向姿勢及其鏡像。使用各片段的第一個影格姿勢。中央為0.5，兩端為0和1。接地修正在0時關閉，0.25時為25%。", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
