    { "此項目使用舊座標格式。請在調整視窗中顯示參考虛擬化身，並執行一次「擷取目前手腳位置」。重新擷取前，將保留原始動畫中的肢體朝向。", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and run Capture current limb positions once. Until recaptured, the source animation’s limb orientation is kept." },
    { "此預設已刪除或無法套用至此工具。請選擇「重新載入」以更新清單。", "This preset was deleted or cannot be applied to this tool. Choose Reload to refresh the list." },
    { "此项使用旧坐标格式。请在调整窗口中显示参考头像，", "This entry uses the legacy coordinate format. Show the reference avatar in the adjustment window and " },
