    { "脚を伸ばしたときに、膝が逆向きに折れるのを抑えます。", "Prevent the knees from bending backward when the legs straighten." },
    { "脚全体の長さ（太もも＋すね）", "Full leg length (upper + lower)" },
    { "脚部高度", "Foot Height" },
    { "腕や脚の長さに合わせて、手足が自然な置き場所へ届くよう調整します。", "Adjust limbs to reach natural positions for this avatar's proportions." },
    { "腕固定", "Lock Arms" },
    { "腳部高度", "Foot Height" },
    { "膝がこの角度より伸びる前にクランプします。", "Limits knee extension before the bend becomes smaller than this angle." },
    { "膝が伸びきる手前で止める角度です。", "Stop the knee just before it fully straightens." },
    { "膝が逆向きに曲がるのを防ぐ", "Prevent reverse knee bending" },
    { "膝の補正", "Knee correction" },
    { "膝の計測に必要なHumanoid Animatorがありません。", "The Humanoid Animator needed for knee measurement is missing." },
    { "膝盖修正", "Knee correction" },
    { "膝蓋修正", "Knee correction" },
    { "臉部朝向校正需要Humanoid和原始Animation。", "Face-forward correction requires a Humanoid and the original Animation." },
    { "自分で用意したモーションを使う", "Use your own motions" },
    { "自分の頭が近くにあっても撮影できます。自分の画面だけに反映され、撮影終了後は通常の表示に戻ります。", "Keep your head visible locally for close-up photos. Normal visibility returns after Photo Mode." },
    { "自动修正不同头像的关节朝向和扭转差异。", "Automatically correct differences in joint direction and twist for each avatar." },
    { "自动导入仅在生成时使用，不会添加到此列表。手动禁用或清除的类型不会自动补齐。请使用“清除手动指定”恢复自动导入。", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "自动检测", "Auto-detect" },
    { "自動アバター補正", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "自動修正不同虛擬化身的關節朝向和扭轉差異。", "Automatically correct differences in joint direction and twist for each avatar." },
    { "自動偵測", "Auto-detect" },
    { "自動匯入僅在產生時使用，不會加入此清單。手動停用或清除的類型不會自動補齊。請使用「清除手動指定」恢復自動匯入。", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "自動取り込みの結果は生成時だけ使い、この一覧には追加しません。手動指定をOFFにした種類や、指定済みモーションを外した種類は自動で補完しません。自動取り込みに戻すには「手動指定を解除」を使います。", "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing." },
    { "自動姿勢IK設定", "Pose IK Catalog" },
    { "自動検出", "Auto-detect" },
    { "自動生成された補正", "Generated correction" },
    { "自動調整Animationの作成に失敗しました: {0}", "Failed to create the automatic adjustment animation: {0}" },
    { "自動足踏みに関する案内を非表示", "Hide Auto-Footsteps notices" },
    { "自定义", "Custom" },
    { "自定义动画", "Custom animation" },
    { "自訂", "Custom" },
    { "自訂動畫", "Custom animation" },
    { "與儲存時不同的項目（最多12項）", "Settings changed since saving (up to 12)" },
    { "與儲存時不同的預先建置設定", "Prebuild settings changed since saving" },
    { "與其他工具同時使用時，如果追蹤鎖定功能無法正常運作，請開啟此項。", "Enable this if tracking locks do not work correctly alongside other tools." },
    { "與其他工具整合追蹤鎖定", "Integrate tracking locks with other tools" },
    { "舊格式儲存資料（無法比較設定項目）", "Legacy saved data (settings cannot be compared)" },
    { "若已安装：", "If already installed:" },
    { "若已安裝：", "If already installed:" },
    { "若胸部姿势异常，请检查原始模型的Rig > Configure > Body中的Chest。Chest与Upper Chest是不同的配置项。若没有对应骨骼，请遵循作者原有设置。", "If the chest pose is incorrect, check Chest under Rig > Configure > Body on the original model. Chest and Upper Chest are separate assignments. If the model has no matching bone, follow the creator’s setup." },
    { "若胸部姿勢異常，請檢查原始模型的Rig > Configure > Body中的Chest。Chest與Upper Chest是不同的配置項目。若沒有對應骨骼，請遵循作者原有設定。", "If the chest pose is incorrect, check Chest under Rig > Configure > Body on the original model. Chest and Upper Chest are separate assignments. If the model has no matching bone, follow the creator’s setup." },
    { "若要使用此功能，請在「便利功能」中啟用「啟用呼吸動畫」。", "Enable Animate breathing under Convenience to use this feature." },
    { "若要使用此功能，請在「選單功能」中啟用「拍照模式」。", "Enable Photo Mode under Menu features to use this feature." },
    { "若要使用此功能，请在“便捷功能”中启用“启用呼吸动画”。", "Enable Animate breathing under Convenience to use this feature." },
    { "若要使用此功能，请在“菜单功能”中启用“拍照模式”。", "Enable Photo Mode under Menu features to use this feature." },
    { "若要在VRChat中使用，还需在“功能”页启用“翻身”。", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "若要在VRChat中使用，還需在「功能」頁啟用「翻身」。", "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat." },
    { "若要在此头像中使用姿势，请点击“选择对象”检查相关对象的标签和启用状态。", "To use poses on this avatar, choose Select object and check its tag and active state." },
    { "若要在此虛擬化身中使用姿勢，請按「選擇物件」檢查相關物件的標籤和啟用狀態。", "To use poses on this avatar, choose Select object and check its tag and active state." },
    { "若要重新啟用授權，請重新匯入授權安裝程式。", "To activate the license again, reimport the license installer." },
    { "若要重新激活许可证，请重新导入许可证安装程序。", "To activate the license again, reimport the license installer." },
    { "菜单功能", "Menu features" },
    { "菜单图标", "Menu icons" },
    { "落下（短め）", "Short fall" },
    { "落下（長め）", "Long fall" },
    { "處理：", "Action:" },
    { "處理：請在Window > General > Console中查看本次操作的第一個紅色錯誤。若檢查設定後仍無法解決，聯絡支援時請提供錯誤代碼、詳細資訊和工具版本。", "Action: In Window > General > Console, check the first red error from this operation. If checking settings does not resolve the issue, include the error code, details, and tool version when contacting support." },
    { "虛擬化身", "Avatar" },
    { "虛擬化身中仍有{0}的舊設定，可能造成衝突。請使用清理功能移除舊設定。若虛擬化身最初在Base層使用了自訂移動Animator Controller，請在清理後手動恢復。", "Legacy settings for {0} remain on this avatar and may cause conflicts. Use the cleanup command to remove them. If the avatar originally used a custom locomotion Animator Controller in its Base layer, restore that controller manually afterward." },
    { "虛擬化身初始姿勢已變更，將自動更新修正。", "The avatar rest pose changed. Corrections will update automatically." },
    { "虛擬化身名稱", "Avatar name" },
    { "虛擬化身建置時重新拍攝圖示，會包含透過Modular Avatar加入的服裝等內容。", "Outfits added with Modular Avatar are included when icons are retaken during the avatar build." },
    { "虛擬化身整合", "Avatar integration" },
    { "虛擬化身根物件上沒有Animator。", "The avatar root has no Animator." },
    { "虛擬化身根物件沒有Animator。請查看Inspector中的「檢查設定」。", "The avatar root has no Animator. See Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "虛擬化身自動修正", "Automatic avatar correction" },
    { "虛擬化身設定", "Avatar Setup" },
    { "虛擬化身高度", "Avatar height" },
    { "行った操作・起きたこと：", "What I did and what happened:" },
    { "衣装や見た目を変えたときに使います。設定を変えたときはプレビルドしてください。", "Use this after changing the outfit or appearance. Update the prebuild after changing settings." },
    { "複数のアニメーションをここにドロップ", "Drop animation clips here" },
    { "複数の手足を解き直す回数です。通常は2回です。", "The number of passes used to solve multiple limbs. Usually 2." },
    { "複製", "Copy" },
    { "複製して保存", "Copy/save" },
    { "複製する調整アニメーションが存在しません。", "There is no adjustment animation to duplicate." },
    { "複製上次失敗詳情", "Copy previous failure details" },
    { "複製並儲存全部調整資料？\n將複製並儲存有變更的調整動畫。", "Duplicate and save all adjustment data?\nAdjustment animations with changes will be duplicated and saved." },
    { "複製並儲存調整動畫，保留原先指定的檔案。", "Duplicates the adjustment animation and saves it. The originally assigned file is kept." },
    { "複製保存する変更はありませんでした。", "There were no changes to duplicate and save." },
    { "複製調整動畫。", "Duplicates the adjustment animation." },
    { "複製調整動畫並儲存變更值，保留原先指定的檔案。", "Duplicates adjustment animations and saves changed values. The originally assigned files are kept." },
    { "複製／儲存", "Copy/save" },
    { "要删除的文件夹：{0}\n其中的Prefab和动画也会被删除。若包含自定义或已调整的数据，请取消并按迁移说明操作。恢复已删除文件需要备份。", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "要刪除的資料夾：{0}\n其中的Prefab和動畫也會被刪除。若包含自訂或已調整的資料，請取消並依遷移說明操作。恢復已刪除檔案需要備份。", "Folder to delete: {0}\nThis also deletes the prefabs and animations inside it. If it contains custom or adjusted data, cancel and follow the migration instructions. A backup is needed to restore deleted files." },
    { "要套用的PosingSystem Prefab", "PosingSystem prefabs to apply" },
    { "要应用的PosingSystem Prefab", "PosingSystem prefabs to apply" },
    { "要移动的肢体", "Limb to move" },
    { "要移動的肢體", "Limb to move" },
    { "見た目の手足の向き", "Visible limb orientation" },
    { "規則名稱", "Rule name" },
    { "规则名称", "Rule name" },
    { "角度は度数で指定します。寝姿勢を選び、VRChatのメニューで首固定を解除して使ってください。", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
    { "角度以度为单位。请选择躺姿，并在VRChat菜单中解除头部锁定。", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
    { "角度以度為單位。請選擇躺姿，並在VRChat選單中解除頭部鎖定。", "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu." },
    { "解除头部锁定后，减轻头部朝向与原始姿势不同时产生的姿势变形。", "Reduce distortion when your head faces a different direction from the original pose with head lock off." },
    { "解除頭部鎖定後，減輕頭部朝向與原始姿勢不同時產生的姿勢變形。", "Reduce distortion when your head faces a different direction from the original pose with head lock off." },
    { "言語…", "Language..." },
    { "計測用クローンに有効な Humanoid Animator がありません。", "The measurement clone has no valid Humanoid Animator." },
    { "計算する順番", "Evaluation order" },
    { "計算の反復回数", "Solver iterations" },
    { "計算虛擬形象高度失敗。", "Failed to calculate the avatar's height." },
    { "計算順序", "Evaluation order" },
    { "記錄每個內建姿勢手腳目標的製作資料。", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "記錄每個內建姿勢手腳目標的製作資料。每個產品建立一個檔案，與各虛擬化身的設定分開儲存。", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "設定", "Settings" },
    { "設定にエラーがあります。Inspectorの「設定の確認」を開いてください。", "There are configuration errors. Open Check settings in the Inspector." },
    { "設定に問題があるため、ポーズの生成を開始できません。", "Pose generation could not start because of configuration errors." },
    { "設定の変更を保存しています…", "Saving config changes..." },
    { "設定の更新あり", "Settings changed" },
    { "設定の確認", "Check settings" },
    { "設定の確認、またはプレビルドの更新が必要です。Inspectorを確認してください。", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "設定を先に生成して、アバターのビルド時間を短縮します。", "Generate settings in advance to shorten avatar builds." },
    { "設定を再確認", "Check settings again" },
    { "設定已變更", "Settings changed" },
    { "設定播放位置", "Set playback position" },
    { "設有EditorOnly標籤", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "設為此分類的初始姿勢", "Set as default for this category" },
    { "診断", "Diagnostics " },
    { "診断 ", "Diagnostics " },
    { "診斷", "Diagnostics " },
    { "詢問此警告", "Ask about this warning" },
    { "詢問此錯誤", "Ask about this error" },
    { "該当するプリセットがありません。", "No matching presets." },
    { "該当する項目をポーズ一覧から削除し、必要なアニメーションを追加し直してください。", "Remove the missing entry from the pose list and add the required animation again." },
    { "詳情", "Details" },
    { "詳細", "Details" },
    { "詳細はConsoleを確認してください。", "Please see console for more details" },
    { "語言…", "Language..." },
    { "說明 / 更新紀錄", "Help / Changelog" },
    { "読み込み中…", "Loading..." },
    { "調整アニメーション", "Adjustment animation" },
    { "調整アニメーションを複製して保存しました。\n新しいファイル: {0}", "Duplicated and saved the adjustment animation.\nNew file: {0}" },
    { "調整アニメーションを複製して保存します。元々設定されていたファイルは変更されません", "Duplicates the adjustment animation and saves it. The originally assigned file is kept." },
    { "調整アニメーションを複製します。", "Duplicates the adjustment animation." },
    { "調整クリップ", "Adjustment clip" },
    { "調整値をすべて0にリセットします。", "Resets all adjustment values to zero." },
    { "調整値をファイルに保存します。", "Saves adjustment values to the file." },
    { "調整動畫", "Adjustment animation" },
    { "調整動畫片段", "Adjustment clip" },
    { "調整包括頭部在內的整個身體高度。地面高度以50%為原始高度，最多可上下調整3公尺。", "Move your whole body, including your head, up or down by up to 3 m. Floor Height is neutral at 50%." },
    { "調整匯入動作需要有效的Humanoid虛擬化身。", "Adjusting imported motions requires a valid Humanoid avatar." },
    { "調整可能なアニメーションが見つかりません。PosingSystem の設定を確認してください。", "No adjustable animations were found. Check the PosingSystem settings." },
    { "調整方向", "Adjust direction" },
    { "調整朝向", "Rotate direction" },
    { "調整結果をプレビューしています。", "Previewing the adjusted result." },
    { "請使用0到1之間的值。", "Use a value between 0 and 1." },
    { "請修復Console中的第一個編譯錯誤，等待編譯完成後再試。", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "請儲存並備份場景，然後透過ALCOM / VCC重新下載產品本體和Unisaki Posing System。若問題仍然存在，請開啟Inspector頂部的「說明／更新記錄」，查看手冊或聯絡支援。請保留已調整的物件和GeneratedResources。", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "請先確認候選片段，再進行新增。", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "請先複製虛擬人偶用Controller。不會將附加功能寫入原始發佈的Controller。", "Duplicate the avatar Controller first. Additional features will not be written to the distributed Controller." },
    { "請嘗試在Inspector中使用「更新預先建置」還原參照。", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "請在Animator的Avatar欄位中恢復此虛擬化身原始模型對應的Humanoid Avatar。請使用此模型的Avatar資源。", "Restore the Humanoid Avatar for this avatar’s original model in the Animator Avatar field. Use the Avatar asset for this model." },
    { "請在Hierarchy中重新選擇虛擬化身內的姿勢工具。", "Select the pose tool inside the avatar again in the Hierarchy." },
    { "請在Inspector的「檢查設定」中選擇相關物件，修正列出的問題後重試。", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "請在原始模型的Inspector > Rig中檢查Humanoid與Configure配置，並遵循虛擬化身作者建議的設定。", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "請在原始模型的Rig > Configure中檢查Head，並確認場景中未刪除頭部骨骼。", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "請在場景Hierarchy中選擇帶有VRC Avatar Descriptor的虛擬化身實例。不支援向Prefab資源或Prefab編輯模式中加入。", "Select an avatar instance with a VRC Avatar Descriptor in the scene Hierarchy. Adding to a prefab asset or Prefab Mode is not supported." },
    { "請在姿勢清單中啟用所需姿勢。若有意將此分類留空，則無需處理。", "Enable the desired poses in the pose list. No change is needed if this category is intentionally empty." },
    { "請在姿勢清單中指定動畫，或停用該項目。", "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry." },
    { "請在姿勢清單中檢查對應的動畫和調整片段。如需排查原因，請暫時停用該姿勢後重試。", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "請在姿勢清單中檢查該分類，並從預設或備份恢復。", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "請在該分類中只選擇一個初始姿勢。", "Select one default pose in that category." },
    { "請將此物件放入帶有VRCAvatarDescriptor元件的虛擬化身物件內。", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "請從姿勢清單中刪除遺失項目，並重新加入所需動畫。", "Remove the missing entry from the pose list and add the required animation again." },
    { "請恢復工具的標準Controller。此處不支援Animator Override Controller。", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here." },
    { "請恢復工具的標準Controller。此處不支援Animator Override Controller。\n請儲存並備份場景，然後透過ALCOM / VCC重新下載產品本體和Unisaki Posing System。若問題仍然存在，請開啟Inspector頂部的「說明／更新記錄」，查看手冊或聯絡支援。請保留已調整的物件和GeneratedResources。", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "請指定Mecanim支援的動畫。若動畫來自模型，也請檢查該模型的Rig設定。", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "請指定側向AnimationClip。若留空，則依原方式使用一般欄位中已完成的翻身動畫。", "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before." },
    { "請指定圖示圖片，或停用自訂圖示以使用自動產生的圖示。", "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons." },
    { "請查看Console", "See Console" },
    { "請檢查Console中是否有編譯錯誤或Missing Script元件。", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "請檢查Console中的Missing Prefab等匯入錯誤。重新開啟目標場景後再試。", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "請檢查Console中緊接之前的錯誤和VRChat Avatars SDK版本。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "請檢查Console中緊接之前的錯誤，以及Unity、VRChat Avatars SDK和Posing System的版本。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "請檢查共用姿勢Animator是否啟用、有無EditorOnly標籤，以及MA Merge Animator的參照是否正確。請保留已調整的產生檔案。", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "請檢查加入目標 [PS040]", "Check the destination [PS040]" },
    { "請檢查原始模型的Rig > Configure和場景中的Head骨骼。", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "請檢查原始虛擬形象的Animator和Avatar參照。", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "請檢查工具內的姿勢選單是否已刪除或停用。", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled." },
    { "請檢查工具內的姿勢選單是否已刪除或停用。\n請儲存並備份場景，然後透過ALCOM / VCC重新下載產品本體和Unisaki Posing System。若問題仍然存在，請開啟Inspector頂部的「說明／更新記錄」，查看手冊或聯絡支援。請保留已調整的物件和GeneratedResources。", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "請檢查是否為共用姿勢Animator配置了其他Controller。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "請檢查是否為共用姿勢Animator配置了其他Controller。\n請儲存並備份場景，然後透過ALCOM / VCC重新下載產品本體和Unisaki Posing System。若問題仍然存在，請開啟Inspector頂部的「說明／更新記錄」，查看手冊或聯絡支援。請保留已調整的物件和GeneratedResources。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "請檢查目標虛擬化身 [PS040]", "Check the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "請檢查與VRC Avatar Descriptor相同物件上的Animator，並與原始虛擬化身Prefab的設定比較。", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "請檢查虛擬形象根物件上Animator的Avatar欄位，以及原始模型的Rig設定。", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "請檢查虛擬形象的Humanoid設定和Head骨骼。詳細資訊請查看Console中的內部例外。", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "請檢查要套用IK的姿勢和虛擬化身。", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "請檢查設定或更新預先建置，詳情見Inspector。", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "請為Submenu Root指定此虛擬化身內的選單目標。", "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root." },
    { "請為中央和側向姿勢指定Humanoid動畫片段。不支援BlendTree、Legacy片段或沒有身體曲線的片段。", "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported." },
    { "請為此動作類型選擇包含移動動作的BlendTree。", "Choose a BlendTree containing locomotion for this motion type." },
    { "請為虛擬化身的Base層指定一般的Animator Controller。不支援Animator Override Controller。", "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported." },
    { "請確認恰有一個共用姿勢Animator已啟用，沒有EditorOnly標籤或Missing Script，且已安裝標準Prefab。", "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed." },
    { "請設定Motion Time參數名稱，或停用Motion Time。", "Set the Motion Time parameter name or disable Motion Time." },
    { "請輸入虛擬化身名稱。", "Enter the avatar name." },
    { "請選擇Assets內的資料夾和.anim檔名。", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "請選擇Humanoid虛擬化身和AnimationClip。", "Choose a Humanoid avatar and an AnimationClip." },
    { "請選擇加入目標 [PS040]", "Select a destination [PS040]" },
    { "請選擇動畫。", "Select an animation." },
    { "請選擇目標虛擬化身 [PS040]", "Select the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "請選擇預設", "Select a preset" },
    { "請重新套用預設，或與新加入的工具副本中的姿勢清單比較。", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool." },
    { "請重新套用預設，或與新加入的工具副本中的姿勢清單比較。\n請儲存並備份場景，然後透過ALCOM / VCC重新下載產品本體和Unisaki Posing System。若問題仍然存在，請開啟Inspector頂部的「說明／更新記錄」，查看手冊或聯絡支援。請保留已調整的物件和GeneratedResources。", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "請關閉Prefab編輯模式，將工具放入場景中帶有VRC Avatar Descriptor的虛擬化身內。無法單獨對Project視窗中的Prefab資源進行預先建置。", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "請關閉「動畫調整」等其他動畫預覽後重試。", "Close other animation previews, including Animation Adjustment, and try again." },
    { "請關閉「拍照模式中保持頭部可見」或合併現有VRC Head Chop元件，騰出一個元件的位置。", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "警告の表示設定", "Warning display settings" },
    { "警告显示设置", "Warning display settings" },
    { "警告顯示設定", "Warning display settings" },
    { "讀取參考姿勢失敗：{0}", "Failed to read the reference pose: {0}" },
    { "變更服裝或外觀後使用此功能。變更設定後請更新預先建置。", "Use this after changing the outfit or appearance. Update the prebuild after changing settings." },
    { "讓其他人也能看到拍照模式下的位置和朝向變化。僅本機拍攝時使用0 bit。", "Share Photo Mode position and rotation with others. Local-only photography uses 0 bits." },
    { "讓胸部等部位隨呼吸運動。可依姿勢設定強度，無需額外同步bit。", "Animate the chest with breathing. Set the strength per pose without extra sync bits." },
    { "计算虚拟形象高度失败。", "Failed to calculate the avatar's height." },
    { "计算顺序", "Evaluation order" },
    { "让其他人也能看到拍照模式下的位置和朝向变化。仅本地拍摄时使用0 bit。", "Share Photo Mode position and rotation with others. Local-only photography uses 0 bits." },
    { "让胸部等部位随呼吸运动。可按姿势设置强度，无需额外同步bit。", "Animate the chest with breathing. Set the strength per pose without extra sync bits." },
    { "记录每个内置姿势手脚目标的制作数据。", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. " },
    { "记录每个内置姿势手脚目标的制作数据。每个产品创建一个文件，与各头像的设置分开保存。", "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings." },
    { "许可证状态", "License status" },
    { "许可证状态\nCool Posing", "Cool Posing license status" },
    { "许可证状态\nKawaii Posing", "Kawaii Posing license status" },
    { "许可证状态 - Posing System", "Posing System license status" },
    { "许可证移除", "License removal" },
    { "设为此分类的初始姿势", "Set as default for this category" },
    { "设置", "Settings" },
    { "设置了EditorOnly标签", "has the EditorOnly tag" },
    { "设置已更改", "Settings changed" },
    { "设置播放位置", "Set playback position" },
    { "诊断", "Diagnostics " },
    { "详情", "Details" },
    { "语言…", "Language..." },
    { "请为Submenu Root指定此头像内的菜单目标。", "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root." },
    { "请为中央和侧向姿势指定Humanoid动画片段。不支持BlendTree、Legacy片段或没有身体曲线的片段。", "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported." },
    { "请为头像的Base层指定常规Animator Controller。不支持Animator Override Controller。", "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported." },
    { "请为此动作类型选择包含移动动作的BlendTree。", "Choose a BlendTree containing locomotion for this motion type." },
    { "请从姿势列表中删除缺失项，并重新添加所需动画。", "Remove the missing entry from the pose list and add the required animation again." },
    { "请使用0到1之间的值。", "Use a value between 0 and 1." },
    { "请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。", "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "请修复Console中的第一个编译错误，等待编译完成后再试。", "Fix the first compilation error in the Console, wait for compilation to finish, then try again." },
    { "请先复制头像用Controller。不会将附加功能写入原始发布的Controller。", "Duplicate the avatar Controller first. Additional features will not be written to the distributed Controller." },
    { "请先确认候选片段，再进行添加。", "Review the candidates before adding them." },
    { "请关闭Prefab编辑模式，将工具放入场景中带有VRC Avatar Descriptor的头像内。无法单独对Project窗口中的Prefab资源进行预构建。", "Close Prefab Mode and place the tool inside a scene avatar with a VRC Avatar Descriptor. A prefab asset in the Project window cannot be prebuilt by itself." },
    { "请关闭“动画调整”等其他动画预览后重试。", "Close other animation previews, including Animation Adjustment, and try again." },
    { "请关闭“拍照模式中保持头部可见”或合并现有VRC Head Chop组件，腾出一个组件的位置。", "Turn off \"Keep your head visible in Photo Mode\" or consolidate existing VRC Head Chop components to free one component slot." },
    { "请在Animator的Avatar字段中恢复此头像原始模型对应的Humanoid Avatar。请使用此模型的Avatar资源。", "Restore the Humanoid Avatar for this avatar’s original model in the Animator Avatar field. Use the Avatar asset for this model." },
    { "请在Hierarchy中重新选择头像内的姿势工具。", "Select the pose tool inside the avatar again in the Hierarchy." },
    { "请在Inspector的“检查设置”中选择相关对象，修正列出的问题后重试。", "Select the affected object under Check settings in the Inspector, correct the listed issues, and try again." },
    { "请在原始模型的Inspector > Rig中检查Humanoid与Configure分配，并遵循头像作者推荐的设置。", "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup." },
    { "请在原始模型的Rig > Configure中检查Head，并确认场景中未删除头部骨骼。", "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene." },
    { "请在场景Hierarchy中选择带有VRC Avatar Descriptor的头像实例。不支持向Prefab资源或Prefab编辑模式中添加。", "Select an avatar instance with a VRC Avatar Descriptor in the scene Hierarchy. Adding to a prefab asset or Prefab Mode is not supported." },
    { "请在姿势列表中启用所需姿势。若有意将此分类留空，则无需处理。", "Enable the desired poses in the pose list. No change is needed if this category is intentionally empty." },
    { "请在姿势列表中指定动画，或禁用该项。", "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry." },
    { "请在姿势列表中检查对应的动画和调整片段。如需排查原因，请暂时禁用该姿势后重试。", "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again." },
    { "请在姿势列表中检查该分类，并从预设或备份恢复。", "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup." },
    { "请在该分类中只选择一个初始姿势。", "Select one default pose in that category." },
    { "请将此对象放入带有VRCAvatarDescriptor组件的头像对象内。", "Place this object inside an avatar object with a VRCAvatarDescriptor component." },
    { "请尝试在Inspector中使用“更新预构建”恢复引用。", "Try restoring it with Update prebuild in the Inspector." },
    { "请恢复工具的标准Controller。此处不支持Animator Override Controller。", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here." },
    { "请恢复工具的标准Controller。此处不支持Animator Override Controller。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。", "Restore the tool’s standard controller. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported here.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "请指定Mecanim支持的动画。若动画来自模型，也请检查该模型的Rig设置。", "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings." },
    { "请指定侧向AnimationClip。若留空，则按原方式使用常规栏中已完成的翻身动画。", "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before." },
    { "请指定图标图片，或禁用自定义图标以使用自动生成的图标。", "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons." },
    { "请查看Console", "See Console" },
    { "请检查Console中是否有编译错误或Missing Script组件。", "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components." },
    { "请检查Console中的Missing Prefab等导入错误。重新打开目标场景后再试。", "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again." },
    { "请检查Console中紧接之前的错误和VRChat Avatars SDK版本。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version." },
    { "请检查Console中紧接之前的错误，以及Unity、VRChat Avatars SDK和Posing System的版本。", "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System." },
    { "请检查与VRC Avatar Descriptor同一对象上的Animator，并与原始头像Prefab的设置比较。", "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab." },
    { "请检查共用姿势Animator是否启用、有无EditorOnly标签，以及MA Merge Animator的引用是否正确。请保留已调整的生成文件。", "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files." },
    { "请检查原始模型的Rig > Configure和场景中的Head骨骼。", "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene." },
    { "请检查原始虚拟形象的Animator和Avatar引用。", "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference." },
    { "请检查工具内的姿势菜单是否被删除或禁用。", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled." },
    { "请检查工具内的姿势菜单是否被删除或禁用。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。", "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "请检查是否给共用姿势Animator分配了其他Controller。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator." },
    { "请检查是否给共用姿势Animator分配了其他Controller。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。", "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
    { "请检查添加目标 [PS040]", "Check the destination [PS040]" },
    { "请检查目标头像 [PS040]", "Check the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "请检查虚拟形象根对象上Animator的Avatar字段，以及原始模型的Rig设置。", "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings." },
    { "请检查虚拟形象的Humanoid设置和Head骨骼。详细信息请查看Console中的内部异常。", "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details." },
    { "请检查要应用IK的姿势和头像。", "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied." },
    { "请检查设置或更新预构建，详情见Inspector。", "Review the settings or update the prebuild. Check the Inspector." },
    { "请确认恰有一个共用姿势Animator处于启用状态，没有EditorOnly标签或Missing Script，且已安装标准Prefab。", "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed." },
    { "请设置Motion Time参数名，或禁用Motion Time。", "Set the Motion Time parameter name or disable Motion Time." },
    { "请输入头像名称。", "Enter the avatar name." },
    { "请选择Assets内的文件夹和.anim文件名。", "Choose a folder inside Assets and an .anim filename." },
    { "请选择Humanoid头像和AnimationClip。", "Choose a Humanoid avatar and an AnimationClip." },
    { "请选择动画。", "Select an animation." },
    { "请选择添加目标 [PS040]", "Select a destination [PS040]" },
    { "请选择目标头像 [PS040]", "Select the target avatar [PS040]" },
    { "请选择预设", "Select a preset" },
    { "请重新应用预设，或与新添加的工具副本中的姿势列表比较。", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool." },
    { "请重新应用预设，或与新添加的工具副本中的姿势列表比较。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。", "Reapply a preset or compare the pose list with a newly added copy of the tool.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources." },
