    { "选择预设", "Select preset" },
    { "透過縮圖更容易辨認姿勢。虛擬化身建置時間會略有增加。", "Use thumbnails to identify poses. Avatar builds take a little longer." },
    { "通常のアニメーションを中央にし、横向きの姿勢と左右反転をビルド時に合成します。各クリップの最初の姿勢を使用します。中央は0.5、左右端は0と1です。接地補正は0で無効、0.25で25％です。", "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25." },
    { "通常は1です。小さくすると元の姿勢を多く残します。", "Usually 1. Lower values retain more of the source pose." },
    { "通常は「メニュー名_姿勢名」です。調整ウィンドウから追加すると自動入力されます。", "Normally menuName_poseName. Adding an entry from the adjustment window fills it automatically." },
    { "通常は元の姿勢を維持します。対象アバターへ元Animationを適用した直後と同じ側へ曲げます。", "Normally preserves the source pose, bending to the same side as immediately after applying the source animation to the target avatar." },
    { "通常为1。数值越低，保留的原始姿势越多。", "Usually 1. Lower values retain more of the source pose." },
    { "通常为menuName_poseName。从调整窗口添加时会自动填写。", "Normally menuName_poseName. Adding an entry from the adjustment window fills it automatically." },
    { "通常保留原始姿势，弯向将原始动画应用到目标头像后相同的一侧。", "Normally preserves the source pose, bending to the same side as immediately after applying the source animation to the target avatar." },
    { "通常保留原始姿勢，彎向將原始動畫套用至目標虛擬化身後相同的一側。", "Normally preserves the source pose, bending to the same side as immediately after applying the source animation to the target avatar." },
    { "通常為1。數值越低，保留的原始姿勢越多。", "Usually 1. Lower values retain more of the source pose." },
    { "通常為menuName_poseName。從調整視窗加入時會自動填寫。", "Normally menuName_poseName. Adding an entry from the adjustment window fills it automatically." },
    { "通过缩略图更容易辨认姿势。头像构建时间会略有增加。", "Use thumbnails to identify poses. Avatar builds take a little longer." },
    { "連携するには「添い寝ツール」本体を先にインポートしてください。可愛いポーズ単体で使う場合は「可愛いポーズツール追加」を選んでください。", "Import the Sleep-together tool before adding this integration. To use Kawaii Posing by itself, select Add Kawaii Posing." },
