    { "Cannot add prefab [PS043]", "Tidak dapat menambahkan prefab [PS043]" },
    { "Cannot get the Head bone needed to keep the head visible during photography.", "Tulang Head yang diperlukan agar kepala tetap terlihat saat memotret tidak dapat diperoleh." },
    { "Cannot identify the destination scene or Prefab.", "Scene atau Prefab tujuan tidak dapat diidentifikasi." },
    { "Cannot load prefab [PS042]", "Tidak dapat memuat prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Cannot load the Animator Controller referenced by the shared posing Animator.", "Animator Controller yang dirujuk oleh Animator pose bersama tidak dapat dimuat." },
    { "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode.", "Prefab di Project tidak dapat diubah langsung. Jalankan prabuild pada avatar di scene atau dalam mode Prefab." },
    { "Cannot prebuild. Check avatar placement, Animator and Humanoid settings under Check settings in the Inspector.", "Tidak dapat melakukan prabuild. Periksa penempatan avatar, Animator, dan Humanoid pada pemeriksaan pengaturan di Inspector." },
    { "Cannot write imported results to the distributed source Controller.", "Hasil impor tidak dapat ditulis ke Controller sumber yang didistribusikan." },
    { "Category {0}", "Kategori {0}" },
    { "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components.", "Periksa Console untuk menemukan kesalahan kompilasi atau komponen Missing Script." },
    { "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene.", "Periksa Head di Rig > Configure model asli dan pastikan tulang kepala masih ada dalam adegan." },
    { "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup.", "Periksa Humanoid dan penetapan Configure di pengaturan Inspector > Rig model asli. Ikuti pengaturan yang disarankan pembuat avatar." },
    { "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene.", "Periksa Rig > Configure pada model asli dan tulang Head di scene." },
    { "Check settings", "Periksa pengaturan" },
    { "Check settings again", "Periksa pengaturan lagi" },
    { "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup.", "Periksa kategori itu pada daftar pose dan pulihkan dari prasetel atau cadangan." },
    { "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed.", "Pastikan hanya satu Animator pose bersama yang aktif, tidak memiliki tag EditorOnly atau Missing Script, dan prefab standar sudah terpasang." },
    { "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files.", "Pastikan Animator pose bersama aktif, tidak memiliki tag EditorOnly, dan memiliki referensi MA Merge Animator yang benar. Pertahankan berkas hasil pembuatan yang telah Anda sesuaikan." },
    { "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab.", "Periksa Animator pada objek yang sama dengan VRC Avatar Descriptor dan bandingkan pengaturannya dengan prefab avatar asli." },
    { "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings.", "Periksa kolom Avatar pada Animator di akar avatar dan pengaturan Rig model asli." },
    { "Check the Console for error details.", "Periksa Console" },
    { "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again.", "Periksa kesalahan impor seperti Missing Prefab di Console. Buka kembali adegan tujuan lalu coba lagi." },
    { "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the target scene and try again.", "Periksa kesalahan impor seperti Missing Prefab di Console. Buka kembali adegan tujuan lalu coba lagi." },
    { "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again.", "Periksa animasi dan klip penyesuaian terkait dalam daftar pose. Untuk mengisolasi masalah, nonaktifkan sementara pose tersebut lalu coba lagi." },
    { "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details.", "Periksa pengaturan Humanoid dan tulang Head avatar. Lihat pengecualian internal di Console untuk detail." },
    { "Check the destination [PS040]", "Periksa tujuan [PS040]" },
    { "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference.", "Periksa Animator avatar asli dan referensi Avatar." },
    { "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied.", "Periksa pose dan avatar yang akan diberi IK." },
    { "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version.", "Periksa kesalahan sebelumnya di Console dan versi VRChat Avatars SDK." },
    { "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System.", "Periksa kesalahan sebelumnya di Console serta versi Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK, dan Posing System." },
    { "Check the target avatar [PS040]", "Periksa avatar tujuan [PS040]" },
    { "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.", "Periksa apakah Controller lain telah ditetapkan ke Animator pose bersama." },
    { "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources.", "Periksa apakah Controller lain telah ditetapkan ke Animator pose bersama.\nSimpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources." },
    { "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.", "Periksa apakah menu pose di dalam alat telah dihapus atau dinonaktifkan." },
    { "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources.", "Periksa apakah menu pose di dalam alat telah dihapus atau dinonaktifkan.\nSimpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources." },
