    { "Prefab to find:", "Prefab yang dicari:" },
    { "Prefab to find: {0}\nThe purchased license installer alone does not complete product installation. In ALCOM / VCC, make sure the product and Unisaki Posing System are added to this project.\nIf already installed: {1}", "Prefab yang dicari: {0}\nPenginstal lisensi yang dibeli saja belum menyelesaikan pemasangan produk. Di ALCOM / VCC, pastikan produk dan Unisaki Posing System ditambahkan ke proyek.\nJika sudah terpasang: {1}" },
