    { "Save and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources.", "Simpan dan cadangkan adegan, lalu unduh kembali produk serta Unisaki Posing System melalui ALCOM / VCC. Jika masalah berlanjut, buka bantuan dan perubahan di bagian atas Inspector untuk panduan serta dukungan. Pertahankan objek yang telah disesuaikan dan GeneratedResources." },
