    { "A custom icon is enabled for item {1} ({2}) in {0}, but no image is assigned.", "{0}中第{1}项（{2}）已启用自定义图标，但未指定图片。" },
    { "A preset for {0} was found. Apply it to adjust the poses to this avatar?", "找到适用于{0}的预设。是否应用以使姿势适合此头像？" },
    { "Action:", "处理：" },
    { "Action: In Window > General > Console, check the first red error from this operation. If checking settings does not resolve the issue, include the error code, details, and tool version when contacting support.", "处理：请在Window > General > Console中查看本次操作的第一个红色错误。若检查设置后仍无法解决，联系支持时请提供错误代码、详细信息和工具版本。" },
    { "Add", "添加" },
