    { "Add Kawaii Posing", "添加 Kawaii Posing" },
    { "Add Photo Mode to move up to 3 m forward and rotate for a better view of yourself.", "添加拍照模式，可向前移动最多3米并旋转，调整从自己视角看到的位置。" },
    { "Add Posing System", "添加 Posing System" },
    { "Add a menu toggle to mirror your pose.", "在菜单中添加左右镜像开关，需要时可将姿势左右翻转。" },
    { "Add a toggle to lock finger gestures, even when gripping the controller.", "在菜单中添加手指姿势锁定开关。锁定后，即使握紧控制器也能保持手型。" },
