    { "Add {0} to {1}", "向{1}添加{0}" },
    { "AddStateMachineBehaviour failed. Another tool may have raised an earlier error. Resolve the first relevant Console error before building or uploading the avatar again.", "AddStateMachineBehaviour失败。其他工具可能已先产生错误。请先解决Console中最早的相关错误，再重新构建或上传头像。" },
