    { "Almost done!", "完成" },
    { "Already installed", "已安装" },
    { "Also enable Roll Over in the Features tab to use this in VRChat.", "若要在VRChat中使用，还需在“功能”页启用“翻身”。" },
    { "An Animator condition references an undeclared parameter. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is used in a condition but is absent from the Animator Controller Parameters list. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility.", "Animator条件引用了未声明的参数。文件{0}的层{1}中使用了参数{2}，但Animator Controller的Parameters列表中没有此参数。请联系使用此参数的工具开发者确认兼容性。" },
    { "An Animator condition uses an incompatible parameter type. In file {0}, layer {1}, parameter {2} is declared as {3}, but condition {4} is used. This may prevent features from working correctly. Contact the developer of the tool that uses this parameter about compatibility.", "Animator条件使用了不兼容的参数类型。文件{0}的层{1}中，参数{2}声明为{3}，却使用条件{4}，可能导致功能异常。请联系使用此参数的工具开发者确认兼容性。" },
    { "An error occurred while creating the preset.", "创建预设时发生错误。" },
    { "Angles are in degrees. Select a lying pose and unlock the head in the VRChat menu.", "角度以度为单位。请选择躺姿，并在VRChat菜单中解除头部锁定。" },
    { "Animate breathing", "启用呼吸动画" },
    { "Animate the chest with breathing. Set the strength per pose without extra sync bits.", "让胸部等部位随呼吸运动。可按姿势设置强度，无需额外同步bit。" },
