    { "Ask about this warning", "咨询此警告" },
    { "Assign Humanoid clips for the center and side poses. BlendTrees, Legacy clips, and clips without body curves are unsupported.", "请为中央和侧向姿势指定Humanoid动画片段。不支持BlendTree、Legacy片段或没有身体曲线的片段。" },
    { "Assign a menu target inside this avatar to Submenu Root.", "请为Submenu Root指定此头像内的菜单目标。" },
    { "Assign a regular Animator Controller to the avatar’s Base layer. Animator Override Controllers are unsupported.", "请为头像的Base层指定常规Animator Controller。不支持Animator Override Controller。" },
    { "Assign a sideways AnimationClip. If empty, the completed roll-over animation in the regular field is used as before.", "请指定侧向AnimationClip。若留空，则按原方式使用常规栏中已完成的翻身动画。" },
    { "Assign an animation in the pose list or disable that entry.", "请在姿势列表中指定动画，或禁用该项。" },
    { "Assign an animation supported by Mecanim. If it comes from a model, check that model’s Rig settings.", "请指定Mecanim支持的动画。若动画来自模型，也请检查该模型的Rig设置。" },
    { "Assign an icon image or disable the custom icon to use generated icons.", "请指定图标图片，或禁用自定义图标以使用自动生成的图标。" },
    { "At build time, combine the regular pose at the center with the sideways pose and its mirror. The first frame of each clip is used. Center is 0.5; endpoints are 0 and 1. Ground correction is off at 0 and 25% at 0.25.", "构建时，以常规姿势为中央，合成侧向姿势及其镜像。使用各片段的第一帧姿势。中央为0.5，两端为0和1。接地修正在0时关闭，0.25时为25%。" },
    { "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. ", "记录每个内置姿势手脚目标的制作数据。" },
    { "Authoring data that records hand and foot targets for each included pose. Create one file per product; it is separate from per-avatar settings.", "记录每个内置姿势手脚目标的制作数据。每个产品创建一个文件，与各头像的设置分开保存。" },
    { "Auto-Footsteps is on. If your feet move unexpectedly during poses, turn it off below and compare. Leave it as is if there is no issue.", "Auto-Footsteps已开启。若摆姿势时双脚意外移动，可在下方关闭后比较。若没有问题，则无需更改。" },
    { "Auto-Lock Head When Supine", "仰卧时自动锁定头部" },
