    { "Automatic avatar correction", "头像自动修正" },
    { "Automatic imports are used during generation and are not added to this list. Types disabled or cleared manually are not auto-filled. Use Clear manual selection to restore automatic importing.", "自动导入仅在生成时使用，不会添加到此列表。手动禁用或清除的类型不会自动补齐。请使用“清除手动指定”恢复自动导入。" },
    { "Automatic limb adjustment", "手脚自动调整" },
