    { "Cannot load prefab [PS042]", "无法加载Prefab [PS042]" },
    { "Cannot load the Animator Controller referenced by the shared posing Animator.", "无法加载共用姿势Animator引用的Animator Controller。" },
    { "Cannot modify a Prefab directly in the Project. Prebuild an avatar in the scene or in Prefab Mode.", "无法直接修改Project中的Prefab。请对场景中的头像或在Prefab模式下执行预构建。" },
    { "Cannot prebuild. Check avatar placement, Animator and Humanoid settings under Check settings in the Inspector.", "无法预构建。请在Inspector的“检查设置”中检查头像位置、Animator和Humanoid设置。" },
    { "Cannot write imported results to the distributed source Controller.", "无法将导入结果写入随工具分发的源Controller。" },
    { "Category {0}", "分类{0}" },
    { "Check Console for compilation errors or Missing Script components.", "请检查Console中是否有编译错误或Missing Script组件。" },
    { "Check Head in the original model’s Rig > Configure settings and make sure the head bone is still present in the scene.", "请在原始模型的Rig > Configure中检查Head，并确认场景中未删除头部骨骼。" },
    { "Check Humanoid and Configure assignments in the original model’s Inspector > Rig settings. Follow the avatar creator’s recommended setup.", "请在原始模型的Inspector > Rig中检查Humanoid与Configure分配，并遵循头像作者推荐的设置。" },
    { "Check Rig > Configure on the original model and the Head bone in the scene.", "请检查原始模型的Rig > Configure和场景中的Head骨骼。" },
    { "Check settings", "检查设置" },
    { "Check settings again", "重新检查设置" },
    { "Check that category in the pose list and restore it from a preset or backup.", "请在姿势列表中检查该分类，并从预设或备份恢复。" },
    { "Check that exactly one shared posing Animator is active, that it has no EditorOnly tag or Missing Script, and that the standard prefab is installed.", "请确认恰有一个共用姿势Animator处于启用状态，没有EditorOnly标签或Missing Script，且已安装标准Prefab。" },
    { "Check that the shared posing Animator is active, has no EditorOnly tag, and has the correct MA Merge Animator reference. Keep your adjusted generated files.", "请检查共用姿势Animator是否启用、有无EditorOnly标签，以及MA Merge Animator的引用是否正确。请保留已调整的生成文件。" },
    { "Check the Animator on the same object as the VRC Avatar Descriptor and compare its settings with the original avatar prefab.", "请检查与VRC Avatar Descriptor同一对象上的Animator，并与原始头像Prefab的设置比较。" },
    { "Check the Avatar field of the Animator on the avatar root and the original model's Rig settings.", "请检查虚拟形象根对象上Animator的Avatar字段，以及原始模型的Rig设置。" },
    { "Check the Console for error details.", "请查看Console" },
    { "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the destination scene and try again.", "请检查Console中的Missing Prefab等导入错误。重新打开目标场景后再试。" },
    { "Check the Console for import errors such as Missing Prefab. Reopen the target scene and try again.", "请检查Console中的Missing Prefab等导入错误。重新打开目标场景后再试。" },
    { "Check the affected animation and adjustment clip in the pose list. To isolate the problem, temporarily disable that pose and try again.", "请在姿势列表中检查对应的动画和调整片段。如需排查原因，请暂时禁用该姿势后重试。" },
    { "Check the avatar's Humanoid settings and Head bone. See the inner exception in Console for details.", "请检查虚拟形象的Humanoid设置和Head骨骼。详细信息请查看Console中的内部异常。" },
    { "Check the destination [PS040]", "请检查添加目标 [PS040]" },
    { "Check the original avatar's Animator and Avatar reference.", "请检查原始虚拟形象的Animator和Avatar引用。" },
    { "Check the pose and avatar to which IK should be applied.", "请检查要应用IK的姿势和头像。" },
    { "Check the preceding errors in Console and the VRChat Avatars SDK version.", "请检查Console中紧接之前的错误和VRChat Avatars SDK版本。" },
    { "Check the preceding errors in Console and the versions of Unity, VRChat Avatars SDK and Posing System.", "请检查Console中紧接之前的错误，以及Unity、VRChat Avatars SDK和Posing System的版本。" },
    { "Check the target avatar [PS040]", "请检查目标头像 [PS040]" },
    { "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.", "请检查是否给共用姿势Animator分配了其他Controller。" },
    { "Check whether another controller has been assigned to the shared posing Animator.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources.", "请检查是否给共用姿势Animator分配了其他Controller。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。" },
    { "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.", "请检查工具内的姿势菜单是否被删除或禁用。" },
    { "Check whether the pose menu inside the tool has been deleted or disabled.\nSave and back up your scene, then download the product and Unisaki Posing System again using ALCOM / VCC. If the problem continues, open Help / Changelog at the top of the Inspector for the manual and support. Keep your adjusted objects and GeneratedResources.", "请检查工具内的姿势菜单是否被删除或禁用。\n请保存并备份场景，然后通过ALCOM / VCC重新下载产品本体和Unisaki Posing System。若问题仍然存在，请打开Inspector顶部的“帮助／更新记录”，查看手册或联系支持。请保留已调整的对象和GeneratedResources。" },
